<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- Kutu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mwan</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha ichanduso cha Musa kikemigwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mwanduso</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli yenyego ipapa twaga da ikitabu kino kwa Kigiliki Genesisi yofambula “Mwanduso.” Na vivo kikemigwa ikitabu kino cha ichanduso cha dilagano da umwaka. Ikitabu kino chosonga na mbuli ya “Baho haichanduso.” Kitabu kino chotulagusila vinhu vose kuvilawile, na Imulungu viyasongile kuwalumba wanhu. Iwanhu oifunza mbuli za Bibilia sambi wana magesa mbasakanyo mbasakanyo mbuli ya munhu hebu wanhu wachandike kitabu kino cha Mwanduso, na kipindi gani vichandikigwe. Hana wanhu ogesa kamba kitabu kino chandikigwa kulawa mvitabu va umwaka mkipindi cha kaline ya 5-6 ako Babeli, Kilisito yang'hali Kuvumbuka. Wayagwe otogola gaja gotogoligwa na wanhu wengi kamba Musa ayo yandike kitabu kino cha Mwanduso, na vivija kandika vitabu va Kulawa na Mbuli za Walawi na Kupetigwa na Kumbukumbu da Malagizo muumwaka kamba wa 1300 hebu 1400, Kilisito yang'hali Kuvumbuka.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Mwanduso kimema mbuli zilondigwa ng'hani kuwataza wanhu ili wazijuwe goya mbuli ziyagwe za Bibilia, zili mdilagano da umwaka na mdilagano da sambi. Kitabu cha Mwanduso chotulagusila nzambi viingile mwiisi yose, na wanhu wose viwomulonda Mkombola. Kitabu kino vivija cholagusa kunze kunze magesa ga Imulungu ga kuwakombola wanhu. Mbuli ino yotogoligwa kwa utula ndagu wa ichanduso mbuli ya Yesu (Mwanduso 3:15), na Mndewa Imulungu viyamulongele Abulahamu kamba kowatenda wamwede iwanhu wa isi zose (Mwanduso 12:3).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Imulungu kalumba isi na kawalumba Adamu na Hawa kamba viisimuliligwa mwiisula ya 1 na sula ya 2.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 3 mbaka ya 5 zowasimulila Adamu na Hawa, nzambi yao na ulelo wao.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 6 mbaka ya 9 zomsimulila Nuhu na dija disika dikulu.</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho ikitabu cha Mwanduso chosimulila kija kilawilile hagati ya ikipindi cha Nuhu na ikipindi cha Abulahamu, na vivija cholonga mbuli ya dilingo da Babeli mwiisula ya 10 na sula ya 11.</para>
  <para style="io">Sula ya 12 mbaka sula ya 50 zomulonga Abulahamu na ulelo wake na ukusonga kwa iwanhu wa isi ya Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io2">Viyakalile Abulahamu na mwehe wake Sala yosimuliligwa mwiisula ya 12 mbaka sula ya 25.</para>
  <para style="io2">Viyakalile Isaka na mwehe wake Lebeka yosimuliligwa mwiisula ya 21 mbaka sula ya 25 na ifa ya Isaka yosimuliligwa mwiisula ya 35.</para>
  <para style="io2">Viwakalile Yakobo na wanage na viwasegele kulawa mwiisi ya Kanaani kuchola isi ya Misili vosimuliligwa mwiisula ya 25 mbaka sula ya 50.</para>
  <para style="io2">Sula ya 37 mbaka sula ya 50 imema mbuli za mwana iyomnogela ng'hani Yakobo, na viyezile kutendigwa mtawala mwiisi ya Misili.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kulumbigwa kwa Isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1"/>Baho haichanduso, Imulungu kalumba ulanga na isi, <verse eid="GEN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2"/>isi ikala chakachaka na ikala yabule kinhu. Ziza dikala digubike kila hanhu mgamazi na Loho wa Imulungu kakala yenele mgamazi gose. <verse eid="GEN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3"/>Imulungu kalonga, “Hawe na mulenge,” na mulenge wiza. <verse eid="GEN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4"/>Imulungu kona mulenge unoga. Abaho Imulungu kaugola mulenge na ziza, <verse eid="GEN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5"/>mulenge kaukema, “Imisi,” na ziza kadikema, “Ikilo.” Ikala ichungulo, ikala imitondo, siku da ichanduso.<verse eid="GEN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6"/>Imulungu kalonga, “Hawe na nyafasi hagati ya mazi, igagole mazi na mazi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7"/>Avo Imulungu katenda nyafasi, kagagola mazi geli uchanha na mazi geli hasi. Na vivo isang'hanike. <verse eid="GEN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8"/>Imulungu kaikema nyafasi ayo, “Ulanga.” Ikala ichungulo, ikala imitondo, siku da kabili.<verse eid="GEN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9"/>Imulungu kalonga, “Mazi geli hasi ya ulanga gailundize hamoja ili isi inyalile yoneke.” Na vivo isang'hanike. <verse eid="GEN 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10"/>Imulungu kahakema hanhu hanyalile, “Isi,” na mazi gailundize kagakema, “Bahali.” Imulungu kona vinoga.<verse eid="GEN 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11"/>Abaho Imulungu kalonga, “Isi yoteze kila aina ya minoga, mibiki na mijani, ija ilela mbeyu na ija ilela matunda ili vigendelele.” Na vivo isang'hanike. <verse eid="GEN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12"/>Avo, isi yoteza mibiki na mijani ilelaga mbeyu mbasakanyo mbasakanyo, na ilelaga matunda mbasakanyo mbasakanyo ili vigendelele. Imulungu kona vinoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13"/>Ikala ichungulo, ikala imitondo, siku da kadatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14"/>Abaho Imulungu kalonga, “Hawe na milenge kuulanga, iigole imisi na ikilo, ilaguse misimu ya kutambika, siku na miyaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15"/>na ing'ale kuulanga na kuimwemwesela isi” Na vivo isang'hanike. <verse eid="GEN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16"/>Avo Imulungu kalumba milenge mikulu mibili, zuwa ditawala imisi na mwezi utawala ikilo, vivija kalumba nhondo. <verse eid="GEN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17"/>Imulungu kaika milenge ayo kuulanga imwemwesele isi yose, <verse eid="GEN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18"/>itawale imisi na ikilo, na kuugola mulenge na ziza. Imulungu kona vinoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19"/>Ikala ichungulo, ikala imitondo, siku da ikane.<verse eid="GEN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20"/>Imulungu kalonga, “Mazi gamemezwe vinhu vili na ugima na ulanga umemezwe ndege oguluka.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21"/>Avo Imulungu kalumba ming'onyo mikulu mwiibahali, na vinhu vili na ugima vikogela mgamazi na kalumba madali ga ndege wose ili vigendelele. Imulungu kona vinoga. <verse eid="GEN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22"/>Imulungu kavinogela kalonga, mwengezeke na kuimemeza ibahali na ndege wengezeke mwiisi yose. <verse eid="GEN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23"/>Ikala ichungulo, ikala imitondo, siku ya itano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24"/>Imulungu kalonga, “Isi ilave vinhu vose vili na ugima mbasakanyo mbasakanyo, wanyama ofugigwa, wang'onyo otambala na wanyama wa kumuhulo ili vigendelele,” na vivo isang'hanike. <verse eid="GEN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25"/>Avo Imulungu kalumba wanyama wose mbasakanyo mbasakanyo, wanyama wa kumuhulo, wanyama ofugigwa na wang'onyo otambala ili vigendelele. Imulungu kona vinoga.<verse eid="GEN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26"/>Abaho Imulungu kalonga, “Sambi tulumbe munhu yaigalile na siye kamba vitwili, yatawale somba weli mwiibahali, ndege na wanyama wose, ofugigwa na weli kumuhulo na wang'onyo wose otambala mwiisi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27"/>Avo Imulungu kalumba munhu yaigalile na heyo. Kalumba mbigalo na mtwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28"/>Imulungu kalagusa moyo unogile kumwao, kalonga, “Leleni mwengezeke, mwiimemeze isi yose na kuitawala. Nowatenda mweye muwatawale somba na ndege na wang'onyo wose ogenda mwiisi.”<verse eid="GEN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29"/>Abaho Imulungu kalonga, “Loleni, nowagwaa kila mnoga mwiisi ulelaga mbeyu na kila biki dilelaga matunda geli na mbeyu mgati, vokuwa ndiya yenu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30"/>Na wanyama wose wa mwiisi na ndege wose na wang'onyo wose otambala, vose vili na ugima, ndiya yao yokuwa mijani yose ya minoga.” Na vivo isang'hanike. <verse eid="GEN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31"/>Imulungu kalola kila kinhu kiyasang'hane na kachona kinoga ng'hani. Ikala ichungulo, ikala imitondo, siku da sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1"/>Vino vivo ulanga na isi vivimambukizwe hamoja na vinhu vose vili mumo. <verse eid="GEN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2"/>Siku da saba Imulungu kakala yeshilize sang'hano yake yose yaisang'hane, avo siku dijo da saba Imulungu kabwihila. <verse eid="GEN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3"/>Imulungu kainogela siku ya saba na kaitenda ing'ale, kwavija viyeshilize sang'hano yake ya kulumba kabwihila. <verse eid="GEN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4"/>Vino vivo ulanga na isi vivilumbigwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Mgunda wa Edeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Kipindi acho Mndewa Imulungu viyalumbile ulanga na isi, <verse eid="GEN 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5"/>mwiisi kukala kuduhu minoga na mbeyu zotile, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kakala hanagala mvula bule, na kukala kuduhu munhu yakalile yolima, <verse eid="GEN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6"/>lakini mazi galawa hasi mwiisi na kudodeza isi.<verse eid="GEN 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kasola ulongo mdodo kulawa mwiisi na muulongo awo kalumba munhu, kamuhuvila munhu ayo mhumuzi ya ugima mvizonzo va mhula yake na munhu kawa na ugima.<verse eid="GEN 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kahanda mgunda ako Edeni, mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa, na mumo kamwika mbigalo ayo yamulumbile. <verse eid="GEN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9"/>Mndewa Imulungu kahandigiza kila biki dinogile na mibiki ilelaga matunda gofaya kudigwa. Hagati ya mgunda awo kukala na biki da ugima na biki da kujuwa ganogile na gehile.<verse eid="GEN 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10"/>Kukala na kizanda cha mazi gokilimila mumgunda awo wa Edeni, kulawa kuko kizanda acho kiigola kuwa vizanda vine. <verse eid="GEN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11"/>Twaga da kizanda cha ichanduso dokemigwa Pishoni, chokilima kuzunguluka isi yose ya Havila, ako kuko ili zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12"/>Zahabu ya isi ayo inoga ng'hani. Kuko kuna mavuta gonung'hila goya gokemigwa bedola na mabwe ga bei ng'hulu gokemigwa shohamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13"/>Twaga da kizanda cha kabili dokemigwa Gihoni, kizanda acho chokilima kuzunguluka isi yose ya Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14"/>Twaga da kizanda cha kadatu dokemigwa Tigilisi, kizanda acho chokilima mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Ashulu. Na kizanda cha ikane chokemigwa Fulate.<verse eid="GEN 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamwika mbigalo ayo mumgunda awo wa Edeni, yaulime na kuulola goya. <verse eid="GEN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulagiza munhu ayo, “Kodaha kuja tunda da biki jojose dili mumgunda, <verse eid="GEN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17"/>lakini matunda ga biki da kujuwa ganogile na gehile, sikuuje. Siku donda uje kofa.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kalonga, “Havinogile bule mbigalo kukala yaiyeka. Avo nomtendela miyage wa kumfaya kumtaza.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19"/>Avo kulawa mwiisi Mndewa Imulungu kasola ulongo kidogo, kalumba wanyama wose na ndege wose, abaho kamgalila mbigalo ija yalole vonda yawagwelele matwaga, na matwaga gayawagwee gago gakalile matwaga gao. <verse eid="GEN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20"/>Avo mbigalo ija kawagwaa matwaga wanyama wose ofugigwa na wanyama wa kumuhulo na ndege wose, lakini kuduhu hata imoja yamfaiye kumtaza.<verse eid="GEN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamtenda mbigalo ayo yawase utulo, na viyakalile muutulo kamogola lubavu lwake lumoja na kuhagubika hanhu aho kwa nyama. <verse eid="GEN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22"/>Na lubavu luyagomole kwa mbigalo kalutenda mtwanzi, kamgala kwa mbigalo ayo. <verse eid="GEN 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23"/>Abaho mbigalo ayo kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Ona, dino zege dilawile mmizege yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">na nyama ilawile mwiinyama yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Ino kokemigwa, ‘Mtwanzi,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">kwavija kalawa kwa mbigalo.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24"/>Lekaavo mbigalo komuleka tatake na mamake, na koilumba na mwehe wake, nao wabili awo okuwa kinhu kimoja.<verse eid="GEN 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25"/>Mbigalo ayo na mwehe wake wose wabili wakala mwazi, lakini hawonile kinyala bule.<verse eid="GEN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Munhu viyalekile kutegeleza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1"/>Mgendela hasi kakala mvizi kubanza wanyama wose wa kumuhulo walumbigwe na Mndewa Imulungu. Avo mgendela hasi kamuuza mtwanzi ayo, “Vino Imulungu kawalongela sikumuje tunda da biki jojose dili mumgunda?”<verse eid="GEN 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2"/>Mtwanzi ayo kamwidika, “Todaha kuja tunda da biki jojose dili mumgunda, <verse eid="GEN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3"/>lakini Imulungu katulongela, ‘Sikumuje matunda ga biki dili hagati ya mgunda, hebu kudikwasa, mwahatenda vivo, mofa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4"/>Mgendela hasi kamulongela mtwanzi ayo, “Hamufa bule. <verse eid="GEN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5"/>Imulungu kalonga avo kwavija kojuwa kamba mwahaja matunda ga biki dijo meso genu gogubuligwa na mokuwa kamba Imulungu, mogajuwa ganogile na gehile.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6"/>Mtwanzi ayo viyonile matunda ga biki dijo viganogile kudigwa, na dibiki vidinogeza mgameso na kagelegeza vivinogile kuwa na nzewele, avo kakondola tunda kadija, diyagwe kamgwaa mkasano wake, na heyo vivija kadija. <verse eid="GEN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7"/>Viweshilize kuja, meso gao gagubuka, wajuwa kamba wakala mwazi. Avo wasoneleza mijani ya biki da mtini, waigubika.<verse eid="GEN 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8"/>Ichungulo wahulika Mndewa Imulungu kotembela mumgunda, hewo waifisa mna imibiki. <verse eid="GEN 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kamkema imbigalo, kamuuza, “Kwa kwahi?”<verse eid="GEN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10"/>Heyo kamwidika, “Nikuhulika mumgunda, nidumba na kuifisa, kwavija nikala mwazi.”<verse eid="GEN 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11"/>Imulungu kamuuza, “Nani yakulongele kukala mwazi? Vino, gweye kuja tunda dinikugomese sikuuje?”<verse eid="GEN 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12"/>Mbigalo ayo kamwidika, “Mtwanzi yuungwelele ng'hale na heyo hamoja ayo yangwelele tunda da biki dijo, na niye nidija.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamuuza imtwanzi, “Habali utendile vivo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Kamwidika, “Mgendela hasi ayo yanivizile nije.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kowatagusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela mgendela hasi, “Kwavija kutenda avo, gweye wiiyeka kuduwiligwa kubanza wanyama wose ofugigwa, na kubanza wanyama wose wa kumuhulo, kulawa sambi kotambala kwa inda yako, na koja timbwisi siku zose za ugima wako. <verse eid="GEN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15"/>Nokutenda gweye na mtwanzi mwiihile, ulelo wako na ulelo wake oihila, heyo kokuhonda pala jako, na gweye kokiluma kisiginho chake.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16"/>Abaho kamulongela imtwanzi, “Nokwengezela usungu wa kulela, kwa usungu kolela wana. Komsulukila mkasano wako na heyo kokutawala.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17"/>Abaho kamulongela imbigalo, “Kwavija gweye kumtegeleza mwehe wako, na kuja tunda da biki dinikugomese sikuuje, kwa mbuli ayo, isi yose iduwiligwa. Kwa kulawa fuguti kopata ndiya yako, siku zose za ugima wako. <verse eid="GEN 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18"/>Isi yokulelela miba na misani, na gweye koja minoga ya kumuhulo. <verse eid="GEN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19"/>Kwa fuguti jako kopata ndiya yako, mbaka vonda ubwele muulongo muulumbigwe, kwavija gweye kulawa mditimbwisi, avo kobwela kabili mditimbwisi.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20"/>Adamu kamgwaa mwehe wake twaga da Hawa, kwavija kakala mama wa wanhu wose. <verse eid="GEN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kawatendela Adamu na mwehe wake viwalo va ng'hwembe, kawavaza.<verse eid="GEN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu na Hawa owingigwa mumgunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kalonga, “Sambi wanhu wano waigala kamba imoja wetu na ogajuwa ganogile na gehile. Olondigwa wagomesigwe sikuwaje tunda da biki da ugima, kwavija wahaja okuwa wagima milele.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23"/>Avo Mndewa Imulungu kawaswaswanya mumgunda wa Edeni na kawatenda walime mwiisi iwalumbiligwe. <verse eid="GEN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24"/>Abaho kuna umwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa mgunda awo keka wasenga wa kuulanga na sime dikwaka dikalile dozunguluka banzi zose, kuikimila nzila ilongoza kudibiki da ugima.<verse eid="GEN 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kaini na Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1"/>Abaho Adamu kamuwasa mwehe wake, na heyo kagoga inda na kalela mwana wa kimbigalo. Hawa kalonga, “Kwa kutazigwa na Mndewa Imulungu mhata mwana wa kimbigalo.” Na heyo kamkema Kaini. <verse eid="GEN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2"/>Abaho Hawa kalela mwana iyagwe wa kimbigalo, twaga jake Abeli. Abeli kakala msusilaji, lakini Kaini kakala mulimaji. <verse eid="GEN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3"/>Siku dimoja Kaini kasola vinhu vidodo mna ivinhu viyasengile, kamulavila Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4"/>Abaho Abeli kamulavila Mndewa Imulungu nyama zinonile za ng'hondolo wa chaudele yawachinjile kulawa mna ifugo yake. Mndewa kanogezwa na Abeli hamoja na nhunza yake, <verse eid="GEN 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5"/>lakini Kaini hanogeligwe hamoja na nhunza zake. Avo Kaini kagevuzika ng'hani na kihanga chake kikala filufilu. <verse eid="GEN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Kaini, “Habali kugevuzika na habali kihanga chako cha filufilu? <verse eid="GEN 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7"/>Maza utendile kinhu kinogile, wahatogoligwe, lakini kwavija kutenda gehile, nzambi yokusepasepa hana ulwivi lwako, yokusulukila, lakini kolondigwa uihume.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8"/>Abaho Kaini kamulongela mdodo wake Abeli, “Tuchole kumgunda.” Avo viwakalile kumgunda, Kaini kamvamila ndugu yake kamkoma.<verse eid="GEN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamuuza Kaini, “Ndugu yako Abeli kakwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kaini kamwidika, “Niye sijuwa bule, vino niye ayo mkalizi wa ndugu yangu?” <verse eid="GEN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10"/>Abaho Mndewa kalonga, “Gweye kutenda choni? Damu ya ndugu yako yonililila kulawa mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11"/>Gweye sambi kuduwiligwa mwiisi yuukala, ifonzile damu ya ndugu yako yuumkomile. <verse eid="GEN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12"/>Kamba wahalima, isi honda ikulelele ndiya yoyose. Kokuwa tanga nzulule mwiisi.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13"/>Kaini kamulongela Mndewa Imulungu, “Nhaguso ino ng'hulu ng'hani kumwangu, niye siidaha bule. <verse eid="GEN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14"/>Lola, lelo koniwinga kulawa mwiisi inogile kutali na meso gako. Nokuwa tanga nzulule mwiisi, na munhu yoyose yahanyona kong'homa.”<verse eid="GEN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika, “Bule! Munhu yahakukoma gweye Kaini kobwezeligwa miyanza saba.” Avo Mndewa kamwikila Kaini kilaguso cha kumzuma munhu yoyose yonda yamone sikuyamkome. <verse eid="GEN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16"/>Abaho Kaini kasegela mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu na kakala mwiisi ikemigwe, “Nodi,” ikalile mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17"/>Kaini kamuwasa mwehe wake, na imwehe kagoga inda, kamulela Henoki. Abaho Kaini kazenga buga, kadikema buga dijo twaga da imwana Henoki.<verse eid="GEN 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18"/>Henoki kamulela Iladi, na heyo Iladi kamulela Mehuyaeli, na heyo Mehuyaeli kamulela Mesushaeli, na heyo Mesushaeli kamulela Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19"/>Lameki kasola wehe wabili, imoja twaga jake Ada na iyagwe twaga jake Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20"/>Ada kamulela Yabali, yakalile muhenga wa wanhu wakalile ofuga na okala mvibanda. <verse eid="GEN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21"/>Ndugu yake kakemigwa Yubali, ayo kakala tata wa wanhu wose wakalile otowa bango na filimbi. <verse eid="GEN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22"/>Sila nayo kamulela Tubali Kaini, yakalile yotenda kila viya va shaba na mizuma. Lumbu jake Tubali Kaini kakala Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23"/>Lameki kawalongela wehe zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada na Sila, nhegelezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">tegelezeni zinilonga mweye wehe zangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">Niye nimkoma munhu imoja kwavija kandumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">nimkoma mbwaga ayo kwavija kanilumiza.<verse eid="GEN 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24"/>Kamba munhu yomkoma Kaini kobwezeligwa miyanza saba, avo munhu yonikoma niye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">kobwezeligwa miyanza malongo saba na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Seti na Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25"/>Adamu kamuwasa kabili mwehe wake, kalela mwana wa kimbigalo, kamkema Seti, akuno kolonga, “Imulungu kangwaa mwana hanhu ha Abeli, yakomigwe na Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26"/>Seti nayo kalela mwana, twaga jake kamkema Enoshi. Kipindi acho wanhu wasonga kumtambikila Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 4:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa Adamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Umwaka 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1"/>Uno awo msafa wa ulelo wa Adamu. Imulungu viyalumbile wanhu, kalumba kamba viyeli mwenyego. <verse eid="GEN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2"/>Kalumba mbigalo na mtwanzi, kalagusa moyo unogile na kawakema, “Munhu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3"/>Adamu viyavikize miyaka gana na malongo madatu, kalela mwana yaigalile na heyo, twaga jake kamkema Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4"/>Tangu Adamu yamulele Seti, kakala miyaka magana manane, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5"/>Adamu viyavikize miyaka magana tisa na malongo madatu kafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6"/>Seti viyavikize miyaka gana na tano, kamulela Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7"/>Seti viyamulelile Enoshi, kakala yavikize miyaka magana manane na saba, kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8"/>Seti kafa viyavikize miyaka magana tisa na longo na mibili.<verse eid="GEN 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9"/>Enoshi viyavikize miyaka malongo tisa, kamulela Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10"/>Enoshi viyamulelile Kenani, kakala miyaka magana manane na tano, kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11"/>Enoshi kafa viyavikize miyaka magana tisa na tano.<verse eid="GEN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12"/>Kenani viyavikize miyaka malongo saba, kamulela Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13"/>Kenani viyamulelile Mahalaleli, kakala miyaka magana manane na malongo mane, kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14"/>Kenani kafa viyavikize miyaka magana tisa na longo.<verse eid="GEN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15"/>Mahalaleli viyavikize miyaka malongo sita na tano, kamulela Yaledi. <verse eid="GEN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16"/>Mahalaleli viyamulelile Yaledi, kakala miyaka magana manane na malongo madatu, kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17"/>Mahalaleli kafa viyavikize miyaka magana manane na malongo tisa na tano.<verse eid="GEN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18"/>Yaledi viyavikize miyaka gana na malongo sita na mbili, kamulela Henoko. <verse eid="GEN 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19"/>Yaledi viyamulelile Henoko, kakala miyaka magana manane, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20"/>Yaledi kafa viyavikize miyaka magana tisa na malongo sita na mibili.<verse eid="GEN 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21"/>Henoko viyavikize miyaka malongo sita na tano, kamulela Mesusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22"/>Henoko kakala koilumba na Imulungu, viyamulelile Mesusela, Henoko kakala miyaka magana madatu, kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23"/>Henoko kakala miyaka magana madatu na malongo sita na tano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24"/>Henoko kakala koilumba na Imulungu, abaho kapotela, kwavija Imulungu kakala yamsolile.<verse eid="GEN 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25"/>Mesusela viyavikize miyaka gana na malongo manane na saba, kamulela Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26"/>Mesusela viyamulelile Lameki, kakala miyaka magana saba na malongo manane na mbili, kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27"/>Mesusela kafa viyavikize miyaka magana tisa na malongo sita na tisa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28"/>Lameki viyavikize miyaka gana na malongo manane na mbili, kamulela mwana wa kimbigalo, <verse eid="GEN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29"/>mwana ayo kamgwaa twaga da Nuhu, kuno kolonga, “Mwana ino ayo yonda yatuhoze mizoyo mwiisang'hano yetu ndala itusang'hana kwa makono getu mwiisi iduwiligwe na Mndewa Imulungu.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30"/>Viyamulelile Nuhu, Lameki kakala miyaka magana matano na malongo tisa na tano, kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31"/>Lameki kafa viyavikize miyaka magana saba na malongo saba na saba.<verse eid="GEN 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32"/>Nuhu viyavikize miyaka magana matano, kawalela Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Nzambi za iwanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1"/>Wanhu viwenele mwiisi yose na kulela wana wa kitwanzi, <verse eid="GEN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2"/>viumbe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Kiebulania olonga, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wana wa kimbigalo wa Imulungu.</char></note> wayagwe wa kuulanga wawona wandele awo wanoga, avo wawasola waja wawalondile na kuwa wehe zao. <verse eid="GEN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kalonga, “Loho yangu iwagwaa wanhu ugima honda ikale mgati ya wanhu milele, kwavija hewo wa kufa, siku zao za kukala wagima hazibanza miyaka gana na malongo mabili.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4"/>Mzisiku azo na kumwande, kukala na mizinhu mikulu mwiisi ilawilile mbuli ya viumbe wayagwe wa kuulanga viwawasile na wandele wa wanhu. Mizinhu ayo, iyo ikalile na nguvu na ijuwigwa ng'hani baho umwaka, na ikemigwa Wanefili.<verse eid="GEN 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5"/>Mndewa Imulungu viyone kubanza kwa nzambi za wanhu mwiisi, na kila kiwogesa kutenda wanhu mmizoyo yao siku zose kiha, <verse eid="GEN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kagelegeza habali kamulumba munhu mwiisi, avo kona usungu ng'hani muumoyo wake. <verse eid="GEN 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7"/>Mndewa Imulungu kalonga, “Nowabananga wanhu wose niwalumbile mwiisi, na vivija nowabananga wanyama na wang'onyo otambala mwiisi na ndege. Nokona usungu habali niwalumba mwiisi.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8"/>Lakini Nuhu kanogeligwa na Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9"/>Zino azo simulizi za Nuhu na ulelo wake. Nuhu kakala munhu yotenda ganogile, na kakala munhu yelibule kitala mna iwanhu wa kipindi acho. Nuhu kakala koilumba na Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10"/>Nuhu kakala na wana wadatu wa kimbigalo, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11"/>Isi ikala inangike mgameso ga Imulungu, isi yose imema gehile, <verse eid="GEN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12"/>Imulungu kailola isi na kayona isi yose ikala ibanangike ng'hani, kwavija kila munhu kakala kokweleleza nzila zake zihile.<verse eid="GEN 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13"/>Imulungu kamulongela Nuhu, “Nowabananga wanhu wose kwavija isi imema gehile mbuli yao. Ona, nowabananga hewo hamoja na iisi! <verse eid="GEN 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14"/>Avo izengele mwenyego safina kulu kwa mibiki ikemigwa Gofe. Gola magati mdisafina dijo na ukande tongo tongo kunze na mgati. <verse eid="GEN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15"/>Vino vivo vonda udizenge safina dijo, utali wake diwe makono gana na malongo madatu na ndatu na ugazi wake diwe makono malongo mabili na mbili na utali wake wa kuchola uchanha diwe makono longo na ndatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16"/>Zenga kiswili cha safina dijo na wike nyafasi ya nusu mkono kulawa kiswili na kukanho. Wike mulango mulubavu lwa disafina na utende makanho madatu, kanho da hasi na da kabili na da kadatu.<verse eid="GEN 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17"/>“Lola, nogala mazi mengi mwiisi nibanange kila kinhu kili na ugima mwiisi. Kila kinhu kili na ugima mwiisi chofa. <verse eid="GEN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18"/>Lakini notenda lagano na gweye. Kokwingila mdisafina gweye na mwehe wako na wanago na wehe zao. <verse eid="GEN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19"/>Kolondigwa wingize mdisafina kila mng'onyo, wabili wabili mtwanzi na mbigalo ili wawe wagima hamoja na gweye.<verse eid="GEN 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20"/>“Kila aina ya ndege na kila aina ya wanyama na kila aina ya wang'onyo otambala mwiisi, wabili wabili okwiza kumwako ili uweke goya. <verse eid="GEN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21"/>Vivija ugale kila ndiya idigwa, wike mgati mbuli ya ndiya yako na ndiya ya hewo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22"/>Nuhu katenda kila kinhu kamba viyalagizwe na Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Mazi mengi goigubika isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Nuhu, “Ingila mdisafina gweye na wanhu wa mng'anda yako, kwavija mna iwanhu wose iwokala sambi mwiisi gweye wiiyeka ayo utenda ganogile. <verse eid="GEN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2"/>Mna iwanyama odigwa sola saba saba mbigalo na mtwanzi kwa kila aina, na mna iwanyama hawadigwa sola wabili wabili mbigalo na mtwanzi kwa kila aina. <verse eid="GEN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3"/>Vivija sola ndege saba saba wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi kwa kila aina, ili wike mbeyu kabili mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4"/>Kwavija siku saba kumwande, nogala mvula mwiisi yonda itowe siku malongo mane imisi na ikilo, na vinhu vose vili na ugima vinilumbile mwiisi vofa.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5"/>Nuhu katenda kila kinhu kamba viyalagizwe na Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6"/>Kipindi mazi mengi vigezile mwiisi, Nuhu kakala na miyaka magana sita. <verse eid="GEN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7"/>Nuhu na mwehe wake na wanage na wehe zao wengila mdisafina ili wahonyeke na mazi mengi. <verse eid="GEN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8"/>Wanyama odigwa na wanyama hawadigwa na ndege na wang'onyo wose otambala mwiisi, <verse eid="GEN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9"/>mbigalo kwa mtwanzi, wengila mdisafina hamoja na Nuhu kamba viyalagize Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10"/>Siku saba kumwande mazi mengi gasonga kuigubika isi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11"/>Nuhu viyakalile na miyaka magana sita, mna isiku ya longo na saba ya mwezi wa kabili, siku ayo nzasa zose za mazi zili hasi mwiisi zivuguka, na nyivi zose za mazi ga kuulanga zivuguka. <verse eid="GEN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12"/>Na mvula itowa mwiisi siku malongo mane imisi na ikilo. <verse eid="GEN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13"/>Siku didija mvula viisongile kutowa, Nuhu na mwehe wake na wanage, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti, hamoja na wehe zao, wengila mdisafina. <verse eid="GEN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14"/>Wengila hewo wenyego hamoja na aina zose za wanyama wa kumuhulo, aina zose za wanyama ofugigwa, aina zose za wang'onyo otambala na kila aina ya ndege. <verse eid="GEN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15"/>Wabili wabili wa kila aina ya vinhu vilumbigwe vili na ugima vingila mdisafina hamoja na Nuhu. <verse eid="GEN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16"/>Wanyama wengile wakala wa kitwanzi na wa kimbigalo kwa kila aina ya kinhu kilumbigwe kili na ugima kamba Mndewa Imulungu viyamulagize Nuhu. Abaho Mndewa kahinda ulwivi kukisogo cha Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17"/>Mazi gagendelela kumema kwa kipindi cha siku malongo mane, mazi gongezeka na kwinula disafina uchanha ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18"/>Mazi gongezeka ng'hani mwiisi na safina jeluka uchanha yake. <verse eid="GEN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19"/>Mazi gago gakala mengi ng'hani uchanha mwiisi, gavigubika vigongo vose vitali vili mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20"/>Mazi gongezeka mbaka gavigubika ivigongo utali wa makono saba. <verse eid="GEN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21"/>Vinhu vose vili na ugima mwiisi vifa, ndege na wanyama ofugigwa na wanyama wa kumuhulo na kila mng'onyo yotambala mwiisi na wanhu wose wafa. <verse eid="GEN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22"/>Kila kinhu kili na mhumuzi ya ugima mwiisi inyalile kifa. <verse eid="GEN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23"/>Kila kinhu kili na ugima mwiisi kifa, wanhu na wanyama na wang'onyo wose otambala na ndege wakomigwa. Nuhu yaiyeka ayo yasigale hamoja na waja yakalile nao mdisafina. <verse eid="GEN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24"/>Mazi gago hagahunguke mwiisi kwa siku gana na malongo matano.<verse eid="GEN 7:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kuhunguka kwa mazi mengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1"/>Lakini Imulungu hamsemwile bule Nuhu na wanyama wose yakalile nao mdisafina. Avo kagala beho mwiisi na mazi gasonga kuhunguka. <verse eid="GEN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2"/>Baho nzasa za mazi geli mwiisi zihindigwa na nyivi za mazi geli kuulanga zihindigwa. Mvula ileka kutowa, <verse eid="GEN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3"/>na mazi gagendelela kuhunguka mholemhole kwa siku gana na malongo matano. <verse eid="GEN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4"/>Mna isiku ya longo na saba muumwezi wa saba, safina dima uchanha kuvigongo va Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5"/>Mazi gagendelela kuhunguka mholemhole, na siku ya ichanduso ya mwezi wa longo, nhembeti za vigongo zoneka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6"/>Vizibitile siku malongo mane, Nuhu kavugula zonzo diyatendile, <verse eid="GEN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7"/>kamulava kunze bondwa, kaguluka uko na uko mbaka mazi viganyalile mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8"/>Abaho Nuhu kamulava huwa yalole kamba mazi gahunguka mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9"/>Lakini kwavija mazi gakala gagubike isi yose, huwa ayo hapatile hanhu ha kwima, avo kaguluka kabwela mdisafina. Nuhu kagolosa mkono wake na kambweza huwa ayo mdisafina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10"/>Nuhu kabeta siku saba ziyagwe, abaho kamulava kabili huwa iija. <verse eid="GEN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11"/>Ichungulo huwa kabwela kwa Nuhu, mmulomo wake kakala yalumile lujani lwa mzeituni. Avo Nuhu kajuwa kamba mazi gakala gahunguke mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12"/>Abaho kabeta siku saba ziyagwe na kamulava huwa ayo kabili, mwanza uno huwa ayo habwelile bule.<verse eid="GEN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13"/>Nuhu viyakalile na miyaka magana sita na moja, siku da ichanduso da mwezi wa ichanduso, mazi gakala ganyalile mwiisi yose. Nuhu kagubula ingubiko ya disafina, kawegesela, kona isi ikala inyalile. <verse eid="GEN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14"/>Siku ya malongo mabili na saba ya mwezi wa kabili isi yose ikala inyalile.<verse eid="GEN 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15"/>Baho Imulungu kamulongela Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16"/>“Lawa kunze mdisafina, gweye hamoja na mwehe wako na wanago na wehe zao. <verse eid="GEN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17"/>Lava kunze vinhu vose vili na ugima vikalile hamoja na gweye, ndege na wanyama na kila mng'onyo yotambala ili walele ng'hani mwiisi, ongezeke na kwenela kila hanhu mwiisi.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18"/>Avo Nuhu kalawa mdisafina hamoja na wanage na mwehe wake na wehe wa wanage. <verse eid="GEN 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19"/>Wanyama wose na vinhu vose vili na ugima mwiisi na ndege wose na kila mng'onyo yotambala mwiisi vilawa mdisafina kamba viwengile.<verse eid="GEN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu kolava nhosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20"/>Nuhu kamzengela Mndewa upango wa kulavila nhosa. Kasola wanyama wayagwe odigwa na ndege odigwa, kamulavila Mndewa Imulungu nhosa ya kusoma moto. <verse eid="GEN 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21"/>Kunung'hila goya kwa nhosa kumnogeza Mndewa Imulungu, na heyo kailongela mwenyego, “Honda niiduwile isi kabili mbuli gaja gowotenda wanhu, nojuwa kulawa kipindi viwakalile wabwanga magesa gao geha. Sibwelela ng'o! kabili kuvibananga vinhu vose vili na ugima kamba vinhendile. <verse eid="GEN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22"/>Isi vonda igendelele, hokuwa na msimu wa kuhanda na msimu wa kusenga, msimu wa vuke na msimu wa kihuhwe, msimu wa zuwa kali na msimu wa masika, imisi na ikilo vokuwa baho siku zose.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Imulungu koilagana na Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1"/>Imulungu kalagusa moyo unogile kwa Nuhu na wanage, kalonga, “Mulele wana wengi, muimemeze isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2"/>Wanyama wose na ndege wose na wang'onyo wose otambala mwiisi na somba wose wa mwiibahali owadumba mweye. Wose wammakono genu. <verse eid="GEN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3"/>Kila kinhu kili na ugima chokuwa ndiya yenu kamba viniwagwelele mijani yose na mbogamboga. Sambi nowagwaa vinhu vose. <verse eid="GEN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4"/>Lakini sikumuje nyama kuno ing'hali na damu kwavija ugima wa mwiidamu. <verse eid="GEN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5"/>Damu ya ugima wenu noilonda, noilonda damu ya kila mnyama na kila munhu. Yonda yamkome miyage noudai kumwake ugima wa munhu yamkomile. <verse eid="GEN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6"/>Munhu yonda yamkome miyage na heyo kokomigwa, kwavija munhu kalumbigwa kamba viyeli Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7"/>Mweye mulele wana wengi ili mwengezeke ng'hani mwiisi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8"/>Imulungu kamulongela Nuhu na wanage, <verse eid="GEN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9"/>“Sambi notenda lagano na mweye na wanhu wa ulelo wenu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10"/>na vose vili na ugima, ndege wose na wanyama ofugigwa na wanyama wa kumuhulo na kila kinhu kilawile mdisafina hamoja na gweye. <verse eid="GEN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11"/>Kwa mbuli zino notenda lagano jangu na gweye na nolonga vino, vinhu vose vili na ugima honda nivibanange bule kabili kwa mazi mengi. Mazi mengi honda gaibanange bule isi yose kabili. <verse eid="GEN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12"/>Kamba kilaguso cha lagano dino dilibule uhelelo, dinitenda na gweye na vinhu vose vili na ugima, <verse eid="GEN 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13"/>nokwika pinde jangu kuulanga, dokuwa kilaguso cha lagano jangu na isi yose. <verse eid="GEN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14"/>Kipindi chochose chonda niugubike ulanga na mawingu, pinde da Imulungu dokoneka, <verse eid="GEN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15"/>nokumbuka gaja ganongile kumwako na wanyama wose, kamba mazi mengi honda gavibanange kabili vinhu vose vili na ugima. <verse eid="GEN 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16"/>Pinde jangu vonda dilawilile kuulanga nojona, baho nokumbuka lagano jangu dilibule uhelelo kumwangu niye na vinhu vose vili na ugima mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17"/>Kino acho kilaguso cha lagano dinitenda kwa vinhu vose vili na ugima.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nuhu na wanage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18"/>Wanage Nuhu walawile mdisafina wakala Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. Hamu kakala tata wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19"/>Wana awo wadatu wa Nuhu wao wakalile wahenga wa wanhu wose wa mwiisi.<verse eid="GEN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20"/>Nuhu ayo yasongile kulima mgunda wa mizabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21"/>Viyang'wile divai, kakoligwa na kasaula viwalo vake, kawasa mwazi mkibanda chake. <verse eid="GEN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22"/>Hamu, tata wa Kanaani, viyamone tatake ka mwazi, kalawa kunze na kuwalongela ndugu zake wabili. <verse eid="GEN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23"/>Abaho Shemu na Yafeti wasola kiwalo, wakika kukisogo mmaega gao. Watembela kisengele nyuma, wengila mkibanda na kumgubika tatao, kuno vihanga vao walola kumgwazo ili sikuwamone tatao viyakalile mwazi. <verse eid="GEN 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24"/>Nuhu viyalamuke na kujuwa kiyamtendele mwanage imdodo, <verse eid="GEN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25"/>kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Kanaani yaduwiligwe na Imulungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Kokuwa mtumwa wa ndugu zake.<verse eid="GEN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26"/>Yatogoligwe Mndewa Imulungu wa Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani yawe mtumwa wa Shemu.<verse eid="GEN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27"/>Imulungu yamwengezele Yafeti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Ulelo wake ukale na wanhu wa Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaani kokuwa mtumwa wa Yafeti.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28"/>Mazi mengi viganyalile Nuhu kakala miyaka magana madatu na malongo matano. <verse eid="GEN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29"/>Nuhu kafa viyakalile na miyaka magana tisa na malongo matano.<verse eid="GEN 9:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa wanage Nuhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Umwaka 1:5-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1"/>Uno awo ulelo wa wanage Nuhu, Shemu na Hamu na Yafeti. Vikishile kipindi cha mazi mengi wano wose wadatu walela wana.<verse eid="GEN 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2"/>Wana wa Yafeti wakala, Gomeli na Magogu na Madai na Yavani na Tubali na Mesheki na Tilasi.<verse eid="GEN 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3"/>Wana wa Gomeli wakala, Ashikenazi na Lifati na Togama.<verse eid="GEN 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4"/>Wana wa Yavani wakala, Elisha na Talishishi na Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5"/>Kubitila awo wanhu wa isi za mwhani wenela mziisi zao, kila wanhu na ulonzi wao na makabila gao na izing'holo zao.<verse eid="GEN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6"/>Wana wa Hamu wakala, Kushi na Misili na Putu na Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7"/>Wana wa Kushi wakala, Seba na Havila na Sabita na Laama na Sabiteka.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 10:7">Wana wa Laama wakala, Sheba na Dedani.<verse eid="GEN 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8"/>Kushi kakala na mwana yakemigwe Nimulodi, yakalile galu wa ichanduso na munhu mwene nguvu mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9"/>Kakala msakaji mkulu mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, lekaavo wanhu olonga, “Uwe kamba Nimulodi msakaji mkulu mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu!” <verse eid="GEN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10"/>Mabuga gaichanduso ga utawala wake gakala, Babeli na Eleki na Akadi na Kaline, gose gakala mwiisi ya Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11"/>Kulawa kuko Nimulodi kachola Ashulu kazenga buga da Ninawi na Lehoboti na Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12"/>na Leseni dili hagati ya Ninawi na buga kulu da Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13"/>Misili kawalela Waludi na Waanami na Walehabi na Wanafutuhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14"/>na Wapatulusi na Wakafutoli na Wakasuluhi. Wafilisiti walawa kwa Wakasuluhi.<verse eid="GEN 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15"/>Kanaani kawalela Sidoni, imwana chaudele na Heti. <verse eid="GEN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16"/>Vivija Kanaani kakala muhenga wa Wayebusi na Waamoli na Wagiligashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17"/>na Wahivi na Waaliki na Wasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18"/>na Waalivadi na Wasemali na Wahamasi. Abaho ng'holo nyingi za Wakanaani zipwililika.<verse eid="GEN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19"/>Na zimbaka za Wakanaani zisongela Sidoni kubitila nzila ya Gelali mbaka Gaza, abaho kubitila Sodoma na Gomola na Adima na Seboimu mbaka ako Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20"/>Awo uwo ulelo wa Hamu, kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao na isi zao na ulonzi wao.<verse eid="GEN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21"/>Shemu, mkulu wa Yafeti, kalela wana. Shemu ayo muhenga wa wana wose wa Ebeli.<verse eid="GEN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22"/>Wana wa Shemu wakala, Elamu na Ashulu na Alifakisadi na Ludi na Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23"/>Wana wa Alamu wakala, Usi na Huli na Geseli na Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24"/>Alifakisadi kamulela Shela na Shela kamulela Ebeli.<verse eid="GEN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25"/>Ebeli kakala na wana wabili, imoja kakemigwa Pelegi kwavija mna ikipindi chake wanhu wa mwiisi wakala waigolile, na mwana iyagwe kakemigwa Yokitani.<verse eid="GEN 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26"/>Yokitani kawalela Alimodadi na Shelefu na Hasalimawesi na Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27"/>na Hadolamu na Uzali na Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28"/>na Obali na Abimaeli na Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29"/>na Ofili na Havila na Yobabu. Awo wose wakala wanage Yokitani.<verse eid="GEN 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30"/>Isi iwakalile yenela kulawa Mesha mbaka Sefali kuvigongo va mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31"/>Awo uwo ulelo wa Shemu, kamba viweli mna gamakabila gao na isi zao na ulonzi wao.<verse eid="GEN 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32"/>Zino azo ng'holo za wana wa Nuhu kamba viwaleligwe toka isi mbaka isi. Kubitila awo wanhu wa makabila gose wenela mwiisi yose vigeshile mazi mengi.<verse eid="GEN 10:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Lingo da Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1"/>Baho haichanduso wanhu wa mwiisi yose wakala olonga ulonzi umoja na mbuli zizija. <verse eid="GEN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2"/>Avo wanhu viwafungile mwanza kuchola isi za mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wayona isi ya bawe ako Shinali, na wakala kuko. <verse eid="GEN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3"/>Avo wailongela wao kwa wao, “Amweye! Tutende matofali na tugasome moto vinogile.” Avo wakala na matofali badala ya mabwe na tongo tongo badala ya matope. <verse eid="GEN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4"/>Wailongela, “Tuizengele buga na lingo donda divike mbaka kuulanga, ili tutende matwaga getu gajuwigwe na sikutupwililike mwiisi yose.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kahumuluka hasi yalole dibuga na dilingo diwakalile ozenga wanhu awo. <verse eid="GEN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6"/>Mndewa Imulungu kalonga, “Wanhu wano ni wanhu wa isi imoja na olonga ulonzi umoja, na kino acho kiwosonga kutenda, avo jojose diwolonda kutenda oditenda. <verse eid="GEN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7"/>Leka tuhumuluke hasi, tukawakanganye ulonzi wao ili walemelwe kuitegeleza wao kwa wao.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8"/>Avo Mndewa Imulungu kawapwililisa mwiisi yose na waleka kuzenga idibuga. <verse eid="GEN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9"/>Buga dijo dikemigwa Babeli, kwavija aho Mndewa Imulungu hayawakanganye wanhu na kuwagwaa ulonzi mbasakanyo mbasakanyo na kulawa aho kawapwililisa wanhu mwiisi yose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa Shemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1 Umwaka 1:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10"/>Uno awo ulelo wa Shemu. Miyaka mibili vigeshile mazi mengi, Shemu viyavikize miyaka gana, kamulela Alifakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11"/>Shemu viyamulelile Alifakisadi, kakala miyaka magana matano na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="GEN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12"/>Alifakisadi kakala na miyaka malongo madatu na tano, kamulela Shela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13"/>Alifakisadi viyamulelile Shela, kakala miyaka magana mane na midatu, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="GEN 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14"/>Shela kakala na miyaka malongo madatu, kamulela Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15"/>Shela viyamulelile Ebeli, kakala miyaka magana mane na midatu, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="GEN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16"/>Ebeli kakala na miyaka malongo madatu na nne, kamulela Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17"/>Ebeli viyamulelile Pelegi, kakala miyaka magana mane na malongo madatu, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="GEN 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18"/>Pelegi viyakalile na miyaka malongo madatu, kamulela Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19"/>Pelegi viyamulelile Leu, kakala miyaka magana mabili na tisa, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="GEN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20"/>Leu viyakalile na miyaka malongo madatu na mibili, kamulela Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21"/>Leu viyamulelile Selugi, kakala miyaka magana mabili na saba, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="GEN 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22"/>Selugi viyakalile na miyaka malongo madatu, kamulela Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23"/>Selugi viyamulelile Naholi, kakala miyaka magana mabili, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="GEN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24"/>Naholi viyakalile na miyaka malongo mabili na tisa, kamulela Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25"/>Naholi viyamulelile Tela, kakala na miyaka gana dimoja na longo na tisa, na kalela wana wayagwe wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi.<verse eid="GEN 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26"/>Tela viyakalile na miyaka malongo saba, kamulela Abulamu na Naholi na Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27"/>Uno awo ulelo wa Tela, tatao Abulamu na Naholi na Halani. Halani kakala tatake Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28"/>Kipindi Tela yang'ali mgima Halani kafa ako Uli buga da Wakalidayo kuyaleleke. <verse eid="GEN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29"/>Abulamu na Naholi wasola wehe. Mwehe wa Abulamu kakemigwa Salai na mwehe wa Naholi kakemigwa Milika biti Halani, vivija Halani kakala tatake Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30"/>Salai kakala mgumba. <verse eid="GEN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31"/>Tela kamsola imwana Abulamu na imzukulu Lutu, yakalile mwanage Halani, na imukwe Salai mwehe wa Abulamu, kalawanya nao ako Uli buga da Wakalidayo, kachola na hewo mwiisi ya Kanaani, viwavikile kudibuga da Halani wakala kuko. <verse eid="GEN 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32"/>Tela kafa ako Halani viyakalile na miyaka magana mabili na tano.<verse eid="GEN 11:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Mndewa komkema Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Abulamu, “Segela mwiisi yako, waleke ndugu zako na ng'anda ya tatako uchole mwiisi yonda nikulagusile.<verse eid="GEN 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2"/>Nokutenda uwe na ulelo onda uwe kabila kulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:2">Nokutenda umwede na kuditenda twaga jako dijuwigwe ng'hani, na gweye kokuwa kilamuso cha wanhu wengi kumweda.<verse eid="GEN 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3"/>Munhu yonda yakutendele ganogile na niye nomtendela ganogile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Lakini munhu yonda yakuduwile na niye nomduwila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Kubitila gweye nowatenda wanhu wa isi zose wamwede.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4"/>Abulamu viyakalile na miyaka malongo saba na tano kasegela Halani, kamba viyalongeligwe na Mndewa Imulungu, na Lutu kachola hamoja na heyo. <verse eid="GEN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5"/>Abulamu kamsola imwehe Salai na Lutu mwana wa ndugu yake hamoja na vinhu vao vose na wanhu wose wawapatile ako Halani. Wasegela kuchola isi ya Kanaani. Viwavikile ako, <verse eid="GEN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6"/>Abulamu kabita mziisi mbaka Shekemu, hanhu hong'ala heli na biki kulu da Mole. Kipindi acho Wakanaani wao wakalile iwenekae wa isi ayo. <verse eid="GEN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7"/>Ako Mndewa Imulungu kamulawilila Abulamu, kamulongela, “Ino ayo isi yonda niwagwee ulelo wako.” Abaho Abulamu kamzengela upango wa kulavila nhosa Mndewa yamulawilile. <verse eid="GEN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8"/>Kulawa kuko Abulamu kasegela kachola kuvigongo mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Beseli keka ng'hambi hagati ya buga da Beseli mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa na buga da Ai mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa. Kuko vivija kamzengela Mndewa Imulungu upango wa kulavila nhosa na kaditambikila twaga da Mndewa. <verse eid="GEN 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9"/>Abaho Abulamu kagendelela na mwanza kuchola mwambu wa Negebu ubanzi wa kusini.<verse eid="GEN 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu ka Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10"/>Lakini kukala na lufilili lwa nzala mwiisi ayo. Avo Abulamu kachola kukala Misili, kwavija nzala ikala ng'hulu ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11"/>Viyakalile mmambwegambwega kuvika Misili, kamulongela imwehe Salai, “Nojuwa gweye kwa mtwanzi unogile na kogela lembo. <verse eid="GEN 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12"/>Wamisili wahakona olonga, ‘Ino mwehe wake,’ avo ong'homa na gweye okuleka mgima. <verse eid="GEN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13"/>Avo walongele gweye kwa lumbu jangu, avo mbuli ya gweye hawang'homa bule na onhenda goya.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14"/>Abulamu viyavikile Misili, wenekae wa kuko wamona Salai kakala mtwanzi yanogile ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15"/>Wanhu weli na ukulu muundewa wa Falao viwamone Salai wamtogola ng'hani kwa mndewa Falao, avo Salai kagaligwa mng'anda ya mndewa. <verse eid="GEN 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16"/>Avo, mbuli ya Salai mndewa Falao kamtendela Abulamu ganogile, na kagweleligwa ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na vihongwe mbigalo na vihongwe watwanzi na watumwa wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi na ngamiya.<verse eid="GEN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kamkoboza Falao na wanhu wose wa mng'anda yake na kawagwaa mitamu mbuli ya Salai, mwehe wake Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18"/>Avo Falao kamkema Abulamu, kamulongela, “Kunhenda choni gweye? Habali hunongele kamba Salai mwehe wako? <verse eid="GEN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19"/>Habali kunongela kakala lumbu jako na kundeka nimsole yawe mwehe wangu? Avo sambi, ayo baho mwehe wako, msole uhalawe hano!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20"/>Avo Falao kawalagiza wanhu zake, na hewo wamuleka Abulamu yasegele na mwehe wake hamoja na vinhu vake vose.<verse eid="GEN 12:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Abulamu na Lutu oigola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1"/>Abulamu kabwela kulawa Misili, kachola mwambu wa Negebu, kakala hamoja na mwehe wake na vinhu vake vose hamoja na Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2"/>Abulamu kakala munhu tajili ng'hani. Kakala na fugo nyingi na shaba na zahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3"/>Kagendelela na mwanza wake kulawa Negebu mbaka Beseli. Kavika hanhu kuyekile ng'hambi yake aho haichanduso hagati ya Beseli na Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4"/>aho kuyazengile upango wa kulavila nhosa. Aho kaditambikila twaga da Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5"/>Lutu yakalile kokwanga hamoja na Abulamu, heyo vivija kakala na fugo na vibanda. <verse eid="GEN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6"/>Wakala na fugo nyingi mbaka isi ija ikala ndodo kwa Abulamu na Lutu kukala hamoja. <verse eid="GEN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7"/>Avo wasusilaji wa Abulamu na wasusilaji wa Lutu wasonga kugomba. Kipindi acho Wakanaani na Wapelizi awo wakalile wenekae wa isi ayo.<verse eid="GEN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8"/>Abaho Abulamu kamulongela Lutu, “Niye na gweye sikutugombe hebu wasusilaji zako na wasusilaji zangu sikuwagombe kwavija niye na gweye twa ndugu. <verse eid="GEN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9"/>Avo tuigole. Sagula mwambu wowose wa isi kuulonda, wahachola mwambu wa mkono wa kumoso niye nochola mwambu wa mkono wa ukudila, wahachola mwambu wa mkono wa ukudila niye nochola mwambu wa mkono wa ukumoso.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10"/>Lutu kalola, kajona bonde da lwanda lwa Yolidani dikala dimemile mazi kila hanhu, kamba mgunda wa Mndewa Imulungu hebu kamba isi ya Misili mwambu wa Soali. Kino kikala kipindi Mndewa Imulungu yang'hali hanagabananga mabuga ga Sodoma na Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11"/>Avo Lutu kaisagulila bonde jose da lwanda lwa Yolidani, kachola mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa. Wanhu awo wabili vivo viwaigolile. <verse eid="GEN 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12"/>Abulamu kasigala mwiisi ya Kanaani na Lutu kakala mna gamabuga gakalile kubonde, keka ng'hambi yake behi na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13"/>Wanhu wa kuko Sodoma wakala wehile na wakala omtendela Mndewa Imulungu nzambi nyingi.<verse eid="GEN 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu kochola Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14"/>Lutu viyaigolile na Abulamu, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Abulamu, “Aho hawili lola goya mhande zose. <verse eid="GEN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15"/>Isi yose ino yuulola, nokugwaa gweye na ulelo wako, iwe yenu milele. <verse eid="GEN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16"/>Nowatenda wanhu wa ulelo wako wawe wengi mbaka munhu sikuyadahe kuwapeta, kamba vija msanga, avo kamba hana munhu kodaha kuupeta msanga baho kodaha kuwapeta wanhu wa ulelo wako. <verse eid="GEN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17"/>Sambi, chola ukaikagule isi ayo yose, kwavija isi ayo yose nokugwaa gweye.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18"/>Avo Abulamu kahama kuing'hambi yake, kachola kukala behi na mibiki mikulu ya Mamule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mamule </char><char style="ft" closed="false">twaga da munhu yahandile mibiki ayo, vivija ditambuligwa sula ya 14:13.</char></note> ako Hebuloni, na ako kamzengela Mndewa Imulungu upango wa kulavila nhosa.<verse eid="GEN 13:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Abulamu komkombola Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1"/>Kipindi acho mndewa Amulafeli wa Shinali na mndewa Alioko wa Elasali na mndewa Kedolilaomeli wa Elamu na mndewa Tidali wa Goimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2"/>wachola kuitowa na wandewa wano, mndewa Belao wa Sodoma na mndewa Bilisha wa Gomola na mndewa Shinabu wa Adima na mndewa Shemebeli wa Seboimu na mndewa wa Bela na vivija Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3"/>Wandewa awo wose watano waiting'hana kubonde da Sidimu hebu bahali ya Mkele. <verse eid="GEN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4"/>Kwa kipindi cha miyaka longo na mibili wakala mmakono ga mndewa Kedolilaomeli, lakini muumwaka wa longo na ndatu wambiduka. <verse eid="GEN 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5"/>Muumwaka wa longo na nne, mndewa Kedolilaomeli na waja wandewa wayage weza na kuwahuma Walefai ako Ashitaloti Kalinaimu na Wazuzi ako Hamu na Waemi ako Shawe Kiliataimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6"/>na Waholi ako kuvigongo vao va Seili mbaka Elipalani behi na kiwala. <verse eid="GEN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7"/>Abaho wabwela kuchugu mbaka Enimishipati hebu Kadeshi, waitowa isi yose ya Waamaleki na kuwahuma na vivija wawatowa Waamoli wakalile Hazazoni Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8"/>Abaho mndewa wa Sodoma na mndewa wa Gomola na mndewa wa Adima na mndewa Seboimu na mndewa wa Bela hebu Soali wengila kukigongo kubonde da Sidimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9"/>waitowa na Kedolilaomeli mndewa wa Elamu na Tidali mndewa wa Golimu na Amulafeli mndewa wa Shinali na Alioko mndewa wa Elasali, wandewa wane waitowa na wandewa watano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10"/>Bonde da Sidimu dikala dimemile masimo ga lami, avo wandewa wa Sodoma na Gomola viwakalile okimbila ing'hondo wadumbukila mumo, lakini wandewa wayagwe wasigale wakimbilila kuvigongo. <verse eid="GEN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11"/>Avo waja wahumile, wavisola vinhu vose va Sodoma na Gomola, vivija wasola ndiya zao, wasegela. <verse eid="GEN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12"/>Vivija wamgela mmakono Lutu, mwana wa ndugu yake Abulamu hamoja na vinhu vake, kwavija Lutu kakala yokala Sodoma, abaho walawanya.<verse eid="GEN 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13"/>Munhu imoja yahonyeke, kamgalila usenga Abulamu yakalile Muebulania, na yakalile kokala behi na mibiki mikulu ya Mamule ya Muamoli, yakalile ndugu yake Eshikoli na Aneli, wose wakala wailumbile na Abulamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14"/>Abulamu viyahulike ndugu yake Lutu kageligwa mmakono, kalawa na wanhu zake wakalile magalu magana madatu na longo na nane waleleke mng'anda yake, wawakweleleza wanhu awo mbaka Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15"/>Ako kawagola wanhu zake mvibumbila. Ikilo kawatowa wanhu awo, kawawinga mbaka Hoba, kasikazini ya Damesiki. <verse eid="GEN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16"/>Baho, Abulamu kavikombola vinhu vose visoligwe na wanhu awo na kamkombola Lutu ndugu yake, vinhu vake, hamoja na watwanzi na wanhu wayagwe.<verse eid="GEN 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulamu kotambikiligwa na Melikizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17"/>Abulamu viyakalile kobwela kulawa kumtowa mndewa Kedolilaomeli na wayage, mndewa wa Sodoma kachola kuiting'hana na heyo kubonde da Shawe hebu Bonde da Mndewa. <verse eid="GEN 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18"/>Na heyo Melikizedeki, yakalile mndewa wa Salemu na vivija yakalile mulava nhosa wa Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani, kamgalila Abulamu gate na divai, <verse eid="GEN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19"/>kamtambikila kwa kulonga, “Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani, yalumbile ulanga na isi, yamtendele ganogile Abulamu! <verse eid="GEN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20"/>Na Imulungu yeli Uchanha Ng'hani yagweleligwe ukulu, kwa kukugwaa udahi wa kuwahuma wanhu wakwihile.” Na heyo Abulamu kamgwaa Melikizedeki kinhu kimoja mna ikila vinhu longo kwa vinhu vose viyapatile kuing'hondo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21"/>Mndewa wa Sodoma kamulongela Abulamu, “Ngwelela niye wanhu awo, na vinhu vose avo sola gweye.”<verse eid="GEN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22"/>Abulamu kamwidika mndewa wa Sodoma, “Noiduwila kwa Mndewa Imulungu, yeli Uchanha Ng'hani, yalumbile ulanga na isi, <verse eid="GEN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23"/>sisola kinhu chako chochose, sisola hata luzi hebu luzabi lwa vilatu, Sambi uitape kwa kulonga, ‘Niye ayo nimtendile Abulamu yawe tajili’ <verse eid="GEN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24"/>Avo sisola kinhu chochose, ila nosola kiwadile wanhu zangu na kija cha wanhu wanicholile nao, Aneli na Eshikoli na Mamule, wao wana fungu mna ivinhu avo.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Imulungu koilagana na Abulamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1"/>Vizibitile mbuli azo, Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Abulamu mzinzozi, “Abulamu, sikuudumbe! Niye ayo ngao yako. Niye na hamoja na gweye, na kinhu acho kinoga ng'hani kumwako.” <verse eid="GEN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2"/>Lakini Abulamu kalonga, “Go Mkulu Mndewa Imulungu, kongwaa choni na niye nabule mwana wa kuhazi na muhazi wangu ayo Eliezeli munhu wa ako Damesiki?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3"/>Abulamu kalonga, “Lola hungwelele bule mwana, avo mtumwa yaleligwe mng'anda yangu ayo yonda yawe muhazi wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela, “Munhu ino honda yawe muhazi wako, lakini mwana yonda umulele mwenyego ayo yonda yawe muhazi wako.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5"/>Aho Mndewa Imulungu kamulava kunze Abulamu, kamulongela, “Lola uchanha upete zinhondo, kamba kweli kodaha kuzipeta. Ulelo wako okuwa kamba vizili zinhondo azo.”<verse eid="GEN 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6"/>Abulamu kamtogola Mndewa Imulungu na kwa mbuli ayo Mndewa Imulungu kamgesa Abulamu kamba munhu yanogile mgameso gake.<verse eid="GEN 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Abulamu, “Niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu nikugalile kulawa Uli, buga da Wakalidayo, ili nikugwee isi ino.”<verse eid="GEN 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8"/>Lakini Abulamu kalonga, “Go Mkulu Mndewa Imulungu, nojuwaze kamba isi ino yokuwa yangu?”<verse eid="GEN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9"/>Avo Mndewa kamwidika, “Ngalila ng'ombe yeli na miyaka midatu na mbuzi wa kitwanzi yeli na miyaka midatu na ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo yeli na miyaka midatu na huwa na kinda da njiwa.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10"/>Abulamu kamgalila Mndewa Imulungu wanyama awo, kila imoja kambalula, kavika ivihande mmisafa mibili kuno na kuno, lakini iwandege hawabalule bule. <verse eid="GEN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11"/>Jola viwezile kuna imitufi ayo, Abulamu kawawinga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12"/>Zuwa vidikalile dohonga, Abulamu kapata utulo kawasa, bwembwe da ziza kulu dimwizila. <verse eid="GEN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Abulamu, “Ujuwe goya kamba ulelo wako okala kamba wanhu baki mwiisi ya ugeni, okuwa watumwa na odununzigwa ng'hani kwa miyaka magana mane. <verse eid="GEN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14"/>Lakini nowakoboza wanhu wa isi yonda wakale muutumwa, kukimambukizo osegela mwiisi ayo iwakalile kuno wana vinhu vingi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15"/>Lakini gweye mwenyego kokuwa mgima kwa siku nyingi na kofa moyo hoole na kozikigwa goya. <verse eid="GEN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16"/>Vizukulu vako vilembwe vobwela hano, kwavija nzambi za Waamoli zing'hali hazinavikila kuwa nyingi avo niwataguse.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17"/>Viivikile ikilo, nongo ilava yosi na wenge da moto ukwaka voneka vobita hagati ya maunde ga nyama. <verse eid="GEN 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18"/>Siku ayo Mndewa Imulungu kailagana na Abulamu, kalonga, “Nowagwaa isi ino wanhu wa ulelo wako, kulawa lwanda lwa Misili mbaka lwanda luja mkulu lwa Fulate, <verse eid="GEN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19"/>hamoja na isi za Wakeni na Wakenizi na Wakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20"/>na Wahiti na Wapelizi na Walefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21"/>na Waamoli na Wakanaani na Wagiligashi na Wayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16"/>
  <para style="s">Salai na Hajili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1"/>Avo, Salai, mwehe wake Abulamu, kakala hanamulelela wana bule. Lakini kakala na mtumwa wa kitwanzi, Mmisili, twaga jake Hajili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2"/>Avo Salai kamulongela Abulamu, “Mndewa Imulungu kangwaa ugumba. Genda ukawase na mtumwa wangu wa kitwanzi, sengine nopata wana kubitila heyo.” Avo Abulamu katogola kiyalongile Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3"/>Abaho, Salai kamsola mtumwa wake wa kitwanzi, mwenekae wa Misili, yakemigwe Hajili kamgwaa mkasano wake yamtende mwehe wake. Gago galawilila Abulamu viyakalile Kanaani kwa miyaka longo. <verse eid="GEN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4"/>Abulamu kawasa na Hajili, na Hajili kagoga inda. Lakini Hajili viyagogile inda kasonga kuitapa na kumbezeli Salai.<verse eid="GEN 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5"/>Abaho Salai kamulongela Abulamu, “Gweye ayo kilamuso cha niye kudununzwa. Niye nikugwaa mtumwa wangu, kwavija sambi kajuwa kana inda, kosonga kunibezeli niye. Mndewa Imulungu na yatutaguse niye na gweye!”<verse eid="GEN 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6"/>Lakini Abulamu kamulongela Salai, “Mtumwa wako kammakono gako, mtendele viulonda.” Avo Salai kamdununza ng'hani Hajili mbaka kakimbila.<verse eid="GEN 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7"/>Msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kamvika Hajili kuinzasa ako kuluwala, ikalile hamgwazo wa nzila ya kuchola Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8"/>Msenga ayo wa kuulanga kamuuza, “Gweye Hajili, mtumwa wa Salai, kolawa kwahi na kochola kwahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Hajili kamwidika, “Nomkimbila Salai inimsang'hanila.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9"/>Abaho msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela, “Bweleganya kwa Salai ukamtegeleze.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10"/>Abaho kamulongela, “Nokugwaa ulelo mkulu ng'hani mbaka wanhu olemelwa kuwapeta.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11"/>Abaho msenga ayo wa Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela, “Gweye kuna inda, na kolela mwana wa kimbigalo, komgwaa twaga da Ishimaeli, fambulo jake kahulika, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kahulika kudununzwa kwako. <verse eid="GEN 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12"/>Lakini mwanago kokala kamba kihongwe wa kumuhulo, hailumba na wanhu na wanhu nao hawailumba na heyo bule. Koihasanya na ndugu zake wose.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13"/>Avo Hajili kamgwaa Mndewa Imulungu iyalongile na heyo twaga da, “Imulungu konilola.” Kwavija kalonga, “Nimona heyo yonyona niye.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14"/>Lekaavo kuna sima dokemigwa Beeli Lahai Loi, fambulo jake sima da ija yeli mgima yonyona niye. Sima dijo ding'hali kuko, ako hagati ha Kadeshi na Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15"/>Avo Hajili kamulelela Abulamu mwana wa kimbigalo, Abulamu kamgwaa mwana ayo twaga da Ishimaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16"/>Hajili viyamulelile Ishimaeli, Abulamu kakala yavikize miyaka malongo manane na sita.<verse eid="GEN 16:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Kwingila kumbi acho kilaguso cha lagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1"/>Abulamu viyavikize miyaka malongo tisa na tisa, Mndewa Imulungu kamulawilila, kamulongela, “Niye na Imulungu yeli na Udahi wose, nhegeleze na utende ganogile. <verse eid="GEN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2"/>Na niye notenda lagano na gweye na kwengeza wanhu wa ulelo wako.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3"/>Abulamu kafugama, kaidulika mbaka hasi. Nayo Imulungu kamulongela, <verse eid="GEN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4"/>“Notenda lagano dino na gweye, nokulongela, kokuwa tata wa makabila mengi. <verse eid="GEN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5"/>Kulawa sambi, twaga jako hukemigwa Abulamu, ila kokemigwa Abulahamu, kwavija nikutenda tata wa makabila mengi.” <verse eid="GEN 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6"/>Nokutenda uwe na ulelo mkulu, kulawa kumwako olawa wanhu wa makabila mengi na wayagwe okuwa wandewa.<verse eid="GEN 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7"/>“Lagano jangu na gweye na ulelo wako dabule uhelelo. Avo nokuwa Imulungu wako na Imulungu wa ulelo wako. <verse eid="GEN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8"/>Nokugwaa isi ino yose ya Kanaani yuukala kamba munhu baki. Isi yose ya Kanaani yokuwa ya ulelo wako milele, na niye nokuwa Imulungu wao.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9"/>Abaho Imulungu kamulongela Abulahamu, “Na gweye udigoge lagano jangu, gweye mwenyego na ulelo wako na ng'holo zao. <verse eid="GEN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10"/>Dino dijo lagano jangu, niye na gweye, na ulelo wako, kila mbigalo kumwenu kolondigwa yengile kumbi. <verse eid="GEN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11"/>Mwingile kumbi, iwe kilaguso cha lagano jangu niye na mweye. <verse eid="GEN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12"/>Kila mwana wa kimbigalo muulelo wako yahavikiza siku nane tangu kuvumbuka yengizigwe kumbi, mutende vivo kwa watumwa waleligwe mng'anda yako na watumwa waguligwe kwa sente zenu kulawa kwa wanhu baki. <verse eid="GEN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13"/>Kila imoja yaleleke mng'anda yako, hebu yaguligwe kwa sente zako, yengile kumbi. Kino chokuwa kilaguso cha lagano jangu mzing'huli zenu na dino dokuwa lagano dilibule uhelelo. <verse eid="GEN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14"/>Mbigalo yoyose yahaleka kwingila kumbi yabaguligwe na wanhu zake kwavija kadibena lagano jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15"/>Abaho Imulungu kamulongela Abulahamu, “Na mwehe wako sikuumkeme Salai, kulawa sambi twaga jake Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16"/>Nomtendela ganogile, kokulelela mwana wa kimbigalo. Nomtendela ganogile, kokuwa mama wa makabila mengi na wandewa wa wanhu olawa kumwake.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17"/>Abulahamu kaidulika mbaka hasi, kakala kosekelela kuno kogelegeza, “Vino, vodahika kweli mwana kuvumbuka kulawa kwa mvele wa miyaka gana? Vino, Sala yeli na miyaka malongo tisa, kodaha kweli kulela mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18"/>Avo, Abulahamu kamuuza Imulungu, “Habali hutogola Ishimaeli yawe muhazi wangu?”<verse eid="GEN 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19"/>Lakini Imulungu kamwidika, “Bule! Mwehe wako Sala kokulelela mwana wa kimbigalo, komgwaa twaga da Isaka. Heyo na wanhu wa ulelo wake nokwika nao lagano dilibule uhelelo. <verse eid="GEN 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20"/>Nikuhulika viupulile mbuli ya Ishimaeli, avo nomtendela ganogile kwa kumgwaa wana wengi na ulelo mkulu. Na heyo kokuwa tata wa watawala longo na wabili na nomtenda yawe na ulelo onda uwe kabila kulu. <verse eid="GEN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21"/>Lakini lagano jangu nodika kwa Isaka, yonda yakulelele Sala aho mwakani kipindi kamba kino.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22"/>Imulungu viyamambukize kulonga na Abulahamu, kamuleka.<verse eid="GEN 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23"/>Siku didija Abulahamu kamwingiza kumbi mwanage Ishimaeli na vivija kawengiza kumbi waja yawagulile na wambigalo wose wakalile mng'anda yake kamba viyalongeligwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24"/>Abulahamu viyengile kumbi kakala na miyaka malongo tisa na tisa, <verse eid="GEN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25"/>na mwanage Ishimaeli viyengile kumbi kakala na miyaka longo na ndatu. <verse eid="GEN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26"/>Abulahamu na mwanage Ishimaeli wengila kumbi siku dimoja, <verse eid="GEN 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27"/>kengila kumbi hamoja na wambigalo wose wakalile mng'anda yake hamoja na waja waleleke mng'anda yake na waja waguligwe.<verse eid="GEN 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu kolongeligwa mbuli ya mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1"/>Zuwa vidikalile dokwaka, Abulahamu kakala yakalile hana uluhelengo lwa kibanda chake. Mndewa Imulungu kamulawilila Abulahamu behi na mibiki mikulu ya Mamule, <verse eid="GEN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2"/>Abulahamu viyenule kihanga chake, kawona wanhu wadatu wema. Viyawone, kawakimbilila na kaidulika mbaka hasi, <verse eid="GEN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3"/>Abulahamu kalonga, “Wakulu mweye, mwahaninogela sikumumbite vivino, niye na msang'hanaji wenu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4"/>Ndekeni niwagalile mazi ga kusunha magulu genu, humuleni hano hasi mdibiki. <verse eid="GEN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5"/>Kipindi mohumula, nowagalileni ndiya kidogo muje, mpate mhamba ya kugendelela na mwanza wenu. Mweye mwa wageni zangu, ndekeni niwasang'hanile.” Nao wamwidika, “Vinoga, sang'hana kamba viulongile.”<verse eid="GEN 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6"/>Avo Abulahamu himahima kengila mkibanda cha Sala, kamulongela, “Lopola, usole mhishi tano za usage unogile ng'hani, ukande, uteleke magate.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7"/>Abaho kalopola kuchola kudibumbila da fugo yake, ako kasagula bofu dimoja da ng'ombe ditelele goya, kamgwaa mtumwa wake, na heyo kapigilika himahima. <verse eid="GEN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8"/>Abaho Abulahamu kasola siagi na maziwa, na unde dipile da ng'ombe, kawatandila wageni zake. Viwakalile hasi mdibiki woja, na heyo kema behi na nao.<verse eid="GEN 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9"/>Abaho waja iwageni wamuuza, “Mwehe wako Sala kakwahi?” Abulahamu kawedika, “ka Mng'anda mkibanda.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10"/>Abaho imoja wao kalonga, “Nobwela kumwako kipindi kamba kino mwakani, na mwehe wako Sala kolela mwana wa kimbigalo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Sala yakalile haulwivi, kukisogo chake, kakala kotegeleza. <verse eid="GEN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11"/>Abulahamu na Sala wakala wavele, na Sala kakala hatumika. <verse eid="GEN 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12"/>Avo, Sala kakala koseka munda kwa munda, kalonga, “Niye namvele na mkasano wangu vivija mvele, vino nodaha kudeng'helela na kupata wana?”<verse eid="GEN 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamuuza Abulahamu, “Habali Sala kaseka na kuiuza kamba kodaha kulela mwana muuvele wake? <verse eid="GEN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14"/>Vino, kuna kinhu chochose hakidahika kwa Mndewa Imulungu? Kamba vinongile, nobwela mkipindi kikigwe, mwehe wako Sala kolela mwana wa kimbigalo.”<verse eid="GEN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15"/>Sala kengilwa bwembwe, avo kalema kwa kulonga, “Aka, sisekile bule!” Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela, “Ona, kukala useka.”<verse eid="GEN 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu kowapulila wenekae wa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16"/>Wanhu awo viwenuke ili wasegela, walongoza umwambu kudili buga da Sodoma, na Abulahamu kawasindikiza muumwanza wao. <verse eid="GEN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kalonga, “Vino, nimfise Abulahamu kinhu kinilonda kusang'hana? <verse eid="GEN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18"/>Ulelo wake okuwa kabila kulu na kubitila hewo wanhu wa makabila gose nowatendela vinhu vinogile. <verse eid="GEN 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19"/>Nimsagula heyo ili yawalagize wanage na ulelo wao wagoge nzila ya Mndewa Imulungu kwa kutenda gaja goyolonda Mndewa, avo Mndewa yagavikize gaja gayamulongele Abulahamu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Abulahamu, “Wanhu wa Sodoma na Gomola oyalaliligwa ng'hani kwavija nzambi zao zibanza. <verse eid="GEN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21"/>Avo, nochola kuko halole mwenyego, kamba gaja ganihulike gaukweli, kwavija nolonda kujuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22"/>Avo, wanhu awo wasegela, wachola Sodoma, lakini Mndewa Imulungu kasigala na Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23"/>Abaho Abulahamu kamcholela Mndewa Imulungu, kamuuza, “Vino, kweli kochola kuwakoboza wanogile hamoja na wene nzambi? <verse eid="GEN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24"/>Vino, kamba kudibuga hokuwa na wanhu wanogile malongo matano, kodikoboza buga jose? Vino, hudileka bule ili wanhu awo malongo matano wahonyeke? <verse eid="GEN 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25"/>Sigesa kamba kotenda vivo, kuwakoma wanhu wanogile hamoja na wanhu wene nzambi! Havidahika bule, kwavija msemi wa isi yose kolondigwa yataguse goya.”<verse eid="GEN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika, “Kamba nahawona wanhu wanogile malongo matano mdibuga da Sodoma, mbuli ya awo nodileka buga jose.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27"/>Abulahamu kalonga, “Chonde, niye nihonzolomoka kulonga na Mndewa hamoja niye na timbwisi na sikinhu chochose. <verse eid="GEN 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28"/>Lakini kamba wanhu wanogile wahawa malongo mane na tano badala malongo matano, vino, kodikoboza buga jose kwavija wahunguka wanhu watano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika, “Kamba nahawona wanhu wanogile wavika malongo mane na tano sidikoboza bule.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29"/>Abulahamu kengeza kulonga, “Kamba okala wanhu malongo mane waiyeka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika, “Mbuli ya wanhu awo wanogile malongo mane, sitenda vivo bule.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30"/>Abulahamu kalonga, “Go, Mndewa, chonde! sikuugevuzike, nolonga kabili. Vilihi kamba okoneka wanhu wanogile malongo madatu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika, kamba nahawona wao malongo madatu, sitenda vivo bule.<verse eid="GEN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31"/>Abulahamu kalonga, “Chonde, gela kumgongo uhonzolomo wangu wa kulonga na gweye, Mndewa. Yokuwa vilihi kamba wahakoneka wanhu wanogile malongo mabili?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika, “Mbuli ya awo malongo mabili, sitenda vivo bule.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32"/>Abaho kalonga, “Go, Mndewa, chonde! sikuugevuzike, ndeka nyengeze kulonga. Kamba okoneka wanhu wanogile longo waiyeka, yokuwa vilihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Mndewa Imulungu kamwidika, “Mbuli ya awo longo, sitenda vivo bule.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33"/>Mndewa Imulungu viyeshilize kulonga na Abulahamu, kasegela, na Abulahamu kabwela ukae kumwake.<verse eid="GEN 18:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19"/>
  <para style="s">Kwiha kwa wanhu okala Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1"/>Wasenga awo wabili wa kuulanga wavika kudibuga da Sodoma ichungulo, Lutu kakala yakalile hana ulwivi lwa dibuga da Sodoma. Viyawone, kenuka kawabokela, kaidulika mbaka hasi, <verse eid="GEN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2"/>kalonga, “Wakulu zangu, chonde tucholeni ukae kumwangu, niye na msang'hanaji wenu. Ako mosunha magulu genu na kuwasa kumwangu kilo cha lelo, abaho imitootondo ng'hani mogendelela na mwanza wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Lakini, awo walonga, “Bule, towasa baha kunze kulubuga.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3"/>Lakini Lutu kawasusumiza ng'hani mbaka watogola na wachola na heyo ukae kumwake. Lutu kawatelekela ndiya ya magate gelibule hamila, na hewo wagaja.<verse eid="GEN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4"/>Wang'hali hawanawasa, wambigalo wose wa buga da Sodoma, wabwanga kwa wavele waizunguluka ing'anda ya Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5"/>Wamkema Lutu, wamuuza, “Wakwahi wambigalo wezile kumwako? Walave kunze. Tolonda kuwawasa!”<verse eid="GEN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6"/>Lutu kalawa kunze na kuhinda ulwivi kukisogo chake. <verse eid="GEN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7"/>Kawalongela, “Mbwiga zangu, chonde, sikumutende kinhu kihile kamba acho! <verse eid="GEN 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8"/>Loleni, nina wandele wabili wang'hali wali. Ndekeni niwagalile wandele awo muwatende vimulonda. Lakini sikumuwatendele kinhu chochose wambigalo wano, kwavija wano wageni zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9"/>Lakini awo walonga, “Ndoko! Gweye kwa zinhu da kutali, na sambi koitenda kwa msemi! Tokutendela kinhu kihile ng'hani kubanza awo iwageni zako.” Wagangamala kumsung'ha Lutu mbaka walonda kubena ulwivi. <verse eid="GEN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10"/>Lakini wanhu awo wakalile mng'anda wagolosa makono gao, wamsung'hila Lutu mng'anda na kuhinda ulwivi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11"/>Abaho wawagela usuwameso wambigalo wose wakalile kunze hana ulwivi, wakulu kwa wadodo, avo hawaluwone ulwivi.<verse eid="GEN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutu kosegela Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12"/>Wanhu waja wabili wamulongela Lutu, “Vino, kunayo munhu yoyose iyagwe hano, sengine wanago, wakwe zako, hebu ndugu wayagwe iwokala kudibuga dino? Wasegese hano, <verse eid="GEN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13"/>todibananga buga dino kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kahulika wanhu viwoiyalala mbuli ya wanhu wano, na heyo katutuma twize kudibananga.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14"/>Abaho Lutu kawacholela iwakwe, walondile kusola wanage kawalongela, “Amweye, lopoleni kuhalawa hanhu hano, Mndewa Imulungu kohabananga.” Lakini iwakwe wagesa kakala kowageweza.<verse eid="GEN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15"/>Usiku viuchile wasenga awo wa kuulanga wawamba kumulongela Lutu, “Lopola! Msole mwehe wako na wandele zako wabili weli hano, ili buga dahabanangigwa sikumufe.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16"/>Lutu kakala konyawanyawa. Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kamonela bazi. Wasenga awo wa kuulanga wamgoga makono gake na makono ga mwehe wake na makono ga wandele zake wabili, wawalongoza goya kulawa kudibuga dija. <verse eid="GEN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17"/>Viwawalavile kunze, msenga imoja wa kuulanga kawalongela, “Kimbileni muuhonye ugima wenu! Sikumulole kukisogo na sikumwime hanhu hohose kubonde. Kimbileni kuvigongo, sikumufe.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18"/>Lakini Lutu kawalongela, “Bule, wakulu zangu. <verse eid="GEN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19"/>Niye na msang'hanaji wenu munyona nofaya ng'hani, munyonela bazi ng'hani kwa kuuhonya ugima wangu. Lakini sidaha bule kukimbila mbaka kuna ivigongo, zumozumo dino domvika ning'hali sinavika kuko, na niye nofa. <verse eid="GEN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20"/>Mojona buga dija? Hadili kutali bule. Ndekeni ng'himbilile kuja, dokoneka buga dodo lakini kuko konda nihonyeke.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21"/>Na heyo kamwidika, “Ona, nhogola. Buga dija sidibananga bule. <verse eid="GEN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22"/>Lopola kukimbila! Sidaha kutenda kinhu chochose mbaka vonda uvike kuko.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:22">Lekaavo buga dijo dikemigwa Soali, fambulo jake dodo.<verse eid="GEN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubanangigwa kwa Sodoma na Gomola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23"/>Lutu viyavikile Soali, zuwa dikala dikunguzuke. <verse eid="GEN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24"/>Bahaja kulawa kuulanga Mndewa Imulungu kahumulusa mabwe gokwaka moto mgamabuga ga Sodoma na Gomola, <verse eid="GEN 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25"/>kagabananga mabuga gago, bonde jose, na wenekae wose na minoga yose yotile mwiisi. <verse eid="GEN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26"/>Lakini mwehe wake Lutu kalola kukisogo na kagaluka dibwe da mkele.<verse eid="GEN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27"/>Imitondo iyagwe, Abulahamu kalopola kuchola hanhu haemile haulongozi ha Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28"/>Kalola hasi mwambu wa Sodoma na Gomola, kubonde jose kona yosi dofililika mwiisi. Yosi dijo diigala na yosi dilawa mdibiwi kulu dikwaka. <verse eid="GEN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29"/>Avo Mndewa Imulungu viyagabanange mabuga geli kubonde kuyakalile Lutu, kamgesa Abulahamu na katogola Lutu yahonyeke.<verse eid="GEN 19:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwolawa Wamoabu na Waamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30"/>Kwavija Lutu kakala kodumba kukala kudibuga da Soali, kasegela heyo hamoja na wandele zake wabili, kachola kuvigongo ako kakala kuimhango. <verse eid="GEN 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31"/>Siku dimoja, mndele imkulu kamulongela imdodo, “Lola, tataetu mvele na kuno kutukala kuduhu mbigalo wa kutuwasa kamba viwotenda wanhu wose mwiisi ili na siye tupate wana. <verse eid="GEN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32"/>Leka, tumgwee tataetu divai yang'we yakoligwe, abaho tuwase na heyo na tulele nayo wana.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33"/>Ikilo wamgwaa tatao divai, na mndele ija imkulu kawasa nayo. Lakini tatake hajuwile bule kwavija kakala yakoligwe ng'hani.<verse eid="GEN 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34"/>Imitondo iyagwe mwana imkulu kamulongela imdodo, “Jana ikilo niwasa na tata, na lelo leka tumgwee divai yakoligwe, abaho na gweye ukawase nayo avo wose tulele na tataetu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35"/>Avo kilo acho, wamgwaa tatao divai, kakoligwa, abaho mndele ija imdodo kawasa nayo, lakini tatake hajuwile bule. <verse eid="GEN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36"/>Avo, wandele wose wabili wagoga inda, waipatile kwa tatao. <verse eid="GEN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37"/>Ija imndele imkulu kalela mwana wa kimbigalo, twaga jake kamkema Moabi, heyo ayo imuhenga wa Wamoabu mbaka sambi. <verse eid="GEN 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38"/>Na mndele imdodo vivija kalela mwana wa kimbigalo, twaga jake kamkema Benami. Heyo ayo imuhenga wa Waamoni mbaka sambi.<verse eid="GEN 19:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1"/>Kulawa Mamule, Abulahamu kafunga mwanza kachola mwiisi ya Negebu, keka ukazi wake hagati ya Kadeshi na Shuli. Abaho kakala kidogo ako Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2"/>Ako kawalongela wanhu kamba Sala kakala lumbu jake. Avo mndewa Abimeleki wa Gelali kamsola Sala. <verse eid="GEN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3"/>Lakini ikilo Mndewa Imulungu kamulawila Abimeleki mwiinzozi, kamulongela, “Gweye kofa kwavija mtwanzi yuumsolile kasoligwa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4"/>Lakini Abimeleki kakala yang'hali hanawasa na Sala bule, avo kalonga, “Vino Mndewa, kowakoma wanhu welibule gehile? <verse eid="GEN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5"/>Abulahamu mwenyego iyo yalongile kamba Sala kakala lumbu jake na Sala vivija kalonga Abulahamu kakala lumbu jake. Niye nhenda avo moyo kwatu! Sitendile dihile bule.”<verse eid="GEN 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6"/>Mwiinzozi ayo, Imulungu kamulongela, “Ona, nojuwa viutendile vivo kukala moyo kwatu, na niye iyo nikutendile sikuutende nzambi, lekaavo nikugomesa sikuuwase nayo mtwanzi ayo. <verse eid="GEN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7"/>Sambi mbweze mtwanzi ayo kwa mkasano wake. Abulahamu ni mtula ndagu wangu, avo kokupulila sambi ufe. Lakini kamba humbweza bule, nokuzuma, gweye na wanhu zako wose mofa.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8"/>Avo, imitondo yake, Abimeleki kawakema wasang'hanaji zake wose na kuwapetela viyalotile, na wao wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9"/>Abaho Abimeleki kamkema Abulahamu, kamuuza, “Gweye, kunhendela choni? Nikutenda choni mbaka kutenda toneke tubananga niye na wanhu wa undewa wangu? Kuduhu munhu yotenda viunhendele gweye.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10"/>Abimeleki kamuuza Abulahamu, “Vino, kilamuso cha kutenda vino choni?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11"/>Abulahamu kamwidika, “Niye nigesa kuwa hanhu hano kuduhu munhu yomdumba Imulungu, avo wahang'homile ili wamsole mwehe wangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12"/>Ukweli heyo ni lumbu jangu, tuleleka tata imoja kila imoja na mamake, lekaavo nimsola. <verse eid="GEN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13"/>Avo Imulungu viyanhendile ndeke ng'anda ya tatangu na kuchola isi ya kutali, nimulongela mwehe wangu, ‘Kulagusa unogelwa wako kumwangu, kokose konda tuchole, walongele wanhu niye na lumbu jako.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14"/>Abaho Abimeleki kambwezela Abulahamu imwehe Sala, kamgwaa na ng'hondolo, ng'ombe na watumwa wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="GEN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15"/>Abimeleki kamulongela Abulahamu, “Lola, isi yose ino yangu, kala kokose kuulonda.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16"/>Abaho kamulongela Sala, “Nomgwaa lumbu jako magana kwa magana ga sente ili kulagusa kwa wanhu zako kamba gweye kwabule ubananzi, kila munhu kojuwa kamba hutendile mbuli yoyose ihile.” <verse eid="GEN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17"/>Abaho Abulahamu kampula Imulungu, nayo kamuhonya Abimeleki na mwehe wake na watumwa zake wa kitwanzi avo wadaha kulela wana kabili, <verse eid="GEN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18"/>kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kakala yawatendile watwanzi wose mng'anda ya Abimeleki sikuwalele wana mbuli ya Sala.<verse eid="GEN 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Kuleleka kwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamnogela Sala, katenda gaja gayalongile. <verse eid="GEN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2"/>Mna ikipindi kikija kiyalongile Imulungu, muuvele wake Abulahamu, Sala kagoga inda, kamulelela mwana wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3"/>Abulahamu kamgwaa mwana ayo yamulelile Sala twaga da Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4"/>Kamba viyalagizwe na Imulungu, Isaka viyavikize siku nane toka kuvumbuka kamwigiza kumbi. <verse eid="GEN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5"/>Abulahamu kakala na miyaka gana Isaka viyaleleke. <verse eid="GEN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6"/>Avo Sala kalonga, “Imulungu kangalila daba na munhu yoyose yonda yahulike mbuli ino koseka na niye.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7"/>Abaho kengeza kulonga, “Nani yahamulongele Abulahamu kamba Sala yahakong'heze mwana? Lakini muuvele wake nimulelela mwana wa kimbigalo.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8"/>Imwana viyakulile kalekeswa tombo. Siku da kulekeswa tombo imwana, Abulahamu katenda nyimwilinyimwili ng'hulu.<verse eid="GEN 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hajili na Ishimaeli owingingwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9"/>Siku dimoja Ishimaeli, mwanage Abulahamu yaleligwe na Hajili, Mmisili, kakala koseka. <verse eid="GEN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10"/>Sala viyawone, kamulongela Abulahamu, “Muwinge kutali mtumwa ino na mwanage, kwavija havidahika mwana wa mtumwa ino yahazi hamoja na mwanangu Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11"/>Mbuli ino imgaza ng'hani Abulahamu kwavija vivija Ishimaeli kakala mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12"/>Lakini Imulungu kamulongela, “Sikuulumile moyo mbuli ya mwana ayo hebu mtumwa wako Hajili. Togola mbuli yoyose iyokulongela Sala kwavija gweye kopata ulelo kubitila Isaka kamba vinikulongele. <verse eid="GEN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13"/>Vivija imwana wa mtumwa, nomtenda yawe na ulelo onda uwe kabila kwavija heyo vivija mwanago.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14"/>Imitondo iyagwe, Abulahamu kasola ndiya na nongo ya mazi kamgwaa Hajili. Kamdikwa mmaega gake, abaho kamuwinga heyo na mwanage. Hajili kasegela, kakala kowegela kuluwala lwa Beelisheba. <verse eid="GEN 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15"/>Gamazi vigeshile mwiinongo yake, Hajili kamtambaliza mwanage mkisolo, <verse eid="GEN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16"/>abaho kakala hasi, utali wa magulu gana. Kalonga munda kwa munda, “Sidaha kulola mwanangu viyofa.” Na viyakalile aho, kasonga kulila.<verse eid="GEN 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17"/>Imulungu kahulika viyolila imwana, na msenga wa kuulanga kamkema Hajili, kamulongela, “Hajili, kilamuso choni? Sikuudumbe, Imulungu kahulika kililo cha mwanago ako kuyeli. <verse eid="GEN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18"/>Mwinule mwanago umgoge mkono, kwavija nomtenda yawe na ulelo onda uwe kabila kulu.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19"/>Imulungu kamgubula Hajili gameso, kajona sima da mazi. Kachola kamemeza mazi inongo, kamgwaa mwanage yang'we. <verse eid="GEN 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20"/>Imulungu kakala hamoja na mwana ayo, viyakalile kokula. Kakala kuluwala na kakala galu wa kupigisa migoha kwa upinde. <verse eid="GEN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21"/>Viyakalile kokala kuluwala lwa Palani, mamake kamsolela mtwanzi wa Kimisili yawe mwehe wake.<verse eid="GEN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abulahamu koilagana na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22"/>Kipindi acho, Abimeleki hamoja na Fikoli, mkulu wa wakalizi wake, kamulongela Abulahamu, “Kila kinhu kiutenda Imulungu kahamoja na gweye. <verse eid="GEN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23"/>Lelo, niduwile kwa Imulungu honda umvizile niye, hebu wanangu, hebu lukolo lwangu. Kamba niye vinhendile ganogile kumwako na gweye unhendele vivo, hamoja na isi yuukala.”<verse eid="GEN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24"/>Abulahamu kalonga, “Noiduwila.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25"/>Abulahamu kakala yamuyalalile Abimeleki mbuli ya sima diyabokigwe na wasang'hanaji zake Abimeleki. <verse eid="GEN 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26"/>Abimeleki kamulongela, “Niye simjuwile bule munhu yatendile vivo, na gweye hunongele bule mbuli ino, niihulika sambi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27"/>Abaho Abulahamu kamgwaa Abimeleki ng'hondolo na ng'ombe, wanhu awo wabili watenda lagano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28"/>Abulahamu kawabagula ng'hondolo saba wa kitwanzi, <verse eid="GEN 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29"/>Abimeleki kamuuza Abulahamu, “Habali kowabagula ng'hondolo wano saba wa kitwanzi?”<verse eid="GEN 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30"/>Abulahamu kamwidika, “Bokela ng'hondolo wano saba wa kitwanzi kulawa mmakono gangu kamba usindila kamba niye iyo nihimbile sima dino.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31"/>Avo hanhu haja hakemigwa Beelisheba, fambulo jake sima da kuiduwila, kwavija hanhu aho wanhu awo wabili aho hawatendile lagano jao.<verse eid="GEN 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32"/>Viwailumbile ako Beelisheba, Abimeleki na Fikoli, mkulu wa wakalizi wake, kabwela mwiisi ya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33"/>Abaho Abulahamu kahanda biki dikemigwa tamalisiki ako Beelisheba, kamgwaa ukulu Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu yelibule uhelelo. <verse eid="GEN 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34"/>Abulahamu kakala ng'hani mwiisi ya Wafilisiti.<verse eid="GEN 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22"/>
  <para style="s">Imulungu komulagiza Abulahamu yamulave Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1"/>Ako kumwande, Imulungu kamgeza Abulahamu, kamkema, “Abulahamu!” Abulahamu kamwidika, “Nabaha!”<verse eid="GEN 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2"/>Imulungu kamulongela, “Msole mwanago Isaka, yuumnogela ng'hani, uchole mwiisi ya Molia, ukamulave nhosa ya kusoma moto kulugongo londa nikulagusile.” <verse eid="GEN 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3"/>Imitondo yake, Abulahamu kaidamuka, kamtanda kihongwe wake. Kawasola wasang'hanaji zake wabili na imwana Isaka. Viyamambukize kukanha ngodi za kusomela inhosa, kafunga mwanza wa kuchola hanhu kuyalongeligwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4"/>Siku da kadatu Abulahamu kenula kihanga chake kahona hanhu aho kwa kutali. <verse eid="GEN 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5"/>Abaho kawalongela wasang'hanaji zake, “Kaleni hano na ikihongwe, niye na mwanangu tochola haja kumtambikila Imulungu abaho towabwelela.” <verse eid="GEN 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6"/>Abulahamu kamdikwa Isaka ngodi za kusomela nhosa, na heyo mwenyego kasola moto na mwele. Wachola hamoja, <verse eid="GEN 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7"/>Isaka kalonga, “Agweye tata!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Tatake kamwidika, “Kolongaze mwanangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isaka kamulongela, “Moto na ngodi za baha lakini ing'hondolo wa nhosa kakwahi?”<verse eid="GEN 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8"/>Abulahamu kamwidika, “Mwanangu, Imulungu mwenyego iyo yonda yatugwelele.” Avo wose wabili wagendelela na mwanza wao.<verse eid="GEN 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9"/>Viwavikile hanhu kuyalongeligwe na Imulungu, Abulahamu kazenga upango wa kulavila nhosa na uchanha keka ngodi. Abaho kamgodeka imwana, kamtambaliza muupango wa nhosa, mna zingodi. <verse eid="GEN 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10"/>Abaho kagolosa umkono, kasola mwele yamchinje imwana. <verse eid="GEN 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11"/>Lakini msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kamkema, “Abulahamu! Abulahamu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Abulahamu kamwidika, “Nabaha.”<verse eid="GEN 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12"/>Kamulongela, “Sikuumulumize imwana. Sambi nojuwa komdumba Imulungu, kwavija hugomese bule mwanago yuumnogela.”<verse eid="GEN 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13"/>Abulahamu kahinduka, kona ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo, mhembe zake zangama mkisolo. Avo kachola kumsola ing'hondolo, kamulava nhosa ya kusoma moto hanhu ha mwanage. <verse eid="GEN 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14"/>Avo Abulahamu kahakema hanhu aho, “Mndewa Imulungu kogola.” Kamba wanhu viwolonga mbaka lelo, “Kulugongo lwa Mndewa Imulungu wanhu ogweleligwa.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15"/>Msenga wa Mndewa kamkema kabili Abulahamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16"/>kalonga, “Mndewa Imulungu kolonga vino, ‘Noiduwila mwenyego, kwavija kusang'hana vino na hugomese mwanago yeli yaiyeka yuulelile na Sala, <verse eid="GEN 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17"/>nokutenda umwede na kuutenda ulelo wako uwe kamba nhondo za kuulanga na kamba msanga wa mwhani. Ulelo wako osola isi za wanhu wawehile, <verse eid="GEN 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18"/>na kubitila ulelo wako wanhu wa makabila gose omweda kwavija kunhegeleza niye.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19"/>Abulahamu kabwela kwa wasang'hanaji zake, kachola nao Beelisheba, kakala kuko.<verse eid="GEN 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20"/>Ako kumwande Abulahamu kahulika kamba Milika kamulelela wana Naholi, ndugu yake. <verse eid="GEN 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21"/>Usi mwana wa chaudele na Buzi ndugu yake, na Kemueli tatake Alamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22"/>Kesedi na Hazo na Pilidashi na Yidilafu na Besueli, <verse eid="GEN 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23"/>Besueli kamulela Lebeka. Milika kamulelela Naholi, ndugu yake Abulahamu, wana wanane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24"/>Mtumwa wa kitwanzi, yakalile kamba mwehe wake yakemigwe Leuma, vivija kamulelela wana, Teba na Gahamu na Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23"/>
  <para style="s">Sala kofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1"/>Sala kakala na miyaka gana na malongo mabili na saba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2"/>Kafa ako kudibuga da Kiliati Aliba vivija dokemigwa Hebuloni mwiisi ya Kanaani, Abulahamu kamulilila na kamwikila tanga.<verse eid="GEN 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3"/>Abulahamu kaluleka lukuli lwa mwehe wake, kachola kulonga na Wahiti, kawalongela, <verse eid="GEN 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4"/>“Niye kumwenu na munhu baki. Ngweleleni hanhu nimzikile mwehe wangu na hawe hanhu ha kuzikila wanhu zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5"/>Wahiti wamwidika Abulahamu, <verse eid="GEN 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6"/>“Go mkulu, tutegeleze. Gweye kwa munhu mkulu usaguligwe na Imulungu. Mzike mwehe wako kudipanga dinogile ng'hani. Kila munhu kumwetu kodeng'helela kukugwaa mhango ili umzike mwehe wako na hawe hanhu ha kuzikila wanhu zako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7"/>Baho Abulahamu kafugama na kuidulika haulongozi wa Wahiti. <verse eid="GEN 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8"/>Kawalongela, “Kamba monhogolela nimzike baha mwehe wangu, chonde, mpuleni Efuloni mwanage Sohali, mbuli ya niye, <verse eid="GEN 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9"/>nimgwee sente nigule mhango yake ya Makipela, ili kuimbaka ya mgunda wake. Mpuleni nimgwee sente ilondigwa, bahano mgameso genu ili nihatende hanhu ha kuzikila.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10"/>Efuloni mwenyego kakala yakalile hamoja na Wahiti wayage wakalile waiting'hane hana ulwivi lwa dibuga, mgameso gao kamwidika, <verse eid="GEN 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11"/>“Go mkulu bule sichuuza, nokugwaa mgunda wose hamoja na imhango ili mumo. Nokugwaa mgameso ga wanhu zangu ili umzike mwehe wako.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12"/>Abulahamu kawadulikila kabili Wahiti, <verse eid="GEN 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13"/>kamulongela Efuloni mgameso gao, “Chonde, tegeleza nokupula. Nogula mgunda wose. Togola nilave fungu, mumo nomzika mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14"/>Efuloni kamwidika, <verse eid="GEN 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15"/>“Go mkulu, mgunda ouzigwa kwa kilo nne za shaba, kumwangu niye na gweye hana choni? Mzike mwehe wako.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16"/>Abulahamu katogola, mgameso ga Wahiti kamgwaa Efuloni fungu diyalongile, dikala kilo nne za shaba, vivo wakalile ouza wachuuzi wa kipindi acho.<verse eid="GEN 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17"/>Avo mgunda wose wa Efuloni ukalile ako Makipela mwambu wa Mamule, ndio kulonga mgunda na mhango na mibiki yose ikalile mzimbaka, vose avo vikala va Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18"/>Wahiti wose wakalile hana ulwivi lwa dibuga wakala wajuwile kamba vinhu vose vikala va Abulahamu.<verse eid="GEN 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19"/>Avo Abulahamu kamzika imwehe Sala mwiimhango ikalile mumgunda wa Makipela behi na Mamule uli Hebuloni mwiisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20"/>Avo mgunda ukalile wa Wahiti na mhango ili mumo isoligwa na Abulahamu hawe hanhu ha kuzikila.<verse eid="GEN 23:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24"/>
  <para style="s">Mwehe wa Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1"/>Avo, Abulahamu kakala mvele ng'hani, na Mndewa Imulungu kakala yamtendele vinhu vingi vinogile. <verse eid="GEN 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2"/>Avo kamulongela msang'hanaji wake yakalile mvele kubanza wose, yakalile yololesa vinhu vake, “Chonde ingiza mkono wako mna gamaungo gangu madeke kamba kilaguso na uiduwile kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3"/>Nokulonda uiduwile kwa Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa kuulanga na mwiisi, kamba honda umsolele mwehe mwanangu kulawa kwa wandele wa Wakanaani onikala nao hano. <verse eid="GEN 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4"/>Ubwele mwiisi inileleke kulawa kwa ndugu zangu umsolele mwehe mwanangu Isaka.”<verse eid="GEN 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5"/>Msang'hanaji wake kamuuza, “Yokuwa vilihi kamba mndele ayo yahalema kwiza na niye mwiisi ino? Avo nimbweze mwanago mwiisi yuulawile?”<verse eid="GEN 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6"/>Abulahamu kamwidika, “Bule, sikuumbweze mwanangu kuko! <verse eid="GEN 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7"/>Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa kuulanga, kandava mwiikae ya tatangu na mwiisi indeleke, kaiduwila kumwangu kamba kowagwaa isi ino ulelo wangu. Komtuma msenga wake wa kuulanga yakulongolele, ili umgalile mwanangu mwehe kulawa kuko. <verse eid="GEN 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8"/>Kamba mndele ayo yahalema kwiza na gweye, kuiduwila kwangu kumwako kokuhonya. Lakini vovose vonda iwe sikuumbweze mwanangu kuko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9"/>Avo msang'hanaji ija kengiza mkono wake mna gamaungo madeke ga imkulu wake Abulahamu, kaiduwila kamba kotenda kamba viyalondile Abulahamu.<verse eid="GEN 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10"/>Abaho msang'hanaji ayo kawasola ngamiya longo wa mkulu wake, kasegela, kachola na vinhu vingi vinogile. Kachola kudibuga diyakalile Naholi, mwiisi ya Mesopotamia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isi ya Mesopotamia</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ako umwaka ikemigwa Alamu Nahalaimu.</char></note> <verse eid="GEN 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11"/>Viyavikile, kawafugamiza iwangamiya kudisima dikalile kunze ya buga dija. Ikala ichungulo, kipindi cha watwanzi kwiza kudeha mazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12"/>Nayo kampula Imulungu, “Go Mndewa Imulungu wa mkulu wangu Abulahamu, nokupula unitaze lelo na umonele bazi mkulu wangu Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13"/>Lola, nahano hamgwazo wa sima kuwezaga kudeha mazi wandele wa kudibuga. <verse eid="GEN 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14"/>Nahamulongela mndele, ‘Chonde nenula nongo yako ungwee mazi ga kung'wa’ Yahalonga, ‘Ing'wa, na vivija nowang'weza ngamiya wako’ Yawe ija yuumsagulile msang'hanaji wako Isaka. Kwa mbuli ino nojuwa kumonela bazi mkulu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15"/>Yang'hali hanakwishiliza kumpula Imulungu, Lebeka, mndele wa Besueli, mwanage Milika, mwehe wake Naholi, ndugu yake Abulahamu, kavika kuno kapapa nongo yake mdiega. <verse eid="GEN 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16"/>Mndele ayo kakala yanogile ng'hani, kakala mhambe, hatembele na mbigalo yoyose. Kachola kudisima, kamemeza mazi nongo yake na kubwela. <verse eid="GEN 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17"/>Msang'hanaji ayo kalopola kuiting'hana nayo, kamulongela, “Chonde, ngwaa mazi ga kung'wa muinongo yako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18"/>Mndele ayo kamwidika, “Ing'wa mkulu wangu,” Bahaja kanenula nongo yake, kaigogeleza kamng'weza. <verse eid="GEN 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19"/>Viyamambukize kumng'weza mazi, kamulongela, “Vivija nowadehela mazi ngamiya wako, mbaka vonda wamambukize kung'wa.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20"/>Avo kalopola kagida gamazi mna ikiya cha kung'wela wanyama, kakimbila kudisima kadeha mazi gayagwe na kuwang'weza ngamiya wake wose. <verse eid="GEN 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21"/>Munhu ija kakala komulola goya, halongile mbuli bule, kalonda yajuwe kamba Mndewa Imulungu kaunogela mwanza wake.<verse eid="GEN 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22"/>Ngamiya viwamambukize kung'wa gamazi, munhu ija kasola pete ya zahabu ya bei ng'hulu, kampasika muimhula yake na kamvaza mmakono gake bangili mbili za zahabu za bei ng'hulu. <verse eid="GEN 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23"/>Abaho kamuuza, “Gweye mndele wa nani? Chonde nongela, ukae kumwenu kuna gati da kuwasa?”<verse eid="GEN 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24"/>Mndele ija kamwidika, “Niye na mndele wa Besueli, mwanage Milika mwehe wa Naholi.” <verse eid="GEN 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25"/>Kalonga, “Kumwetu kuna hanhu ha kuwasa wageni, na vivija mijani ya kudimila ngamiya wenu imema.”<verse eid="GEN 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26"/>Baho munhu ija kafugama, kamtambikila Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27"/>Kalonga, “Yatogoligwe Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa mkulu wangu Abulahamu, ija haisemwile bazi jake na gaja gayalongile kwa mkulu wangu. Na niye, Mndewa Imulungu kanilongoza muumwanza wangu kuing'anda ya iwandugu wa mkulu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28"/>Mndele ija kakimbila kuing'anda ya mamake na kawasimulila gose. <verse eid="GEN 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29"/>Lebeka kakala na lumbu jake yakemigwe Labani. Labani kalopola kuiting'hana na munhu ija kudisima. <verse eid="GEN 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30"/>Labani viyayonile ija ipete na bangili mmakono ga lumbu jake na viyahulike mbuli ziyalongeligwe Lebeka na munhu ayo, kamcholela munhu ayo, kamvika yemile behi na ngamiya wake kudisima. <verse eid="GEN 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31"/>Kamulongela, “Tuchole ukayangu, gweye kwa munhu unogeligwe na Mndewa Imulungu. Habali kokwima hano kunze? Niye nikutandila gati mng'anda yangu na hanhu ha kwika ngamiya wako.”<verse eid="GEN 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32"/>Avo munhu ayo kengila mng'anda. Labani kawanenula iwangamiya mizigo na kuwagwaa mijani. Abaho kamgalila msang'hanaji wa Abulahamu na wanhu zake mazi ga kusunha magulu gao. <verse eid="GEN 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33"/>Abaho wamgalila ndiya, lakini kalonga, “Sija bule mbaka nikulongele kinonda kulonga.” Labani kamulongela, “Ona, tulongele.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34"/>Munhu ija kalonga, “Niye na msang'hanaji wa Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamnogela ng'hani mkulu wangu nayo kana vinhu vingi. Kamgwaa ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na sente na zahabu na wasang'hanaji wa kimbigalo na wasang'hanaji wa kitwanzi na ngamiya na vihongwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36"/>Sala mwehe wa mkulu wangu, muuvele wake, kamulelela mkulu wangu mwana, na mkulu wangu kamgwaa mwana ayo vinhu vake vose. <verse eid="GEN 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37"/>Mkulu wangu kaniduwiliza, kalonga, ‘Sikuumsolele mwanangu mwehe kulawa kwa wandele wa Wakanaani kunikala niye. <verse eid="GEN 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38"/>Lakini chola kulubuga lwa tatangu, kwa wanhu wa lukolo lwangu ako umsolele mwanangu mwehe.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39"/>Abaho nimuuza mkulu wangu, ‘Yokuwa vilihi kamba yahalema kwiza na niye?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40"/>Lakini kanidika, ‘Mndewa Imulungu yonilongoza siku zose, komtuma msenga wake yachole na gweye na kutenda mwanza wako unoge, ili umsolele mwehe mwanangu kulawa mulukolo lwangu na mulubuga lwa tatangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41"/>Kamba wahachola kwa wanhu wa lukolo lwangu, hata kamba wahalema kukugwaa mndele baho kuiduwila kwangu kokuhonya.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42"/>“Lelo vinivikile kudisima, nimpula Imulungu, nonga, ‘Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa mkulu wangu Abulahamu, tenda mwanza wangu unoge. <verse eid="GEN 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43"/>Niye nokwima hano behi sima, yaheza mndele kudeha mazi, nompula yangwee mazi ga kung'wa mwiinongo yake. <verse eid="GEN 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44"/>Yahatogola, na vivija kowagwaa mazi ngamiya wangu, ayo kodaha kuwa ija yuumsagule yawe mwehe wa mwana wa mkulu wangu.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45"/>Ning'hali sina mambukiza kumpula Imulungu munda kwa munda, Lebeka keza na nongo yake mdiega, kachola kudisima kudeha mazi. Avo nimulongela, ‘Chonde, nigwelele mazi ga kung'wa.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46"/>Himahima kanenula nongo yake mdiega jake, kalonga, ‘Ing'wa na vivija nowang'weza ngamiya wako.’ Avo ning'wa na vivija kawang'weza iwangamiya. <verse eid="GEN 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47"/>Avo nimuuza, ‘Gweye kwa mndele wa nani?’ Kanidika, ‘Niye na mndele wa Besueli mwanage Naholi na imwehe Milika.’ Abaho nimvaza pete mwiimhula na bangili mmakono gake. <verse eid="GEN 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48"/>Abaho nifugama, nimtambikila Mndewa Imulungu. Nimtogola Mndewa, Imulungu wa mkulu wangu Abulahamu, yanilongoze niye mbaka kulukolo lwa mkulu wangu Abulahamu, ako nimona mndele wa kusoligwa na mwanage mkulu wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49"/>Avo, kamba molagusa bazi na kumtendela ganogile mkulu wangu, nongeleni, na kamba hamutenda bule, nongeleni, na niye njuwe cha kutenda.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50"/>Viwahulike avo, Labani na Besueli wamwidika, “Kwavija mbuli ino yolawa kwa Mndewa Imulungu, siye twabule mbuli ya kulonga. <verse eid="GEN 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51"/>Lebeka ino hano, msole uchole nayo. Leka yasoligwe na mwana wa mkulu wako, kamba Mndewa Imulungu mwenyego viyalondile iwe.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52"/>Msang'hanaji wa Abulahamu viyahulike kiwalongile, kamfugamila Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53"/>Abaho kalava vinhu va kuihamba va shaba na zahabu na viwalo, kamgwaa Lebeka. Vivija kawagwaa nhunza za bei ng'hulu lumbu jake Lebeka na mamake.<verse eid="GEN 24:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54"/>Abaho msang'hanaji wa Abulahamu na wanhu zake waja na kung'wa, na wawasa kuko. Imitondo viwalamuke, msang'hanaji ija kalonga, “Ndekeni mbwele kwa mkulu wangu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55"/>Lakini lumbu jake na mamake wamwidika, “Muleke imndele yakale na siye kamba siku longo abaho kochola nayo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56"/>Lakini kawalongela, “Sikumung'hawize, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kautenda mwanza wangu unoge. Ndekeni nibwele kwa mkulu wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57"/>Wao walonga, “Tumkemeni imndele tumuuze.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58"/>Avo wamkema Lebeka, wamuuza, “Kolonda kuchola na munhu ino?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Nayo kedika, “Ona, nochola nayo.”<verse eid="GEN 24:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59"/>Avo wamuleka Lebeka na msang'hanaji wake wachole hamoja na msang'hanaji wa Abulahamu na wanhu zake. <verse eid="GEN 24:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60"/>Avo wamtambikila Lebeka kwa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Gweye mndele, uwe mama wa wanhu magana kwa magana!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">Wanhu wa ulelo wako wagahume mabuga ga wanhu owehila!”<verse eid="GEN 24:60"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61"/>Abaho Lebeka na wasang'hanaji wake waitanda, wakwela ngamiya wao, wachola na msang'hanaji wa Abulahamu, wose wasegela.<verse eid="GEN 24:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62"/>Kipindi acho, Isaka kakala yasegele Beeli Lahai Loi, kakala mwiisi ya Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63"/>Siku dimoja ichungulo, kakala yacholile kumgunda kugelegeza. Viyalolile, kona ngamiya okwiza. <verse eid="GEN 24:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64"/>Lebeka viyamone Isaka, kahumuluka kulawa mna ingamiya, <verse eid="GEN 24:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65"/>kamuuza msang'hanaji wa Abulahamu, “Munhu ija yotembela mumgunda kokwiza kuno kutwili iyo nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Msang'hanaji kamwidika, “Heyo ayo mkulu wangu.” Avo kasola mtandio wake, kaigubika kihanga chake.<verse eid="GEN 24:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66"/>Msang'hanaji ayo kampetela Isaka kila kinhu kiyatendile. <verse eid="GEN 24:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67"/>Avo Isaka kamgala Lebeka mkibanda cha Sala, mamake, kawa mwehe wake, Isaka kamnogela Lebeka, avo kasamhuka mbuli ya kwaga kwa mamake.<verse eid="GEN 24:67"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25"/>
  <para style="s">Ulelo uyagwe wa Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:32-33">1 Umwaka 1:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1"/>Abulahamu kasola mwehe iyagwe, twaga jake Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2"/>Ketula kamulelela Abulahamu Zimlani na Yokushani na Medani na Midiani na Ishibaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3"/>Yokushani kamulela Sheba na Dedani. Ulelo wa Dedani wakala Waashulu na Waletushi na Waleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4"/>Wanage Midiani wakala Efa na Efeli na Hanoki na Abida na Elidaa. Wose wano walawa muulelo wa Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5"/>Abulahamu kamgwaa Isaka uhazi wa vinhu vake vose. <verse eid="GEN 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6"/>Lakini yang'hali mgima kawagwaa nhunza iwana yalelile na watumwa wake. Abaho kawagala wana awo kuna iisi ya mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa, kutali na kuyeli mwanage Isaka.<verse eid="GEN 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Abulahamu na kuzikigwa kwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7"/>Abulahamu kakala na miyaka gana na malongo saba na tano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8"/>Abulahamu viyafile kakala mvele ng'hani, kauja ng'hani na kailumba na wahenga zake wafile mwaka. <verse eid="GEN 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9"/>Wanage Abulahamu Isaka na Ishimaeli, wamzika tatao mwiimhango ya Makipela, habehi na Mamule mumgunda ukalile wa Efuloni, mwanage Sohali, Muhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10"/>Mgunda awo Abulahamu kakala yaugulile kwa Wahiti, heyo na mwehe wake Sala wazikigwa mumgunda awo. <verse eid="GEN 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11"/>Abulahamu viyafile, Imulungu kamtendela ganogile Isaka, mwanage Abulahamu, keka ng'hambi yake behi na Beeli Lahai Loi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1 Umwaka 1:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12"/>Uno awo ulelo wa Ishimaeli, mwanage Abulahamu, ija imsang'hanaji wake Sala, Hajili Mmisili, yalelile na Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wanage Ishimaeli, kamba viwaleleke, Nebayosi, mwana wa chaudele wa Ishimaeli na Kedali na Adibeeli na Mibisamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14"/>na Mishima na Duma na Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15"/>Hadadi na Tema na Yetuli na Nafishi na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16"/>Wano awo wanage Ishimaeli, wakalile watawala wa makabila longo na mbili. Mabuga gao na ng'hambi zao zikemigwa kwa matwaga gao. <verse eid="GEN 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17"/>Ishimaeli viyafile kakala yavikize miyaka gana na malongo madatu na saba, nayo kailumba na wahenga zake wafile umwaka. <verse eid="GEN 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18"/>Ulelo wa Ishimaeli wakala mna gamabuga gakalile hagati ya Havila na Shuli, behi na Misili, kuchola Ashulu. Wao wakala waigolile na ulelo uyagwe wa Abulahamu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuleleka kwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19"/>Uno awo ulelo wa Isaka mwanage Abulahamu. Abulahamu kamulela Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20"/>Isaka viyavikize miyaka malongo mane kamsola Lebeka, mndele wa Besueli, Imualamu wa Padani Alamu na lumbu jake Labani Imualamu. <verse eid="GEN 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21"/>Lebeka kakala mgumba, avo Isaka kampula Mndewa Imulungu. Nayo Mndewa Imulungu kahulika kupula kwake na imwehe Lebeka kagoga inda. <verse eid="GEN 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22"/>Inda ayo ikala ya mapacha, wang'hali hawanavumbuka wakala oisung'hasung'ha mwiinda yake. Avo kalonga, “Habali kinhu kamba kino chondawilila niye?” Avo kachola kumuuza Mndewa Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Makabila mabili ga mwiinda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">ng'holo mbili zonda uzilele, zogomba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Imoja yokuwa na nguvu kubanza iyagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">imkulu komsang'hanila imdodo.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24"/>Siku zake za kulela vizivikile, Lebeka kalela wana mapacha. <verse eid="GEN 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25"/>Wa ichanduso kakala mdung'hu, lukuli lose upipi wiiyeka, avo wamkema Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26"/>Wa kabili kavumbuka kuno kamgoga Esau mna ikisiginho, avo wamgwaa twaga da Yakobo. Lebeka viyawalelile iwana, Isaka kakala yavikize miyaka malongo sita.<verse eid="GEN 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kochuuza kiyalondigwe kuhazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27"/>Wana awo wakula, Esau kakala galu wa kusaka, kakala konogelwa kusinda kumuhulo, lakini Yakobo kakala munhu muhole, kakalaga ukae. <verse eid="GEN 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28"/>Avo, Isaka kakala yamnogele Esau, kwavija kakala kotobola nyama ziyakomile, lakini Lebeka kakala yamnogele Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29"/>Siku dimoja, Yakobo kakala koteleka ng'hunde, Esau kakala yabwelile kulawa kusaka. Kakala na nzala ng'hani, <verse eid="GEN 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30"/>avo kamulongela Yakobo, “Nofa nzala, ngolela kinhu acho ikidung'hu ndie.” Lekaavo wamgwaa twaga da Edomu, fambulo jake mdung'hu.<verse eid="GEN 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31"/>Yakobo kamwidika, “Nokugwaa kamba wahangwaa kija kiulondigwa kuhazi kamba mwana wa chaudele.”<verse eid="GEN 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32"/>Esau kamulongela, “Ona! Nolonda kufa, uhazi wangu wa mwana wa chaudele onifaya choni?”<verse eid="GEN 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33"/>Yakobo kamwidika, “Tanhu iduwile kamba kongwaa kiulondigwa kuhazi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 25:33">Esau kaiduwila kamgwaa Yakobo kiyalondigwe kuhazi. <verse eid="GEN 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34"/>Avo Yakobo kamgwaa Esau gate na ng'hunde. Kaja, kang'wa, abaho kenuka, kasegela. Vino vivo Esau viyakibezile kija kiyalondigwe kuhazi kamba mwana wa chaudele.<verse eid="GEN 25:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26"/>
  <para style="s">Isaka na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1"/>Abaho kukala na lufilili lwa nzala mwiisi, siyo ija ilawilile kipindi cha Abulahamu. Avo Isaka kamgendela Abimeleki, mndewa wa Wafilisiti, ako Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulawilila Isaka, kamulongela, “Sikuuchole mwiisi ya Misili, lakini ukakale mwiisi yonda nikulongele. <verse eid="GEN 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3"/>Kala baho, na niye nokuwa hamoja na gweye, nokutendela ganogile. Nokugwaa gweye na ulelo wako isi ino yose. Notenda kija kinongile kwa tatako Abulahamu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4"/>Noutenda ulelo wako wengezeke kamba vizili nhondo za kuulanga na nowagwaa isi zose zino. Kubitila ulelo wako, wanhu wa makabila gose omweda, <verse eid="GEN 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5"/>kwavija Abulahamu kamhulika na katenda gaja ganimulongele na katenda gaja ganimulagize na kagoga gaja ganimfundile.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6"/>Avo Isaka kakala ako Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7"/>Wenekae wa ako viwauzile mbuli ya mwehe wake, kawalongela kakala lumbu jake. Kadumba kuwalongela kamba kakala mwehe wake, kwavija kadumba wahamkomile na kumsola Lebeka, yakalile yanogile ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8"/>Viyakalile ako kwa kipindi, Abimeleki, mndewa wa Wafilisiti kasungulila mdidilisha kamona Isaka komfagatila mwehe wake. <verse eid="GEN 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9"/>Abimeleki kamkema Isaka, kamulongela, “Kumbe iyo mwehe wako! Habali kulonga kakala lumbu jako?” Isaka kamwidika, “Nidumba nahakomigwe maza nongile kakala mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10"/>Abimeleki kalonga, “Kutenda choni kumwetu? Imoja wa wanhu zangu yahadahile kuwasa na mwehe wako na gweye wahatendile toneke tubananga.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11"/>Avo Abimeleki kawazuma wanhu wose, kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose yonda yamtendele vihile munhu ino hebu mwehe wake, kokomigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12"/>Mwaka awo Isaka kahanda mbeyu mwiisi ija, kaigwisa ndiya kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kakala yamtendele ganogile. <verse eid="GEN 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13"/>Isaka kagendelela goya, kakala na vinhu vingi. <verse eid="GEN 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14"/>Wafilisiti wamonela migongo kwavija kakala na mabumbila bwando ga ng'hondolo na ng'ombe na watumwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15"/>Avo wagasila masima gose tatake gayawalagize wasang'hanaji wake wagahimbe viyakalile mgima.<verse eid="GEN 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16"/>Abaho Abimeleki kamulongela Isaka, “Segela mwiisi yetu, gweye kuna nguvu kubanza siye.” <verse eid="GEN 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17"/>Avo Isaka kasegela, keka ng'hambi yake kubonde da Gelali, na kakala kuko. <verse eid="GEN 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18"/>Isaka kagahimba kabili masima gahimbigwe kipindi Abulahamu tatake yang'hali hanakufa na kusiligwa na Wafilisiti viyafile Abulahamu. Isaka kagagwaa masima gago matwaga gagaja gakemigwe na tatake.<verse eid="GEN 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19"/>Wasang'hanaji wa Isaka viwahimbile kubonde wapata mazi ga nzasa. <verse eid="GEN 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20"/>Wasusilaji wa Gelali wakala ogomba na wasusilaji wa Isaka, walonga, “Mazi gano ga kumwetu.” Avo Isaka kadikema sima dijo, “Eseki,” fambulo jake bwato.<verse eid="GEN 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21"/>Wasang'hanaji wa Isaka wahimba sima diyagwe, sima dijo vivija wadigombela kabili, avo kadikema, “Sitina,” fambulo jake kuihila. <verse eid="GEN 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22"/>Kasegela hanhu aho, kahimba sima diyagwe. Lakini sima dijo hawadigombele bule, avo kadikema, “Lehoboti,” fambulo jake kulekeswa. Kalonga, “Sambi Mndewa Imulungu katulekesa tukale mwiisi, na tomweda ng'hani.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23"/>Isaka kasegela, kachola ako Beelisheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24"/>Mndewa Imulungu kamulawilila ikilo, kamulongela, “Niye na Imulungu wa tatako Abulahamu. Sikuudumbe kwavija niye na hamoja na gweye. Nokutendela ganogile na nokugwaa ulelo mkulu mbuli ya kija kinongile kwa msang'hanaji wangu Abulahamu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25"/>Avo Isaka kazenga upango wa kulavila nhosa, kamtambikila Mndewa Imulungu. Abaho keka ng'hambi yake kuko na wasang'hanaji zake wahimba sima diyagwe.<verse eid="GEN 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaka koitogolela na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26"/>Abimeleki hamoja na mbwigake Ahuzasi na Fikoli mkulu wake wa iwakalizi, wasegela Gelali, wachola kumulola Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27"/>Avo Isaka kawauza, “Habali mwiza kundola, mweye munihile na kuniwinga mwiisi yenu?”<verse eid="GEN 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28"/>Wao wamwidika, “Sambi tojuwa kamba Mndewa Imulungu kahamoja na gweye, avo tolonda gweye na siye tuilagane. Tokulonda ulonge, <verse eid="GEN 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29"/>kamba hututendela vihile, kamba siye vitulekile kukutendela vihile. Tukutendela ganogile na tukuleka usegele kwa tindiwalo. Sambi yokoneka Mndewa Imulungu kakutendela ganogile.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30"/>Avo Isaka kawatendela nyimwilinyimwili, nao waja na kung'wa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31"/>Imitondo yake, kila munhu kaiduwila kwa miyage. Isaka kawalaga, na hewo wamuleka moyo kwatu.<verse eid="GEN 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32"/>Siku didija wasang'hanaji wa Isaka wamwizila, wamulongela mbuli ya sima diwahimbile, walonga, “Tugavika mazi.” <verse eid="GEN 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33"/>Avo Isaka kadikema sima dijo, “Shiba,” fambulo jake kuiduwila, na mbaka sambi buga dijo dokemigwa Beelisheba.<verse eid="GEN 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kosola wehe ako Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34"/>Esau viyavikize miyaka malongo mane, kasola wehe wabili Wahiti, Yudisi mndele wa Beeli na Basemati mndele wa Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35"/>Watwanzi awo wamtenda Isaka na mwehe wake wakale moyo nyunguwaa.<verse eid="GEN 26:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27"/>
  <para style="s">Isaka komtambikila Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1"/>Isaka kakala mvele na kawa msuwameso. Avo kamkema mwanage imkulu Esau, kamulongela, “Mwanangu,” imwana kamwidika, “Tata, nabaha.”<verse eid="GEN 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2"/>Isaka kalonga, “Lola, niye namvele, na siku ya kufa kwangu siijuwile bule. <verse eid="GEN 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3"/>Avo sola upinde na msale, uchole kumuhulo ukanisakile mnyama. <verse eid="GEN 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4"/>Nhelekele ndiya inondaga, ungalile ndie, ili nikutambikile ning'hali sinakufa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5"/>Isaka viyakalile komulongela Esau, Lebeka kakala kotegeleza. Avo Esau viyacholile kusaka, <verse eid="GEN 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6"/>Lebeka kamulongela mwanage Yakobo, “Nimuhulika tatako komulongela mkulu wako Esau, <verse eid="GEN 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7"/>‘Ngalila mnyama, unhelekele, nahamala kuja nikutambikile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu ning'hali sinakufa.’ <verse eid="GEN 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8"/>Lelo mwanangu, nhegeleza goya na usang'hane kinikulongela. <verse eid="GEN 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9"/>Genda, kuna ifugo ya mbuzi, kangalile mabofu mabili ga mbuzi ganenehe, nimtelekele tatako ndiya ili mulile iyalondaga. <verse eid="GEN 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10"/>Abaho mgalile tatako yaje, ili yakutambikile yang'hali hanakufa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11"/>Yakobo kamulongela mamake, Lebeka, “Lakini kojuwa kamba mkulu wangu Esau kana upipi mulukuli, niye nabule upipi mulukuli. <verse eid="GEN 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12"/>Kamba tatangu yahambabasa, nokoneka kamba nomvizila, avo noiduwila mwenyego kubanza kutambikiligwa.” <verse eid="GEN 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13"/>Mamake kamwidika, “Mwanangu, kamba kuduwiligwa mbuli yako, leka nduwiligwe niye, genda kangalile gago gamabofu ga mbuzi.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14"/>Avo Yakobo kagenda kuwasola, kamgalila mamake, na heyo kateleka indiya iyalondaga tatake. <verse eid="GEN 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15"/>Abaho Lebeka kasola viwalo vinogile ng'hani va mwanage wa chaudele Esau, vikalile mng'anda, kamvaza mwanage imdodo Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16"/>Kamvaza ng'hwembe za mbuzi mmakono gake na msingo mulibule upipi. <verse eid="GEN 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17"/>Abaho kamgwaa ayo indiya ili umulile na gamagate gayatandile.<verse eid="GEN 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18"/>Avo, Yakobo kachola kwa tatake, kamkema, “Tatangu!” Nayo kamwidika, “Mwanangu. Gweye kwa mwanangu nani?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19"/>Yakobo kamwidika tatake, “Niye na Esau, mwanago wa chaudele, nisang'hana kamba viunongele, chonde, lamuka uje ndiya inikugalile, ili unitambikile.”<verse eid="GEN 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20"/>Isaka kalonga, “Mwanangu, vilihi hukawile bule kumpata?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Yakobo kamwidika, “Mndewa Imulungu wako iyo yanitazile kumpata.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21"/>Avo Isaka kamulongela Yakobo, “Kwesa behi mwanangu nikukwase, njuwe kamba kweli gweye kwa mwanangu Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22"/>Yakobo kakwesa behi na tatake Isaka, nayo kamkwasa na kalonga, “Sauti ya Yakobo, lakini makono ga Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23"/>Avo hamjuwile bule kwavija makono gake gakala na upipi kamba mkulu wake Esau, avo kaitanda kumtambikila. <verse eid="GEN 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24"/>Kamuuza kabili, “Vino gweye kweli kwa mwanangu Esau?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Nayo kamwidika, “Ona.”<verse eid="GEN 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25"/>Avo, Isaka kamulongela, “Mwanangu ngalila inyama yuukomile nije, nahamambukiza nikutambikile.” Yakobo kamgalila indiya na heyo kaja, vivija kamgalila idivai na heyo kang'wa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26"/>Abaho tatake Isaka, kamulongela, “Kwesa behi uninonele.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27"/>Avo, Yakobo kamgendela na kamnonela, Isaka viyahulike mnung'ho wa viwalo vake, kamtambikila, kalonga, “Oo, mnung'ho unogile wa mwanangu uigala na mnung'ho wa mgunda utambikiligwe na Mndewa Imulungu. <verse eid="GEN 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28"/>Nompula Imulungu yagale mvula mna imigunda yako na yakugwelele vinhu vose va mwiisi, na uigwise ndiya na zabibu. <verse eid="GEN 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29"/>Wanhu wa mziisi wakusang'hanile na wanhu wakufugamile, uwatawale ndugu zako na wanage mamako wakufugamile. Wonda wakuduwile, waduwiligwe na Imulungu na onda wakutambikile, nao watambikiligwe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kompula tatake yamtambikile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30"/>Isaka viyamambukize kumtambikila Yakobo, bahaja Yakobo viyasegele kwa tatake, mkulu wake Esau kabwela kulawa kusaka. <verse eid="GEN 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31"/>Na heyo vivija kateleka ndiya ili mulile, kamgalila tatake. Abaho kamulongela, “Tatangu lamuka uje nyama inikusakile, ili unitambikile.”<verse eid="GEN 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32"/>Isaka kamuuza, “Gweye kwa nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Nayo kamwidika, “Niye na mwanago wa chaudele, Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33"/>Baho Isaka kagwaya ng'hani, kalonga, “Kumbe ija yasakile nyama na kungalila nani? Na niye nija gweye haunakwiza abaho nimtambikila, nayo kotambikiligwa kweli!”<verse eid="GEN 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34"/>Esau viyahulike mbuli za tatake kaguta kwa sauti ng'hulu kalonga, “Tata, na niye vivija nitambikile!”<verse eid="GEN 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35"/>Lakini Isaka kalonga, “Ndugu yako keza kamvizila, nayo kasola kutambikiligwa kwako.”<verse eid="GEN 27:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36"/>Esau kalonga, “Uno mwanza wa kabili kamvizila, lekaavo twaga jake Yakobo! Tanhu kamboka ukulu wangu kamba mwana wa chaudele na sambi kasola kutambikiligwa kwangu!” Abaho kamuuza tatake, “Hundekele kutambikiligwa kokose?”<verse eid="GEN 27:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37"/>Isaka kamwidika Esau, “Nimtenda yakutawale na niwatenda ndugu zake wose wawe wasang'hanaji zake na nimgwaa ndiya na zabibu. Sambi kuduhu kinhu chochose chonda nikutendele mwanangu.”<verse eid="GEN 27:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38"/>Esau kamulongela tatake, “Gweye kuna kutambikila kumoja kwiiyeka tata? Nhambikile na niye vivija tatangu!” Abaho Esau kalila kwa usungu.<verse eid="GEN 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39"/>Tatake kamwidika Esau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Ukazi wako okuwa kutali na isi inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">kutali na mvula ya kuulanga.<verse eid="GEN 27:39"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40"/>Kokala kwa kuitowa kwa sime jako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">na komsang'hanila mdodo wako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">Lakini wahambiduka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">kolawa mmakono gake.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41"/>Avo, Esau kamwihila Yakobo kwavija tatake kamtambikila Yakobo. Esau kailongela, “Tatangu yahafa na siku za kumulilila zahesha, nomkoma ndugu yangu Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42"/>Lakini Lebeka viyajuwile kiyolonda kutenda Esau, kamkema Yakobo, kamulongela, “Ukale meso ndugu yako Esau kokusamhukila na kuno kogelegeza yakukome. <verse eid="GEN 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43"/>Avo mwanangu tenda vinikulongela. Lopola ukimbile kwa lumbu jangu Labani ako Halani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44"/>Kala kuko mbaka ng'hasiliki ya ndugu yako yahahola. <verse eid="GEN 27:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45"/>Ng'hasiliki ya mkulu wako yahesha na kuisemwa kija kiumtendele nomtuma munhu ubwele. Habali kwa siku dimoja nifiligwe na mweye wanangu wabili?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46"/>Lebeka kamulongela Isaka, “Niye nidonha mbuli ya wehe zake Esau wano Wahiti, kamba Yakobo vivija yahasola imoja wa watwanzi wano Wahiti, niye nokuwa na kilamuso gani cha kuwa mgima?”<verse eid="GEN 27:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1"/>Isaka kamkema Yakobo, kamtambikila, kamulagiza yolonga, “Sikuusole mtwanzi wa kulawa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2"/>Genda Padani Alamu, mng'anda ya babu yako Besueli, ukasole imoja wa wandele wa mjomba wako Labani. <verse eid="GEN 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3"/>Imulungu yeli na Udahi wose yakutendele ganogile na yakugwee wana bwando, ili uwe tata wa makabila mengi. <verse eid="GEN 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4"/>Imulungu yakutendele ganogile gweye na ulelo wako kamba viyamtendele ganogile Abulahamu, usole isi ino yuukala kamba munhu baki, isi ija Imulungu iyamgwelele Abulahamu.” <verse eid="GEN 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5"/>Avo, Isaka kamtuma Yakobo yachole, nayo Yakobo kachola Padani Alamu kwa Labani mwanage Besueli, imualamu. Labani kakala lumbu wa Lebeka mamao Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kosola mtwanzi iyagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6"/>Esau kajuwa kamba Isaka kamtambikila Yakobo na kakala yamtumile yachole Padani Alamu yakasole mwehe, na viyamtambikile kamulagiza sikuyamsole mtwanzi Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7"/>Vivija kajuwa kamba Yakobo kawategeleza tatake na mamake, kachola Padani Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8"/>Avo Esau kajuwa kamba tatake hawalondile watwanzi wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9"/>Avo, leka waja iwatwanzi yawasolile toka mwaka, Esau kachola kwa Ishimaeli mwanage Abulahamu, kamsola Mahalati mndele wa Ishimaeli, lumbu jake Nebayosi.<verse eid="GEN 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nzozi ya Yakobo ako Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10"/>Yakobo kasegela Beelisheba, kachola Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11"/>Viyavikile hanhu kwavija zuwa dikala dihongile, kasola dibwe dimoja kasigamiza pala jake mdibwe dijo kawasa utulo. <verse eid="GEN 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12"/>Kalota nzozi, mwiinzozi kona kidando kulawa mwiisi mbaka kuulanga na wasenga wa kuulanga wakala odanda na kuhumuluka mkidando acho. <verse eid="GEN 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13"/>Mndewa kema mkidando acho kalonga, “Niye ayo Mndewa Imulungu, Imulungu wa Abulahamu na Imulungu wa Isaka tatako. Isi yuuwasile nokugwaa gweye na ulelo wako. <verse eid="GEN 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14"/>Ulelo wako omema kamba timbwisi da mwiisi na okwenela mwambu wa kudihongela zuwa na mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa, mwambu wa kasikazini na mwambu wa kusini. Kubitila gweye na ulelo wako ng'holo zose za mwiisi zomweda. <verse eid="GEN 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15"/>Niye na hamoja na gweye, kokose konda uchole niye nokulola na nokubweza mwiisi ino. Sikuleka mbaka vonda nisang'hane gaja ganikulongele.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16"/>Yakobo viyalamuke muutulo, kalonga, “Ukweli Mndewa Imulungu kabaha, na niye ng'hala sijuwile bule!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17"/>Yakobo kadumba na kalonga, “Hanhu hano hogela bwembwe, vinyona hano aho ng'anda ya Imulungu kuili na lwivi lwa kuulanga.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18"/>Imitondo yake Yakobo kasola didibwe diyasigamize kudipala jake kadisimika na uchanha yake kadigidila mavuta. <verse eid="GEN 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19"/>Hanhu aho kahakema Beseli, fambulo jake, “Ng'anda ya Imulungu,” lakini aho umwaka buga dijo dikala dokemigwa Luzu. <verse eid="GEN 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20"/>Abaho Yakobo kaiduwila kwa Imulungu, kalonga, “Kamba Imulungu kokuwa hamoja na niye na kuulola goya mwanza wangu na kungwaa ndiya na viwalo, <verse eid="GEN 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21"/>na kamba nahabwela mgima ukae kwa tatangu, baho Mndewa kokuwa Imulungu wangu, <verse eid="GEN 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22"/>na hanhu hano hanisimike dibwe dino hokuwa ng'anda ya Imulungu na vose vonda ungwelele nokulavila fungu da longo.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kovika kwa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1"/>Yakobo kagendelela na mwanza wake, kavika mziisi za wanhu wa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2"/>Siku dimoja kona sima kuluwala na mabumbila madatu ga ng'hondolo gahumula, kwavija ng'hondolo awo wakala ong'wa mazi kulawa mdisima dijo. Mmulomo wa disima kukala na dibwe kulu. <verse eid="GEN 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3"/>Mabumbila ga ng'hondolo gahaiting'hana, wasusilaji odikwesa kumgwazo dibwe dijo kulawa hana umulomo wa disima na owang'weza ng'hondolo wao. Abaho odibweza bahaja mmulomo wa disima.<verse eid="GEN 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4"/>Yakobo kawauza iwasusilaji, “Ndugu zangu molawa kwahi?” Wamwidika, “Tolawa mwiisi ya Halani.”<verse eid="GEN 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5"/>Kawauza, “Mumjuwa Labani, mzukulu wa Naholi?” Wamwidika, “Ona, tumjuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6"/>Abaho Yakobo kawauza, “Vilihi mgima?” Wamulongela, “Ona, mgima, na mndele wake Laheli aija kuja kokwiza na ng'hondolo wake.”<verse eid="GEN 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7"/>Abaho Yakobo kawalongela, “Loleni zuwa ding'hali hadinahonga, siyo kipindi cha kuweka hamoja ng'hondolo. Wang'wezeni mazi mkawasusile.”<verse eid="GEN 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8"/>Lakini wao wamulongela, “Hatudaha bule kutenda vivo mbaka vibumbila vose vikale hamoja na dibwe dikwesigwe kumgwazo ya disima, baho towang'weza iwang'hondolo.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9"/>Yakobo viyakalile yang'hali kolonga na wasusilaji awo, Laheli keza na ng'hondolo wa tatake, kwavija heyo iyo yakalile yowasusila. <verse eid="GEN 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10"/>Yakobo viyamone Laheli mndele wa Labani, lumbu wa mamake na viyawone ng'hondolo wa Labani, kachola kudisima kadikwesa kumgwazo didibwe kawang'weza ng'hondolo wa mjomba wake. <verse eid="GEN 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11"/>Abaho Yakobo kamnonela Laheli kwa deng'ho mbaka mahozi gamulawa. <verse eid="GEN 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12"/>Yakobo kamulongela Laheli kamba heyo kakala ndugu wa tatake na kakala mwana wa Lebeka. Laheli kakimbila ukae kamulongela tatake.<verse eid="GEN 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13"/>Labani viyahulike mbuli za Yakobo, mwihwage, kalopola kumbokela, kamfagatila na kumnonela, kamgoneka ukae kumwake. Yakobo kampetela mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="GEN 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14"/>Nayo Labani kalonga, “Gweye kwa ndugu yangu wa usungu.” Yakobo kakala na mjomba wake kwa mwezi umoja.<verse eid="GEN 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kowasola wandele wa Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15"/>Siku dimoja Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Siyo kwavija gweye kwa ndugu avo unisang'hanile bule. Nongele fungu diulonda.” <verse eid="GEN 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16"/>Labani kakala na wandele wabili, imndele ikulu twaga jake Lea na imdodo twaga jake Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17"/>Lea kakala na meso makulu, lakini Laheli kakala yanogile na kakala na unovu.<verse eid="GEN 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18"/>Yakobo kamnogela Laheli, avo kamulongela Labani, “Nokusang'hanila kwa miyaka saba unigwee Laheli, mndele wako imdodo yawe mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19"/>Labani kamulongela, “Vinoga nikugwee gweye umsole kubanza yasoligwe na munhu iyagwe, kala bahano na niye.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20"/>Avo, mbuli ya kumnogela Laheli, Yakobo kamsang'hanila Labani miyaka saba, lakini kumwake heyo kona kamba kipindi kidodo kwavija kamnogela ng'hani Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21"/>Abaho Yakobo kamulongela Labani, “Kipindi changu kisha, avo ngwelele mwehe wangu nolonda kuwasa nayo.” <verse eid="GEN 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22"/>Avo, Labani kawagoneka wanhu kuna inyimwilinyimwili. <verse eid="GEN 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23"/>Lakini viivikile ichungulo, kamsola Lea mndele wake imkulu, kamgala kwa Yakobo. Yakobo kawasa nayo. <verse eid="GEN 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24"/>Labani kamulava Zilipa yakalile mtumwa wake yamsang'hanile mndele wake Lea. <verse eid="GEN 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25"/>Vikuchile, Yakobo kajuwa kamba kakala Lea, avo kamuuza Labani, “Kunhenda choni? Niye nikusang'hanila mbuli ya Laheli. Avo habali kunivizila?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26"/>Labani kamwidika, “Mwiisi yetu hatutendaga vivo, siyo mila yetu kutenda imdodo yasoligwe tanhu kipindi imkulu yang'hali. <verse eid="GEN 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27"/>Beta mbaka zishe siku saba za nyimwilinyimwili ya zengele, abaho nokugwaa Laheli kamba konisang'hanila kwa miyaka saba iyagwe.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28"/>Yakobo katogola. Avo Yakobo kakala na Lea kwa siku azo saba, abaho Labani kamgwaa Laheli mndele wake imdodo yawe mwehe wake. <verse eid="GEN 29:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29"/>Labani kamulava Biliha yakalile mtumwa wake wa kitwanzi yamsang'hanile mndele wake Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30"/>Avo, Yakobo kawasa na Laheli vivija. Lakini Yakobo kamnogela ng'hani Laheli kubanza Lea. Yakobo kamsang'hanila Labani miyaka saba iyagwe.<verse eid="GEN 29:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31"/>Mndewa Imulungu viyone Lea kehiligwa, kamtenda yalele wana, lakini Laheli kakala mgumba. <verse eid="GEN 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32"/>Lea kagoga inda, kalela mwana wa kimbigalo, kamkema Lubeni, fambulo jake mwana mbigalo, kwavija kalonga, “Mndewa Imulungu kona kugaya kwangu, kulawa sambi mkasano wangu koninogela.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33"/>Lea kagoga inda kabili, viyalelile mwana wa kimbigalo kalonga, “Kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kahulika kamba nihiligwa, lekaavo vivija kangwaa na ino.” Avo kamkema Simeoni, fambulo jake kahulika. <verse eid="GEN 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34"/>Abaho kagoga inda lwa kadatu na kalela mwana iyagwe wa kimbigalo, kalonga, “Sambi mkasano wangu koilumba na niye, kwavija nimulelela wana wadatu wa kimbigalo.” Avo mwana ayo kamkema Lawi, fambulo jake koilumba. <verse eid="GEN 29:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35"/>Kagoga inda lwa ikane, na viyalelile mwana wa kimbigalo kalonga, “Mwanza uno nomgwaa nhogolwa Mndewa Imulungu.” Avo mwana ayo kamkema Yuda, fambulo jake nhogolwa. Abaho kaleka kulela wana.<verse eid="GEN 29:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1"/>Laheli viyone hanamulelela Yakobo wana kamonela migongo Lea, mkulu wake. Avo kamulongela Yakobo, “Ngwaa wana buleavo nofa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2"/>Yakobo kamgevuzikila Laheli kalonga, “Vino niye ngaluka Imulungu yakutendile sikuulele wana?” <verse eid="GEN 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3"/>Laheli kamulongela, “Mtumwa wangu Biliha kabaha, wasa nayo ili yandelele mwana, na niye mhate wana kubitila heyo.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4"/>Avo Laheli kamgwaa Yakobo mtumwa wake Biliha yawe kamba mwehe wake. Yakobo kawasa nayo, <verse eid="GEN 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5"/>Biliha kagoga inda, kamulelela Yakobo mwana wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6"/>Laheli kalonga, “Imulungu kanigombela, kahulika kulila kwangu na kangwaa mwana wa kimbigalo.” Avo mwana ayo kamkema Dani, fambulo jake kanigombela. <verse eid="GEN 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7"/>Biliha mtumwa wa Laheli kagoga inda kabili, kamulelela Yakobo mwana wa kabili wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8"/>Laheli kalonga, “Niitowa ng'hani na mkulu wangu, na niye nihuma.” Avo twaga jake kamkema Nafutali, fambulo jake niitowa.<verse eid="GEN 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9"/>Lea viyone sambo isha, kamsola mtumwa wake Zilipa, kamgwaa Yakobo yawe kamba mwehe wake. <verse eid="GEN 30:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10"/>Zilipa mtumwa wa Lea kamulelela Yakobo mwana wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11"/>Lea kalonga, “Nimweda.” Avo twaga jake kamkema Gadi, fambulo jake nimweda. <verse eid="GEN 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12"/>Zilipa, mtumwa wa Lea, kamulelela Yakobo mwana wa kabili wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13"/>Lea kalonga, “Sambi nodeng'helela! Watwanzi ong'hema deng'ho.” Avo twaga jake kamkema Asheli fambulo jake deng'ho.<verse eid="GEN 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14"/>Kipindi cha kusenga ngano, Lubeni kachola kumgunda ako kona nhula,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Watwanzi wakala osola </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nhula</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ili ziwataze kugoga inda.</char></note> kamgalila mamake yakemigwe Lea. Laheli kamulongela Lea, “Chonde mbagulila nhula za mwanago.”<verse eid="GEN 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15"/>Lakini Lea kamwidika, “Gweye viumsolile mkasano wangu kugesa ikala mbuli ndodo. Na sambi vivija kolonda nhula za mwanangu.” Laheli kamwidika, “Vinoga, kamba kongwaa nhula za mwanago lelo Yakobo kowasa kumwako.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16"/>Avo, ichungulo Yakobo viyabwelile kulawa kumgunda, Lea kachola kumbokela, kamulongela, “Lelo kowasa na niye, kwavija nikulihila kwa nhula za mwanangu.” Avo ikilo kawasa kwa Lea.<verse eid="GEN 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17"/>Imulungu kamuhulika Lea, nayo kagoga inda, kamulelela Yakobo mwana wa tano wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 30:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18"/>Lea kalonga, “Imulungu kangwaa nhunza yangu, kwavija nimgwaa mkasano wangu mtumwa wangu,” avo kamkema mwana ayo Isakali, fambulo jake nhunza yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19"/>Lea kagoga inda kabili, kamulelela Yakobo mwana wa sita wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 30:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20"/>Lea kalonga, “Imulungu kamgwaa nhunza inogile. Sambi mkasano wangu konitogola kwavija nimulelela wana sita.” Avo kamkema imwana ayo Zabuloni, fambulo jake konitogola. <verse eid="GEN 30:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21"/>Abaho kalela mwana wa kitwanzi, kamkema Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22"/>Abaho Imulungu kamkumbuka Laheli, kamuhulika na kumtenda yalele wana. <verse eid="GEN 30:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23"/>Laheli kagoga inda, kalela mwana wa kimbigalo, kalonga, “Imulungu kanisegesela kinyala changu.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24"/>Avo kamkema mwana ayo Yusufu, fambulo jake kanisegesela, kwavija kalonga, “Nompula Mndewa Imulungu yanyengezele mwana iyagwe wa kimbigalo.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fugo ya Yakobo yokwengezeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25"/>Laheli viyamulelile Yusufu, Yakobo kamulongela Labani, “Ndeka mbwele ukayangu, mwiisi yangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26"/>Ngwelela wehe zangu na wanangu, niwapatile kwa kukusang'hanila, nisegele. Kujuwa vinikusang'hanile goya.” <verse eid="GEN 30:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27"/>Lakini Labani, kamulongela, “Kamba kononda, chonde sikuusegele, kwavija njuwa kwa uhawi kamba Mndewa Imulungu kanitenda nimwede mbuli ya gweye. <verse eid="GEN 30:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28"/>Nongela fungu jako, na niye nokuliha.”<verse eid="GEN 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29"/>Yakobo kamulongela, “Gweye kujuwa vinikusang'hanile, na vija fugo yako viyongezeke mmakono gangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30"/>Kwavija kija kidodo kiukalile nacho ning'hali sinavika, sambi chongezeka ng'hani na kokose kunicholile Mndewa Imulungu kakutenda umwede. Lakini sambi na niye nolonda kuwalola goya wanhu wa mng'anda yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31"/>Labani kamuuza, “Nikugwee choni?” Yakobo kamwidika, “Sikuungwee kinhu chochose, nogendelela kuwalola wanyama wako kamba konhendela kinhu kimoja. <verse eid="GEN 30:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32"/>Nhogolela niwakagule wanyama wako, lelo, na kulawa mumo, nibagule kila bofu da ng'hondolo yeli na uzegenhe zegenhe na kila ng'hondolo mtitu, na mbuzi weli na uzegenhe zegenhe. Dijo ijo fungu jangu, dinilonda. <verse eid="GEN 30:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33"/>Avo ako kumwande, kinongile chokoneka goya, vonda wize kulola fungu jangu. Mbuzi yoyose yelibule uzegenhe zegenhe hebu ng'hondolo yelibule utitu yahakoneka mkibumbila changu, iyo kebigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34"/>Labani kamwidika, “Ona, na iwe kamba viulongile.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35"/>Lakini siku didija Labani kawabagula mbuzi wose wa kimbigalo weli na uzegenhe zegenhe hebu mindilizi ndilizi na mbuzi wose wa kitwanzi weli na uzegenhe zegenhe hebu mindilizi ndilizi, vivija kawasegesa ng'hondolo wose weli watitu, kawagwaa wanage wawasusile kamba fungu da Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36"/>Labani na bumbila dijo dili fungu da Yakobo, kainega na Yakobo muumwanza wa kutembela siku ndatu, nayo Yakobo kagendelela kuwasusila wanyama wasigale wa Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37"/>Avo, Yakobo kasola fito mbisi za mibiki midatu kagabandula gamagome, na katenda misitali mzifito azo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38"/>Abaho kazisimika zifito ziyabandule kuulongozi wa viya va kung'wela mazi, hanhu haja wanyama wezaga kung'wa mazi, kwavija wanyama wahaiting'hana hamoja kung'wa mazi oikwela. <verse eid="GEN 30:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39"/>Wanyama waikwela na kugoga inda kuulongozi wa fito azo, walela wana weli na uzegenhe zegenhe na mindilizi ndilizi. <verse eid="GEN 30:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40"/>Yakobo kageka kumgwazo mabofu ga ng'hondolo, abaho awo wasigale kawatenda walole ubazi wa wanyama weli na uzegenhe zegenhe na utitu kudikalile bumbila da Labani. Kwa kutenda avo, Yakobo kapata bumbila jake mwenyego, na hadikile hamoja na wanyama wa Labani.<verse eid="GEN 30:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41"/>Avo chahavika kipindi cha wanyama weli na nguvu kugoga inda, Yakobo kokwika zifito kuulongozi wao mna iviya va kung'wela mazi, ili waikwele na wagoge inda kuulongozi wa fito azo. <verse eid="GEN 30:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42"/>Lakini hazikile fito azo kuulongozi wa wanyama wanyolile. Hakibitile kipindi kitali, wanyama wanyolile wakala wa Labani, na waja weli na nguvu wakala wa Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43"/>Avo, Yakobo kawa tajili ng'hani, kakala na mabumbila makulu ga wanyama, kakala na watumwa wa kitwanzi na wa kimbigalo na ngamiya na vihongwe.<verse eid="GEN 30:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo komkimbila Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1"/>Yakobo kahulika wanage Labani viwakalile olonga, “Yakobo kasola kila kinhu cha tataetu na utajili kaupata kulawa kwa tataetu.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2"/>Vivija Yakobo kakala yajuwile kamba Labani kakala hamgesa bule kamba viikalile haichanduso. <verse eid="GEN 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3"/>Abaho Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Yakobo, “Bwela mwiisi ya wahenga zako na lukolo lwako, na niye nokuwa hamoja na gweye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4"/>Avo Yakobo kawatuma wanhu wawakeme Laheli na Lea weze kuluwala kuyakalile na fugo yake. <verse eid="GEN 31:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5"/>Yakobo kawalongela, “Nokona sambi tataenu hangesa kamba viikalile ichanduso, lakini Imulungu wa tatangu kahamoja na niye. <verse eid="GEN 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6"/>Mweye mojuwa nimsang'hanila tataenu kamba vindahile. <verse eid="GEN 31:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7"/>Hata avo kamvizila na kugalusa fungu jangu miyanza longo. Lakini Imulungu hamulekile yandumize. <verse eid="GEN 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8"/>Tataenu viyalongile, ‘Wanyama weli na uzegenhe zegenhe wao fungu jako,’ avo bumbila jose dilela wanyama weli na uzegenhe zegenhe, na viyalongile, ‘Wanyama weli na mindilizi ndilizi wao fungu jako,’ avo bumbila jose dilela wanyama weli na mindilizi ndilizi. <verse eid="GEN 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9"/>Avo Imulungu kamboka tataenu fugo yake, kangwaa niye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10"/>“Kipindi cha wanyama kugoga inda, ndota nzozi, mwiinzozi ayo mbona mbuzi wose wa kimbigalo wawakwelile wanyama awo wakala na mindilizi ndilizi na uzegenhe zegenhe. <verse eid="GEN 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11"/>Mwiinzozi ayo, msenga wa kuulanga kang'hema, ‘Yakobo,’ na niye nimwidika, ‘Nabaha!’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12"/>Kanongela, ‘Lola, mbuzi wose wa kimbigalo, iwokwela mbuzi wa kitwanzi wana mindilizi ndilizi na uzegenhe zegenhe, kwavija nichona kija kiyokutendela Labani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13"/>Niye ayo Imulungu yakulawilile ako Beseli kuja kuugidile mavuta mdibwe na kuiduwila kumwangu, sambi segela mwiisi ino, ubwele mwiisi yako.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14"/>Laheli na Lea wamwidika Yakobo, “Siye twabule uhazi usigale kwa tataetu! <verse eid="GEN 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15"/>Katutenda kamba wanhu baki, katuchuuza na kuzinanga sente zituchuuzigwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16"/>Vinhu vose Imulungu viyambokile tataetu va kumwetu na wanetu. Avo sang'hana kinhu chochose kiyakulongele Imulungu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17"/>Abaho Yakobo kawakweza wanage na wehe zake mna iwangamia. <verse eid="GEN 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18"/>Kawasusila kuulongozi wanyama wake wose, na vinhu vose viyapatile ako Padani Alamu, kafunga mwanza wa kubwela kwa tatake Isaka mwiisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19"/>Labani viyacholile kuwakanha mibahila iwang'hondolo. Laheli keba vinyago viyavitambikilaga tatake. <verse eid="GEN 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20"/>Yakobo hamulongele bule Labani imualamu kamba kosegela, kamfisa. <verse eid="GEN 31:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21"/>Avo Yakobo kasegela na vinhu vake vose, kaloka lwanda lwa Fulate, kagenda Gileadi, isi ya kukigongo.<verse eid="GEN 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Labani komkweleleza Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22"/>Siku da kadatu, Labani kalongeligwa kamba Yakobo kakimbila. <verse eid="GEN 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23"/>Avo, Labani kasola wanhu zake, kamkweleleza Yakobo kwa kipindi cha siku saba, kamvika kuvigongo mwiisi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24"/>Lakini ikilo, Imulungu kamulawilila Labani imualamu, mwiinzozi kamulongela, “Iteganye sikuumtende Yakobo kinhu chochose kihile.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25"/>Avo Labani kamvika Yakobo, kipindi acho Yakobo kakala yekile ng'hambi yake kukigongo. Labani nayo na ndugu zake, keka ng'hambi yake kukigongo cha Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26"/>Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Kutenda choni? Kumvizila na kuwasola wandele zangu kamba wanhu wagogigwe kuing'hondo. <verse eid="GEN 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27"/>Habali kung'himbila kinyelegezi, kumvizila? Wahanongele, nahakulagile kwa deng'ho, kwa nyila kwa ngoma na bango. <verse eid="GEN 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28"/>Hundekile niwalage kwa kuwanonela wazukulu zangu na wanangu, avo kutenda ubozi. <verse eid="GEN 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29"/>Nodaha kukutenda vihile, lakini Imulungu wa tatako ikilo cha lelo kanongela, ‘Iteganye sikuumtende Yakobo kinhu chochose kihile.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30"/>Nojuwa kamba kusegela kwavija kukala usulukila ng'hani kubwela ukae kwa tatako, lakini habali kunibila vinyago vangu vinivitambikila?” <verse eid="GEN 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31"/>Yakobo kamwidika Labani, “Nidumba, kwavija nigesa wahambokile wandele zako. <verse eid="GEN 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32"/>Lakini wahamona munhu yoyose kana vinyago vako, kokomigwa. Mgameso ga ndugu zetu zahila kinhu chochose cha kumwako, na kili chako ukisole.” Yakobo kakala hajuwile bule Laheli kakala yebile vinyago va Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33"/>Avo, Labani kengila mkibanda cha Yakobo, mkibanda cha Lea na mkibanda cha waja watumwa wabili wa kitwanzi, lakini hapatile kinhu bule. Viyalawile mkibanda cha Lea, kengila mkibanda cha Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34"/>Avo Laheli kakala yavisolile vinyago vija, kavifisa hasi ya mkoba wa kukalila uchanha ya ngamiya na mwenyego kakala uchanha yake. Labani kazahila kila hanhu mkibanda, lakini hapatile kinhu bule. <verse eid="GEN 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35"/>Laheli kamulongela tatake, “Sikuugevuzike go mkulu, sidaha bule kwima haulongozi wako, niye notumika.” Kazahila lakini havonile bule vinyago vake.<verse eid="GEN 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36"/>Yakobo kagevuzika, kagomba na Labani. Yakobo kamuuza Labani, “Kimbanange choni, choni kimbanange mbaka konisaka kamba vino? <verse eid="GEN 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37"/>Sambi kuzahila mna ivinhu vangu vose, avo kupata choni kili chako? Vike hano mgameso ga ndugu zetu, waleke watutaguse niye na gweye. <verse eid="GEN 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38"/>Ng'hala na gweye kwa kipindi cha miyaka malongo mabili. Kuduhu ng'hondolo wako na mbuzi wako yalemelwe kulela, na sidile ng'hondolo wako wa kimbigalo. <verse eid="GEN 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39"/>Kamba ng'hondolo kakomigwa na wanyama wa kumuhulo, niye nikala noliha mwenyego. Gweye kunonda nikulihe kamba yahebigwa imisi hebu ikilo. <verse eid="GEN 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40"/>Avo, imisi nikala nolukula na zuwa na ikilo nhoigwa na beho na kuwasa meso. <verse eid="GEN 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41"/>Niye ng'hala ukayako miyaka malongo mabili. Nikusang'hanila miyaka longo na nne mbuli ya wandele zako wabili na nikusang'hanila kwa miyaka sita mhate fugo yangu, lakini gweye kugalusa fungu jangu miyanza longo. <verse eid="GEN 31:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42"/>Kamba siyo Imulungu wa tatangu, Imulungu wa Abulahamu na Imulungu yamtendile Isaka yamdumbe hakalile na niye, wahaniwingile makono gaiyeka. Lakini Imulungu kalola kugaya kwangu na sang'hano za makono gangu na ikilo cha lelo kakuzuma.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Labani na Yakobo oilagana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43"/>Labani kamwidika Yakobo, “Watwanzi wano wandele zangu, wana wano wanangu, na wanyama wano wangu. Lakini niye notenda choni kwa wandele zangu, hebu kwa wana wawalelile? <verse eid="GEN 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44"/>Avo, tutende lagano niye na gweye, diwe usindila mgameso gangu na gweye.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45"/>Avo, Yakobo kasola dibwe, kadisimika. <verse eid="GEN 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46"/>Yakobo kawalongela ndugu zake, “Lundizeni mabwe.” Avo wasola mabwe wagalundiza, na hewo waja ndiya aho behi ya dilundo da gamabwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47"/>Labani kadikema lundo dijo da mabwe, Yegali Sahaduta, lakini Yakobo kadikema Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48"/>Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Lundo dino dotukumbusa niye na gweye.” Lekaavo twaga jake hakemigwa Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49"/>Vivija hanhu aho hakemigwa Misipa, kwavija Labani kalonga, “Mndewa Imulungu yatulolese niye na gweye twahawa baki baki.” <verse eid="GEN 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50"/>Labani kagendelela kulonga, “Kamba kowatendela vihile wandele zangu hebu wahasola mtwanzi iyagwe, hata kamba sijuwile, kumbuka Imulungu kotulola.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51"/>Vivija Labani kamulongela Yakobo, “Lola lundo dino, na mzengo uno unikile hagati yako gweye na niye. <verse eid="GEN 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52"/>Lundo dino na mzengo uno votulola, niye sibita mwambu wa lundo dino kwiza kumwako, na gweye sikuwize ubazi wangu kundumiza. <verse eid="GEN 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53"/>Imulungu wa Abulahamu na Imulungu wa Naholi na Imulungu wa tatao, watutaguse.” Avo Yakobo kaiduwila kwa twaga da Imulungu iyamtendile tatake Isaka yamdumbe. <verse eid="GEN 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54"/>Yakobo kachinja mnyama kamulava nhosa kukigongo, kawagoneka wanhu zake waje ndiya. Viwamalile kuja, wawasa kukigongo. <verse eid="GEN 31:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55"/>Imitondo, Labani kawanonela wandele zake na wazukulu zake, kawatambikila abaho kasegela kabwela ukae.<verse eid="GEN 31:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo koitanda kuiting'hana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1"/>Yakobo viyakalile kochola, wasenga wa kuulanga waiting'hana nayo. <verse eid="GEN 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2"/>Yakobo viyawone kalonga, “Ino ng'hambi ya Imulungu!” Avo hanhu aho kahakema Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3"/>Yakobo kawatuma wasenga wamulongolele kuchola kwa ndugu yake Esau, mwiisi ya Seili ako Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4"/>Kawalagiza walonge vino, “Mulongeleni vino mkulu wangu Esau, ‘Msang'hanaji wako Yakobo kolonga vino, ng'hala na Labani mbaka sambi. <verse eid="GEN 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5"/>Nina ng'ombe, na vihongwe, mabumbila ga ng'hondolo na mbuzi na watumwa wa kimbigalo na wa kitwanzi. Avo go mkulu nokugalila usenga uno, ili wahanyona umbonele bazi.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6"/>Iwasenga viwabwelile kwa Yakobo, wamulongela, “Tuvika kwa ndugu yako Esau, nayo kamzila kokwiza kukubokela, na kailongoza na wambigalo magana mane.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7"/>Avo, Yakobo kakala moyo nyunguwaa na bwembwe, kawagola wanhu zake mvibumbila vibili, vivija kawagola ng'hondolo na mbuzi na ng'ombe na ngamiya. <verse eid="GEN 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8"/>Kagesa muumoyo, “Kamba Esau yaheza na kuditowa bumbila dimoja, bumbila diyagwe dohonyeka.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9"/>Abaho Yakobo kapula, kalonga, “Go Imulungu wa tatangu Abulahamu na Imulungu wa tatangu Isaka, go Imulungu unongele mbwele mwiisi yangu na mulukolo lwangu na kunongela konhendela ganogile. <verse eid="GEN 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10"/>Niye sifaya koneligwa bazi na moyo unogile unitendele niye msang'hanaji wako. Vinilokile mwambu wa Yolidani ng'hala nabule kinhu chochose ila mkongoja, lakini sambi ninago mabumbila gago mabili. <verse eid="GEN 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11"/>Nokupula unihonye mmakono ga ndugu yangu Esau, kwavija nodumba sikuyeze kututowa wose niye na iwana na mama zao. <verse eid="GEN 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12"/>Lakini gweye kunongela, ‘Nokutenda umwede na noutenda ulelo wako kamba msanga wa mwhani, haudahika kupetigwa.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13"/>Avo, ikilo Yakobo kawasa baho. Abaho kabagula vinhu vake, yamgwee nhunza ndugu yake Esau. <verse eid="GEN 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14"/>Zinhunza zikala mbuzi wa kitwanzi magana mabili na mbuzi wa kimbigalo malongo mabili na ng'hondolo wa kitwanzi magana mabili na ng'hondolo wa kimbigalo malongo mabili. <verse eid="GEN 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15"/>Ngamiya okong'heza malongo madatu hamoja na mabofu gao, ng'ombe wa kitwanzi malongo mane na mibigalo longo, na vihongwe wa kitwanzi malongo mabili na mbigalo longo. <verse eid="GEN 32:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16"/>Kawagwaa wasang'hanaji wake, kila imoja na bumbila jake kawalongela, “Nongoleleni kila bumbila diinege na bumbila diyagwe muumwanza wetu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17"/>Kamulagiza msang'hanaji yalongole, “Ndugu yangu Esau yahakuting'hana na kukuuza, ‘Gweye kwa mtumwa wa nani, na kochola kwahi na wanyama wano walongole wa nani?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18"/>Gweye umwidike, ‘Vinhu vino va msang'hanaji wako Yakobo, nhunza ino ya mkulu wangu Esau, na heyo kakuchugu kokwiza.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19"/>Vivija kamulagiza munhu wa bumbila da kabili, na da kadatu na wose wayagwe wawasondelele, “Mwahamting'hana Esau mulonge vivo. <verse eid="GEN 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20"/>Abaho sikumuisemwe kulonga, ‘Msang'hanaji wako Yakobo kakuchugu kokwiza.’ ” Yakobo katenda avo kuno kogesa, “Sengine nomuhoza kamba wanhu wahalongola na nhunza zino, abaho twahaiting'hana, sengine kombokela.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21"/>Avo, wanhu walongola na zinhunza, heyo mwenyego kawasa kuing'hambi.<verse eid="GEN 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo koigela mhambaga na munhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22"/>Ikilo Yakobo kalamuka, kawasola wehe zake wabili, watumwa zake wa kitwanzi wabili na wanage longo na imoja, waloka lwanda lwa Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23"/>Viyamambukize kuwalosa umwambu, vivija kavilosa vinhu vose viyakalile navo. <verse eid="GEN 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24"/>Avo, Yakobo kasigala yaiyeka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:24">Munhu imoja keza, waigela mhambaga mbaka imitootondo. <verse eid="GEN 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25"/>Munhu ayo viyone hadaha bule kumuhuma Yakobo, kamtowa mzimbweto mkigudi mbaka katuhuka. <verse eid="GEN 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26"/>Abaho munhu ayo kamulongela Yakobo, “Ndeka nichole sambi ocha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Lakini Yakobo kedika, “Sikuleka uchole mbaka unitambikile.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27"/>Munhu ayo kamuuza, “Twaga jako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Nayo kamwidika, “Yakobo.”<verse eid="GEN 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28"/>Munhu ayo kamulongela, “Sambi hukemigwa Yakobo kabili, lakini kokemigwa Izilaeli kwavija kuihuma na Imulungu na wanhu, na gweye kugangamala.”<verse eid="GEN 32:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29"/>Yakobo kamulongela munhu ayo, “Chonde nongela twaga jako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Lakini munhu ayo kedika, “Habali koniuza twaga jangu?” Abaho kamtambikila.<verse eid="GEN 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30"/>Yakobo kalonga, “Nimona Imulungu meso kwa meso, na ning'hali mgima.” Avo kahakema hanhu aho Penueli. <verse eid="GEN 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31"/>Yakobo viyakalile kosegela Penueli, zuwa dikala dilawile, kakala koiseseza mbuli ya mbweto zake. <verse eid="GEN 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32"/>Avo, Waizilaeli mbaka lelo hawaja bule muge uli mzimbweto za kigudi, kwavija baho itoigwe mbweto ya Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 32:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na Esau oiting'hana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1"/>Yakobo kamona Esau kokwiza na wanhu zake magana mane, avo, kawagola wanage kumwake Lea, Laheli na waja watumwa wabili. <verse eid="GEN 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2"/>Watumwa na wanao kaweka haulongozi, abaho Lea na wanage, kukisogo chao kamwika Laheli na Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3"/>Yakobo mwenyego kalongola, kaidulika mbaka hasi miyanza saba, mbaka viyavikile behi na ndugu yake. <verse eid="GEN 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4"/>Esau kamkimbilila kumbokela Yakobo, kamfagatila na kamnonela, wose wabili wakala olila. <verse eid="GEN 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5"/>Esau viyalolile na kuwona watwanzi na iwana kauza, “Wano weli hamoja na gweye kina nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Yakobo kamwidika, “Wano awo wana waja Imulungu kwa bazi jake kanigwaa niye msang'hanaji wako.” <verse eid="GEN 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6"/>Abaho waja watumwa wa kitwanzi na wanao wakala mmabehi, waidulika. <verse eid="GEN 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7"/>Lea nayo na wanage keza, kaidulika. Kukimambukizo, Laheli na Yusufu weza, nao waidulika.<verse eid="GEN 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8"/>Esau kauza, “Na bumbila dino diniiting'hane najo mnzila hano dofambula choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Yakobo kamwidika, “Go, mkulu, nilonda uninogele.”<verse eid="GEN 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9"/>Lakini Esau kamwidika, “Ndugu yangu, na niye nina vinhu vingi, vinhu vako viwe vako mwenyego.”<verse eid="GEN 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10"/>Yakobo kamulongela, “Bule, kamba kweli kononda, bokela nhunza yangu, kwavija nahalola kihanga chako kamba nolola kihanga cha Imulungu vija viumbokele goya. <verse eid="GEN 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11"/>Chonde, togola nhunza inikugalile, kwavija Imulungu kanyonela bazi, kangwaa kila kinhu kinonda.” Avo Yakobo kagendelela kumsusumiza mbaka katogola.<verse eid="GEN 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12"/>Esau kalonga, “Tuchole, na niye nokulongolela.”<verse eid="GEN 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13"/>Lakini Yakobo kamulongela, “Mkulu wangu, gweye kojuwa wana wano wang'hali ving'hele, na fugo zino zokong'heza. Avo nolondigwa kuzilola goya. Kamba wanyama wano, ogaligwa mkudu mkudu kwa siku dimoja, wanyama wose wofa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14"/>Avo, nokupula ulongole na niye nokwiza mholemhole, noziseseza fugo zangu na wanangu mbaka vonda nikuvike ako Seili.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15"/>Esau kalonga, “Leka nikulekele wanhu zangu wayagwe.” Lakini Yakobo kalonga, “Aka, sikuutende vivo. Niye nodeng'helela kwavija gweye mkulu wangu koninogela.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16"/>Avo, siku didija Esau kafunga mwanza wa kubwela Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17"/>Yakobo kachola mbaka Sukoti. Kazenga ng'anda na fugo zake kazizengela mabumba. Lekaavo hanhu aho hakemigwa Sukosi.<verse eid="GEN 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18"/>Kulawa kuko Sukoti mwiisi ya Padani Alamu Yakobo kavika goya ako kudibuga da Shekemu mwiisi ya Kanaani, keka ng'hambi behi na buga dijo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19"/>Hanhu aho kuyekile ng'hambi kahagula kulawa mulukolo lwa Hamoli tatake Shekemu kwa vihande gana va shaba. <verse eid="GEN 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20"/>Avo, ako kazenga upango wa kulavila nhosa kaukema Eli Elohe Izilaeli, fambulo jake Imulungu ni Imulungu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34"/>
  <para style="s">Dina kowasigwa kwa nguvu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1"/>Avo Dina mndele wake Lea, ija Lea yalelile na Yakobo, kachola kuwatembelela wandele wa isi ayo. <verse eid="GEN 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2"/>Baho, Shekemu mwanage Hamoli, Muhivi mkulu wa isi viyamone kamgoga kamuwasa kwa nguvu na kamgela kinyala. <verse eid="GEN 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3"/>Moyo wake uilumba na Dina mndele wa Yakobo, kamnogela mndele ayo, kalonga nayo mbuli zamulile. <verse eid="GEN 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4"/>Shekemu kamulongela Hamoli, tatake, “Nisolele mndele ino yawe mwehe wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5"/>Yakobo viyahulike kamba mndele wake Dina kawasigwa kwa nguvu na Shekemu, kanyamala mbaka viwabwelile wanage kwavija wanage wakala mmigunda na zifugo zose. <verse eid="GEN 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6"/>Hamoli tatake Shekemu, kamcholela Yakobo, kalonga nayo. <verse eid="GEN 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7"/>Kipindi acho wanage Yakobo wabwela mmigunda. Viwahulike mbuli ayo wagevuzika ng'hani kwavija Shekemu kawaliga wanhu wa Izilaeli kwa kumuwasa kwa nguvu mndele wa Yakobo kinhu kigomesigwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8"/>Hamoli kawalongela, “Moyo wa mwanangu Shekemu omulonda mndele wenu. Chonde mulekeni yamsole. <verse eid="GEN 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9"/>Tuisolele mweye na siye, mutugwee wandele zenu na mweye musole wandele zetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10"/>Mweye modaha kukala na siye, na isi ino yokuwa haulongozi wenu, kaleni amo muchuuze vinhu venu, na soleni vinhu mumo.”<verse eid="GEN 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11"/>Abaho Shekemu kamulongela tatake Dina na iwalumbu, “Nhogoleleni, na niye nowagwaa chochose kimulonda. <verse eid="GEN 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12"/>Nongeleni kinhu chochose cha zengele na nhunza, hata zahawa nyingi nolava ili nimsole.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13"/>Wanage Yakobo wamwidika Shekemu na tatake Hamoli, kwa uvizi, kwavija kamfitiza Dina, lumbu jao. <verse eid="GEN 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14"/>Wamulongela, “Hatudaha kutenda vivo, lumbu jetu yasoligwe na munhu hengile kumbi. Mbuli kamba ayo yotugela kinyala. <verse eid="GEN 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15"/>Lakini towatogolela kwa mbuli ino imoja, muwe kamba siye, kila mbigalo kumwenu yengile kumbi. <verse eid="GEN 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16"/>Baho towagwaa mndele wetu, na siye tosola wandele zenu, tokala na mweye, na siye tokuwa kinhu kimoja. <verse eid="GEN 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17"/>Lakini mwahalema kwingila kumbi, siye tomsola lumbu jetu na tosegela.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18"/>Mbuli ayo iwanogela Hamoli na mwanage Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19"/>Mbwanga ayo yakalile yotegelezigwa ng'hani mng'anda ya tatake, hakawile bule kutenda mbuli ayo, kwavija kakala yamnogele mndele wa Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20"/>Hamoli na imwana Shekemu wachola kuna ulwivi lwa dibuga kuko koiting'hanaga na walonga na wambigalo wayao wa buga dijo. <verse eid="GEN 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21"/>Wawalongela, “Wanhu wano mbwiga zetu, tuwaleke wakale mwiisi yetu na wachuuze kinhu chochose, isi ino ng'hulu kumwetu siye na wao. Todaha kuwasola wandele zao na wao odaha kusola wandele zetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22"/>Lakini wanhu wano watogola kukala kumwetu na kuwa kinhu kimoja kwa mbuli ino, siye tuwengize kumbi wambigalo wose kamba hewo viwengile kumbi. <verse eid="GEN 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23"/>Vino, ng'hondolo zao, na wanyama wao wose honda wawe kumwetu? Avo, tuilumbe nao, nao okala kumwetu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24"/>Avo wambigalo wose wacholile kuna ulwivi wa dibuga wawatogolela Hamoli na mwanage Shekemu, avo kila mbigalo kudibuga kengila kumbi.<verse eid="GEN 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25"/>Siku da kadatu kumwande, kuno wang'hali na usungu wa kwingila kumbi, wana wabili wa Yakobo, Simeoni na Lawi lumbu zake Dina, wasola misime yao, wengila kwa kinyelegezi kudibuga wawakoma wambigalo wose. <verse eid="GEN 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26"/>Wawakoma kwa misime Hamoli na mwanage Shekemu na wamsola Dina mng'anda ya Shekemu wasegela. <verse eid="GEN 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27"/>Wana wayagwe wa Yakobo wawezila wanhu awo wafile wavisola vinhu va buga dijo kwavija wamfitiza lumbu jao. <verse eid="GEN 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28"/>Wasola ng'hondolo na mbuzi na ng'ombe na vihongwe na kila kinhu kikalile kudibuga na mmigunda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29"/>Wasola kila kinhu kinogile, wawagoga watwanzi zao na wanao na walawanya na kila kinhu kikalile mzing'anda.<verse eid="GEN 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30"/>Yakobo kawalongela Simeoni na Lawi, “Mweye mungalila zumozumo na sambi Wakanaani na Wapelizi na kila munhu mwiisi ino konihila. Wanhu zangu niye wadodo kamba awo wose wahailumba ili wanivamile onikoma niye na wanhu wose wa mng'anda yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31"/>Lakini hewo wamwidika tatao, “Vino, vinoga viwamtendele lumbu jetu kamba mgoni?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35"/>
  <para style="s">Imulungu komtendela ganogile Yakobo ako Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1"/>Imulungu kamulongela Yakobo, “Segela uchole Beseli, ukakale kuko. Kanzengele niye upango wa kulavila nhosa, niye Imulungu nikulawilile viukalile komkimbila ndugu yako Esau.”<verse eid="GEN 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2"/>Yakobo kawalongela wanhu wa mng'anda yake, na wose wakalile hamoja na heyo, “Segeseni minyago yenu ili kumwenu, isunheni, mkasaule viwalo venu. <verse eid="GEN 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3"/>Tusegele tuchole ako Beseli kuko nomzengela Imulungu upango wa kulavila nhosa, ayo yanidike siku ya kugaya kwangu, kakala hamoja na niye muumwanza wangu wose.” <verse eid="GEN 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4"/>Wao wamgwaa Yakobo vinyago vose viwavitambikile vikalile mmakono gao na heleni zikalile mmagwiti gao, Yakobo kavihimbila hasi ya biki da mwaloni dikalile ako Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5"/>Yakobo na wanage viwakalile osegela Imulungu kawatenda wanhu wa mabuga gakalile behi wadumbe, avo hawawakweleleze bule. <verse eid="GEN 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6"/>Avo, Yakobo hamoja na wanhu wose yakalile nao wavika kudibuga da Luzu, vivija dokemigwa Beseli mwiisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7"/>Ako kazenga upango wa kulavila nhosa, kahakema hanhu aho Eli Beseli, kwavija ako Imulungu yamulawilile viyakalile komkimbila ndugu yake. <verse eid="GEN 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8"/>Debola msang'hanaji wa Lebeka kafa, kazikigwa ako behi ya Beseli, hasi ya mwaloni. Avo hanhu aho hakemigwa, “Mwaloni wa kuiyalala.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9"/>Yakobo, viyabwelile kulawa Padani Alamu, Imulungu kamulawilila kabili kamtenda yamwede. <verse eid="GEN 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10"/>Imulungu kamulongela, “Twaga jako Yakobo, lakini sambi hukemigwa Yakobo kabili, twaga jako dokuwa Izilaeli.” Avo Yakobo kakemigwa Izilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11"/>Nayo Imulungu kamulongela, “Niye iyo Imulungu nili na Udahi wose, ulele ng'hani na mongezeke. Makabila mengi golawa kumwako na wandewa olawa mkigudi chako. <verse eid="GEN 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12"/>Isi iniwagwelele Abulahamu na Isaka vivija nokugwelela gweye, na nowagwelela wanhu wa ulelo wako baho kumwande.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13"/>Avo, Imulungu kamuleka kulawa hanhu aho kuyakalile kolonga nayo. <verse eid="GEN 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14"/>Yakobo kasimika dibwe hanhu aho hayalongile na Imulungu, kagida nhunza ya king'waji na vivija kagida mavuta. <verse eid="GEN 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15"/>Yakobo kahakema hanhu aho hayalongile na Imulungu, Beseli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Laheli kofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16"/>Wachola kulawa Beseli, mbaka hasigala hadodo kuvika Efulata, Laheli kagogigwa na usungu wa kulela, usungu wake ukala mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17"/>Usungu viumgogile ng'hani, imtwanzi yamtazile kulela kamulongela, “Sikuudumbe, kupata mwana iyagwe wa kimbigalo.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18"/>Viyakalile kotapatapa, kwavija kakala kokanha loho, kamkema imwana Benoni, fambulo jake kunyunyuwala, lakini tatake kamkema Benjamini, fambulo jake kumweda.<verse eid="GEN 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19"/>Laheli kafa, kazikigwa mwiinzila ya Efulata, sambi yojuwika kamba Beselehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20"/>Yakobo kasimika mhanda uchanha ya panga dijo, na mbaka lelo dojuwika kamba mhanda ya panga da Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21"/>Abaho Izilaeli kagendelela na mwanza, keka ng'hambi yake mwambu wa kabili wa lingo da Edeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Umwaka 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22"/>Avo Izilaeli viyakalile mwiisi ija, Lubeni kawasa na Biliha, imoja wa watumwa wa Yakobo yakalile kamba mwehe wake. Nayo Yakobo kaihulika mbuli ayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Yakobo kakala na wana longo na wabili wa kimbigalo.<verse eid="GEN 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23"/>Wanage Lea wakala, Lubeni, mwana wa chaudele wa Yakobo, na Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda na Isakali na Zabuloni.<verse eid="GEN 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24"/>Wanage Laheli wakala, Yusufu na Benjamini.<verse eid="GEN 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25"/>Wanage Biliha mtumwa wa Laheli wakala, Dani na Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26"/>Wanage Zilipa mtumwa wa Lea wakala, Gadi na Asheli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:26">Wano awo wana wa kimbigalo wa Yakobo waleleke ako Padani Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27"/>Yakobo keza kwa Isaka, tatake ako Mamule kudibuga da Kiliati Aliba vivija dokemigwa Hebuloni isi kuwakalile Abulahamu na Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28"/>Isaka kakala miyaka gana na malongo manane. <verse eid="GEN 35:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29"/>Isaka kafa kuno mvele na kauja ng'hani, kailumba na wahenga zake wafile umwaka. Iwana Esau na Yakobo wamzika tatao.<verse eid="GEN 35:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36"/>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa Esau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:34-37">1 Umwaka 1:34-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1"/>Uno awo ulelo wa Esau, vivija kokemigwa Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2"/>Esau kasola wehe mna iwandele wa isi ya Kanaani. Ada mndele wa Eloni, Muhiti, na Oholibama mndele wa Anaho na mzukulu wa Sibeoni Muhivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3"/>vivija kamsola Basemati mndele wa Ishimaeli lumbu jake Nebayosi. <verse eid="GEN 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4"/>Ada kamulelela Esau, Elifazi, na Basemati kamulelela Leueli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5"/>na Oholibama kamulela Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola. Wano wao wanage Esau, waleligwe na wehe zake wadatu ako kuna iisi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6"/>Esau kasola wanage na wehe zake na wose wakalile mng'anda yake na fugo zake na vinhu vose viyakalile navo ako Kanaani kachola isi ili kutali na ndugu yake Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7"/>Wakala na vinhu vingi avo hawadahile bule kukala hamoja, isi iwakalile haidahile bule kwenela fugo zao zose. <verse eid="GEN 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8"/>Lekaavo Esau, vivija kokemigwa Edomu, kakala kuna iisi ya vigongo va Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9"/>Uno uwo ulelo wa Esau muhenga wa wanhu wa Edomu okala kuna iisi ya vigongo va Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wana wa kimbigalo wa Esau, Elifazi mwanage Ada mwehe wake Esau na Leueli mwanage Basemati mwehe wake Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11"/>Wanage Elifazi wakala Temani na Omali na Sefo na Gatamu na Kenazi.<verse eid="GEN 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12"/>Vivija Elifazi mwanage Esau kakala na mtumwa wa kitwanzi yakalile kamba mwehe wake kakemigwa Timina, ayo nayo kamulelela mwana yakemigwe Amaleki. Wana wao wazukulu wa Esau kwa mwehe wake Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13"/>Wanage Leueli wakala, Nahasi na Zela na Shama na Miza. Wano awo wazukulu wa Esau kwa mwehe wake Basemati.<verse eid="GEN 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14"/>Wano awo wanage Oholibama mndele wa Anaho mzukulu wa Sibeoni. Kamulelela mkasano wake Esau wana wadatu, Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15"/>Wano awo wakalile iwakulu mna zing'holo za wazukulu wa Esau.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 36:15">Wanage Elifazi chaudele wa Esau,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:15">Temani na Omali na Sefo na Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16"/>Kola na Gatamu na Amaleki. Wano wao iwakulu muulelo wa Elifazi ako Edomu, wakala wazukulu wa Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17"/>Na Leueli, mwanage Esau,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:17">kawalela Nahasi na Zela na Shama na Miza, wano wao iwakulu walawile kwa Leueli ako Edomu, wakala wazukulu wa Basemati, mwehe wa Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18"/>Wanage Oholibama, mwehe wake Esau wakala,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:18">Yeushi na Yalamu na Kola. Wano awo iwakulu walawile kwa Oholibama mndele wa Anaho.<verse eid="GEN 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19"/>Wano awo wanhu wa ulelo wa Esau, vivija kokemigwa Edomu, na wano awo iwakulu.<verse eid="GEN 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulelo wa Seili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Umwaka 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20"/>Wano awo wanage Seili, Muholi na vivija awo wenekae wa isi ayo.</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:20">Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Anaho, <verse eid="GEN 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21"/>Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani wano awo iwakulu walawile kwa Waholi na wanage Seili ako mwiisi ya Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22"/>Wanage Lotani wakala,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:22">Holi na Hemamu. Lotani kakala na lumbu jake yokemigwa Timina.<verse eid="GEN 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23"/>Wanage Shobali wakala,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:23">Alivani na Manahati na Ebali na Shefo na Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24"/>Wanage Sibeoni wakala,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:24">Aya na Anaho. Anaho iyo yonile nzasa ya mazi ga moto ako kuluwala, viyakalile kowasusila ivihongwe wa Sibeoni tatake.<verse eid="GEN 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25"/>Wanage Anaho wakala,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:25">Dishoni na Oholibama mndele wa Anaho.<verse eid="GEN 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26"/>Wanage Dishoni wakala,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:26">Hemadani na Eshibani na Isilani na Kelani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27"/>Wanage Eseli wakala,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:27">Bilihani na Zaawani na Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28"/>Wanage Dishani wakala,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:28">Usi na Alani.<verse eid="GEN 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29"/>Wano awo iwakulu kwa Waholi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 36:29">Lotani na Shobali na Sibeoni na Anaho, <verse eid="GEN 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30"/>Dishoni na Eseli na Dishani, kila imoja kakala mkulu mulukolo lwake mwiisi ya Seili.<verse eid="GEN 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wandewa wa isi ya Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Umwaka 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31"/>Avo wano awo wandewa watawale ako mwiisi ya Edomu, kipindi acho wanhu wa Izilaeli hawanatawaligwa na mndewa yoyose.<verse eid="GEN 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32"/>Bela mwanage Beoli katawala ako Edomu, na twaga da buga jake dikala Dinihaba.<verse eid="GEN 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33"/>Bela viyadanganike, Yobabu mwanage Zela, kulawa isi ya Bosila kawa mndewa hanhu hake.<verse eid="GEN 36:33"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34"/>Yobabu viyadanganike, Hushamu kulawa isi ya Watemani kawa mndewa hanhu hake.<verse eid="GEN 36:34"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35"/>Hushamu viyadanganike, Hadadi mwanage Bedadi, ayo yawahumile iwakalizi wa Midiani ako mwiisi ya Moabu, kawa mndewa hanhu hake. Buga jake dikemigwa Aviti.<verse eid="GEN 36:35"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36"/>Hadadi viyadanganike, Samila kulawa mwiisi ya Masileka, katawala hanhu hake.<verse eid="GEN 36:36"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37"/>Samila viyadanganike, Shauli kulawa Lehoboti behi ya lwanda lwa Fulate, kawa mndewa hanhu hake.<verse eid="GEN 36:37"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38"/>Shauli viyadanganike, Baali Hanani mwanage Akiboli kawa mndewa hanhu hake.<verse eid="GEN 36:38"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39"/>Baali Hanani mwanage Akiboli viyadanganike, Hadadi kawa mndewa hanhu hake. Twaga da buga jake dikemigwa Pau, na twaga da imwehe kakemigwa Mehetabeli biti Matiledi mzukulu wa Mezahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40"/>Wano awo wakalile iwakulu muulelo wa Esau, wekigwa kwa matwaga gao na ng'holo zao na isi zao,</para>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 36:40">mkulu Timina na mkulu Aliva na mkulu Yesesi,<verse eid="GEN 36:40"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41"/>na mkulu Oholibama na mkulu Ela na mkulu Pinoni,<verse eid="GEN 36:41"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42"/>na mkulu Kenazi na mkulu Temani na mkulu Mibisali,<verse eid="GEN 36:42"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43"/>mkulu Magidieli na mkulu Ilamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:43">Wano awo wakalile iwakulu ako Edomu. Watambuligwa kamba viwakalile okala mwiisi ayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 36:43">Esau ayo muhenga wa wanhu wa Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu na ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1"/>Yakobo kakala mwiisi iyakalile tatake, isi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2"/>Ino ayo simulizi ya Yakobo na wanage.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yusufu viyakalile na miyaka longo na saba, kakala kosusila bumbila da fugo hamoja na ndugu zake. Nayo kakala mbwanga hamoja na wanage Biliha, na wanage Zilipa, wehe wa tatake. Nayo Yusufu kamulongelaga tatake gose gehile ga ndugu zake.<verse eid="GEN 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3"/>Avo, Izilaeli kamnogela ng'hani Yusufu kubanza wanage wose, kwavija kamulela muuvele, na kamsonela kanzu tali dinogile.<verse eid="GEN 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4"/>Ndugu zake viwonile tatao komnogela ng'hani Yusufu kubanza hewo wose, wamwihila na hawalongile nayo kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="GEN 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5"/>Yusufu kalota nzozi, na viyawalongele ndugu zake, avo wabanza kumwihila. <verse eid="GEN 37:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6"/>Kawalongela, “Chonde, tegelezeni nzozi ino indotile, <verse eid="GEN 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7"/>siye tukala kumgunda tofunga makinza ga ngano, bahaja kinza jangu dima wima, na makinza genu gema kuzunguluka kinza jangu, abaho gadifugamila.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8"/>Ndugu zake wamulongela, “Vino, kogesa gweye kokuwa mndewa na kututawala siye?” Avo, wengeza kumwihila ng'hani mbuli ya nzozi yake na gaja gayalongaga mbuli yao.<verse eid="GEN 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9"/>Abaho kalota nzozi iyagwe, na kawalongela ndugu zake, kawalongela, “Loleni nilota nzozi iyagwe, avo zuwa na mbalamwezi na nhondo longo na imoja vikala vinifugamila.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10"/>Viyamulongele tatake hamoja na ndugu zake, tatake kamkomhokela kamulongela, “Nzozi gani ayo yuulotile? Vino niye na mamako na ndugu zako tokufugamila mbaka hasi?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11"/>Ndugu zake wamonela migongo, lakini tatake keka mbuli ayo muumoyo.<verse eid="GEN 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kouzigwa na kogaligwa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12"/>Siku dimoja ndugu zake wachola kususila ng'hondolo wa tatao ako Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13"/>na Izilaeli kamulongela Yusufu, “Gweye kojuwa ndugu zako, osusila ng'hondolo ako Shekemu, avo izo nikutume kumwao.” Yusufu kedika, “Ona.”<verse eid="GEN 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14"/>Avo kamulongela, “Genda kawalole kamba wose ogendelela goya hamoja na zifugo zose, abaho ubwele unongele.” Avo Yakobo kamtuma kulawa kubonde da Hebuloni. Yusufu viyavikile ako Shekemu, <verse eid="GEN 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15"/>kamvika munhu kokwanga mmigunda, munhu ija kamuuza, “Kozahila choni?”<verse eid="GEN 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16"/>Yusufu kedika, “Nowazahila ndugu zangu. Chonde nongela osusila kwahi?”<verse eid="GEN 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17"/>Munhu ayo kalonga, “Hano wahalawa, niwahulika olonga ochola Dosani.” Avo Yusufu kagendelela kuwazahila ndugu zake kawavika ako Dosani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18"/>Avo ndugu zake wamona toka yeli kutali, na yang'hali hanavika wakala kiseto cha kumkoma. <verse eid="GEN 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19"/>Wailongela, “Amweye, ayo nyamiloto kokwiza. <verse eid="GEN 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20"/>Mulopole tukamkome na tumwase kudisima dimoja dili hano, abaho tulonge kadigwa na mng'onyo. Tulole nzozi zake zokuwa kwahi.”<verse eid="GEN 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21"/>Lubeni viyahulike vivo kageza kumuhonya na makono gao, kalonga, “Bule, sikutumkome. <verse eid="GEN 37:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22"/>Sikumwite damu ya munhu. Mwaseni kudisima dino dili hano kuluwala, lakini sikummulumize.” Lubeni kalonga avo ili yamuhonye kulawa mmakono gao abaho yambweze kwa tatake. <verse eid="GEN 37:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23"/>Avo Yusufu viyavikile kwa ndugu zake, wamsaula kanzu jake ditali diyavalile, <verse eid="GEN 37:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24"/>na wamgoga wamwasa kudisima dijo. Avo kudisima dijo kukala kuduhu mazi, dikala dinyalile.<verse eid="GEN 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25"/>Viwakalile hasi na kuja, wenula vihanga vao, wawona mwanza wa Waishimaeli olawa Gileadi ochola Misili. Ngamiya wao wakala wapapile ubani na mkegeni na manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26"/>Yuda kawalongela ndugu zake, “Vino topata choni twahamkoma ndugu yetu na kulufisa lukuli lwake? <verse eid="GEN 37:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27"/>Lekeni tumchuuze kwa Waishimaeli wano, na makono getu sikugamulumize kwavija ino ndugu yetu wa usungu.” Ndugu zake wamtogolela. <verse eid="GEN 37:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28"/>Viwabitile wachuuzi Wamidiani, ndugu zake Yusufu wamulava kudisima, wamchuuza kwa Waishimaeli kwa vihande malongo mabili va shaba, awo wamsola Yusufu mbaka Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29"/>Lubeni viyabwelile kudisima, na viyone Yusufu kamduhu, kadega kiwalo chake kwa usungu. <verse eid="GEN 37:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30"/>Kawacholela ndugu zake kalonga, “Imbwaga kamduhu muja, na niye nichole kwahi?”<verse eid="GEN 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31"/>Avo, wachinja bofu da mbuzi, wadivabika dikanzu mwiidamu. <verse eid="GEN 37:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32"/>Abaho wamgalila tatao dikanzu, wamulongela, “Tudidondola kanzu dino, tanhu dilole goya kamba da mwanago hebu siyo.”<verse eid="GEN 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33"/>Kadijuwa kalonga, “Ona, dino kanzu da mwanangu Yusufu, kadigwa na mng'onyo, loo, mwanangu kadegigwa degigwa.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34"/>Abaho Yakobo kadega kiwalo chake kwa usungu, kavala gunia. Kamulilila mwanage kwa siku nyingi. <verse eid="GEN 37:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35"/>Wanage wose, wa ikimbigalo kwa wa ikitwanzi weza kumuhoza umoyo tatao, lakini kalema kuhozigwa umoyo, kalonga, “Bule, nogendelela kumuyalalila mwanangu mbaka vonda nichole hasi kuna iisi ya wafile kuyali.” Avo, Yakobo kagendelela kumuyalalila Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36"/>Kipindi acho ako Misili awo Iwamidiani wamchuuza Yusufu kwa Potifa, imoja wa iwakulu wa mndewa Falao, ayo kakala mkulu wa iwakalizi wa ng'anda ya mndewa.<verse eid="GEN 37:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38"/>
  <para style="s">Yuda na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1"/>Avo, kipindi acho, Yuda kawaleka ndugu zake, kachola kukala na munhu imoja mwenekae wa Adulami twaga jake Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2"/>Viyakalile kuko kamona mndele wa Shua, munhu wa isi ya Kanaani. Yuda kamsola mndele ayo kawa mwehe wake, <verse eid="GEN 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3"/>kagoga inda, kalela mwana wa kimbigalo, twaga jake wamkema Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4"/>Kagoga inda kabili kalela mwana wa kimbigalo, twaga jake wamkema Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5"/>Abaho kalela mwana wa kadatu, vivija wa kimbigalo, twaga jake wamkema Shela. Shela viyavumbuke Yuda kakala Kezibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6"/>Yuda kamsolela mwehe mwanage wa chaudele Eli, twaga da mwehe ayo Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7"/>Lakini Eli, chaudele wa Yuda katenda gehile mgameso ga Mndewa Imulungu, avo Mndewa kamkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8"/>Avo, Yuda kamulongela Onani, “Mwingilile mwehe wa ndugu yako, kwavija vivo ulondigwa kutenda ukamulelele ndugu yako wana.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9"/>Lakini Onani kakala yajuwile kamba wana awo honda wawe wake, avo viyamwingilile mwehe wa ndugu yake, ketila hasi zimbeyu na kamnyima ndugu yake wana. <verse eid="GEN 38:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10"/>Avo mbuli ayo yaitendile haimnogele bule Mndewa Imulungu, avo kamkoma. <verse eid="GEN 38:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11"/>Yuda kamulongela imukwe, “Kala ugane mng'anda ya tatako mbaka mwanangu Shela vonda yawe mbala goya.” Kwavija kagesa, “Sambi yafe kamba ndugu zake.” Avo Tamali kachola kukala mng'anda ya tatake.<verse eid="GEN 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12"/>Siku heleketwaa zibita, mndele wa Shua mwehe wa Yuda kafa. Yuda viyamambukize gamatanga, kasegela na mbwigake Hila, munhu wa Adulami wachola Timina kwa wanhu wakalile okanha mibahila ya ng'hondolo wake. <verse eid="GEN 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13"/>Tamali viyahulike kamba tatake mkwe kamnzila kochola Timina kukanha mibahila ya ng'hondolo wake, <verse eid="GEN 38:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14"/>kasaula kiwalo chake cha ugane, kaigubika mtandio, abaho kakala hasi hana ulwivi lwa Enaimu, ukalile mnzila ya kuchola Timina. Kuno kagesa kamba Shela kakala mbala goya, lakini hagweleligwe bule yawe mkasano wake.<verse eid="GEN 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15"/>Yuda viyamonile kagesa kakala mtwanzi mgoni, kwavija kakala yagubike ikihanga. <verse eid="GEN 38:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16"/>Kakala hajuwile bule kamba kakala mkwe yake, avo kabaguka hamgwazo mnzila, kalonga, “Nolonda kuwasa na gweye.” Tamali kamuuza, “Nahatogola kongwaa choni?”<verse eid="GEN 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17"/>Kamwidika, “Nokugwaa bofu da mbuzi dili mdibumbila jangu.” Nayo kamulongela, “Wike kinhu kulagusa kamba kongalila ajo dibofu da mbuzi.”<verse eid="GEN 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18"/>Yuda kamuuza, “Kolonda nike choni?” Tamali kedika, “Ngwelele acho ikinhu kili na kilaguso chako na nzabi yake hamoja na mkongoja uugogile.” Avo Yuda kamgwaa, abaho kamuwasa nayo kagoga inda. <verse eid="GEN 38:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19"/>Avo, Tamali kachola ukae kumwake, kasaula mtandio wake, kavala kabili viwalo vake va ugane.<verse eid="GEN 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20"/>Yuda kagala bofu da mbuzi kwa mkono wa mbwigake munhu wa Adulami ili yapate vinhu vake viyekile kwa mtwanzi ayo, lakini hamvikile bule. <verse eid="GEN 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21"/>Kawauza wenekae wa aho, “Kakwahi mtwanzi ija imgoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Watwanzi wakala otenda </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ugoni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kamba nzila ya kuinogeza imilungu yao.</char></note> yakalile mnzila ya kuchola Enaimu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Wamwidika, “Hano hanakala mtwanzi mgoni bule.”<verse eid="GEN 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22"/>Avo kabwela kwa Yuda kamulongela, “Simonile bule! Na iwenekae wa aho wanongela hanakala mtwanzi yoyose mgoni kumwao.”<verse eid="GEN 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23"/>Yuda kalonga, “Muleke yakale navo vinhu avo, bule wanhu otuseka. Gweye kuchola kumgalila bofu da mbuzi, lakini humvikile bule.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24"/>Avo, viibitile miyezi midatu Yuda kalongeligwa, “Mkwe yako Tamali sambi mgoni, na vino sambi kana inda mbuli ya ugoni.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:24">Yuda kalagiza, “Mulaveni kunze mumsome moto.”<verse eid="GEN 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25"/>Viwakalile omulava kunze, Tamali katuma usenga kwa tatake mkwe, ulonga, “Munhu mwene vinhu vino iyo yangelile inda.” Kalonga, “Vilole goya, vinhu vino va nani, pete ino na nzabi na mkongoja uno.”<verse eid="GEN 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26"/>Yuda kavijuwa vinhu avo na kalonga, “Tamali katenda goya kubanza niye. Ona kwavija hasoligwe bule na mwanangu Shela.” Toka siku dijo Yuda hawasile kabili na Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27"/>Kipindi cha kuifungula vikivikile wajuwa kamba kakala na wana wabili wa kimbigalo mna iinda. <verse eid="GEN 38:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28"/>Viyakalile koifungula, mwana imoja kalava mkono, avo imng'hunga kasola luzi ludung'hu kamfunga mumkono kalonga, “Ino ayo yasongile kuvumbuka.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29"/>Lakini mwana ayo kaubweza mkono wake mgati, miyage iyo yasongile kuvumbuka. Imng'hunga kalonga, “Mbona gweye kubita kwa nguvu!” Avo kamkema Pelesi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30"/>Abaho ndugu yake yakalile na luzi ludung'hu mumkono kalawa kunze, nayo wamkema Zela.<verse eid="GEN 38:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu na mwehe wa Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1"/>Avo, Yusufu kagaligwa Misili. Mmisili imoja yakemigwe Potifa, yakalile imoja wa iwakulu wa Falao, na kakala mkulu wa iwakalizi wa ng'anda ya mndewa, kamgula kulawa kwa Waishimaeli awo. <verse eid="GEN 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2"/>Mndewa Imulungu kakala na Yusufu na kamtenda yamwede, kakala mng'anda ya mkulu ayo Mmisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3"/>Mkulu ayo viyajuwile kamba Mndewa Imulungu kakala na Yusufu na Mndewa kamtenda yamwede kwa kila kinhu kiyatendile, <verse eid="GEN 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4"/>avo, Yusufu kanogeligwa na Potifa na kamtenda yawe mtumwa wake heyo mwenyego, kamwika yawe mwimilizi wa ng'anda yake na yalolese vinhu vake vose. <verse eid="GEN 39:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5"/>Kulawa kipindi Potifa kiyamtendile mwimilizi wa ng'anda yake na kila kinhu kiyakalile nacho, Mndewa Imulungu kamtenda Mmisili ayo yamwede mbuli ya Yusufu. Kumweda ako kukala mna ikila kinhu kiyakalile nacho mng'anda yake na kumgunda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6"/>Avo Potifa keka kila kinhu mmakono ga Yusufu, na hatendile kinhu chochose, ila ndiya iyadile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Yusufu kakala yanenehe na yanogile. <verse eid="GEN 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7"/>Avo, kukala na kipindi mwehe wa mkulu wake, kamsulukila Yusufu, kamulongela, “Wasa na niye.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8"/>Lakini Yusufu kalema, kamulongela, “Lola mkulu wangu halola kinhu chochose mng'anda, kwavija niye nabahano. Kila kinhu kakika mmakono gangu. <verse eid="GEN 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9"/>Kuduhu munhu mng'anda ino konibanza niye. Mkulu wangu hangomese kugoga kinhu chochose ila gweye kwavija kwa mwehe wake. Avo habali nitende ubananzi awo, nimtendele Imulungu nzambi?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10"/>Hamoja mtwanzi ayo kagendelela kumnanahiza Yusufu, lakini Yusufu kalema kuwasa nayo hebu kukala nayo.<verse eid="GEN 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11"/>Lakini siku dimoja, Yusufu kengila mng'anda kusang'hana sang'hano yake, mng'anda kukala kuduhu mtumwa iyagwe. <verse eid="GEN 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12"/>Avo mwehe wake Potifa kagoga kanzu jake, kamulongela, “Wasa na niye.” Lakini Yusufu kamulekela idikanzu mmakono gake, kakimbila kunze. <verse eid="GEN 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13"/>Mtwanzi ayo viyone Yusufu kamulekela kanzu jake na kukimbila kunze, <verse eid="GEN 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14"/>kawakema watumwa wa ng'anda yake kawalongela, “Loleni, mkasano wangu katugalila Muebulania yatulige! Kengila mng'anda yawase na niye, lakini niguta nyangi. <verse eid="GEN 39:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15"/>Viyamhulike noguta nyangi, kaleka kanzu jake, kakimbila kunze.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16"/>Avo mtwanzi ayo kadika goya dikanzu jake, mbaka mkasano wake viyabwelile ukae. <verse eid="GEN 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17"/>Abaho kampetela mbuli ayo, kalonga, “Mtumwa ino Muebulania yuutugalile keza kumwangu kungela kinyala, <verse eid="GEN 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18"/>lakini vinigutile nyangi, kandekela kanzu jake, kakimbila kunze.”<verse eid="GEN 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19"/>Avo mkulu ayo wa Yusufu viyahulike mbuli za mwehe wake, kamba vivo viyatendile mtumwa wake, kagevuzika ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 39:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20"/>Kamsola Yusufu kamgodeka mkifungo, aho hawagodekigwe wabananzi wa mndewa. <verse eid="GEN 39:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21"/>Lakini Mndewa Imulungu kakala hamoja nayo, kamonela bazi, kamtenda yanogeligwe mgameso ga mkulu wa ikifungo. <verse eid="GEN 39:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22"/>Avo mkulu wa ikifungo kamtenda Yusufu yawe mkulu wa wafungwa wose wakalile mkifungo, kila kinhu kitendigwa mmakono gake. <verse eid="GEN 39:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23"/>Mkulu wa ikifungo hadumbile kinhu chochose kikalile mmakono ga Yusufu, kwavija Mndewa Imulungu kakala hamoja na Yusufu, avo kila kinhu kakitenda kinoge.<verse eid="GEN 39:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kowafambulila nzozi iwafungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1"/>Kipindi kiyagwe kumwande, mkulu wa ung'waji na mkulu wa koka magate wa mndewa Falao wamgevuza mndewa ayo. <verse eid="GEN 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2"/>Falao kawagevuzikila wakulu awo wabili. <verse eid="GEN 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3"/>Kawagodeka mwiing'hambi ya mkulu wa wakalizi, hanhu aho hayagodekigwe Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4"/>Wakala mkifungo kwa kipindi fulani na mkulu wa wakalizi kamsagula Yusufu yawasang'hanile wakulu awo wabili.<verse eid="GEN 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5"/>Siku dimoja ikilo wakulu awo wabili walota nzozi, kila munhu kalota nzozi yake, mkulu wa ung'waji kalota nzozi ili na fambulo jake na mkulu wa koka magate kalota nzozi ili na fambulo jake. <verse eid="GEN 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6"/>Imitondo yake Yusufu viyacholile kuwalola wakulu awo wabili, kawona onyawanyawa. <verse eid="GEN 40:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7"/>Avo Yusufu kawauza wakulu awo wa Falao wakalile wagodekigwe hamoja na heyo mwenyego mna ing'hambi ya mkulu wa wakalizi, kawauza, “Habali lelo vihanga venu vogela bazi?”<verse eid="GEN 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8"/>Wamwidika, “Siye wose tulota nzozi, lakini kuduhu munhu wakutufambulila nzozi zetu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Yusufu kawalongela, “Imulungu iyo yodaha kufambula, nongeleni nzozi zenu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9"/>Avo mkulu wa ung'waji kamsimulila Yusufu nzozi yake, kalonga, “Mna inzozi niye nyona mzabibu kuulongozi wangu, <verse eid="GEN 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10"/>mzabibu awo ukala na matambi madatu. Bahaja viusongile kuzuka mijani, maluwa gake galela vimvaba va zabibu zipile. <verse eid="GEN 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11"/>Ng'hala ngogile kikasi cha Falao mmakono gangu, avo nizisola zabibu azo nizikamila mkikasi acho, nimgwaa Falao.”<verse eid="GEN 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12"/>Yusufu kamulongela mkulu ayo, “Fambulo da nzozi yako ijo dino, matambi ago madatu gauwone azo siku ndatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13"/>Zahabita siku ndatu Falao kokulava mkifungo na kokubweza kabili muukulu wako. Na gweye komgwaa kabili Falao kikasi cha ung'waji kamba viutendile aho umwaka. <verse eid="GEN 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14"/>Lakini chonde sikuunisemwe wahalawa kunze unyonele bazi na unitambule mgameso ga Falao, ili ndawe mkifungo. <verse eid="GEN 40:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15"/>Kwavija niye nitolosigwa kulawa mwiisi ya Waebulania na hano Misili sitendile mbuli yoyose ihile ya kunhenda nigodekigwe.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16"/>Ija imkulu wa koka magate viyone kamba kafambula vinogile, kamulongela Yusufu, “Na niye vivija nilota nzozi! Mna inzozi yangu ng'hala mhapile mdipala jangu migelo midatu ya magate. <verse eid="GEN 40:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17"/>Mna ikigelo cha uchanha kukala na vinhu vingi va kuja mbuli ya Falao, lakini ndege wakala woja kulawa mkigelo acho kuko kudipala jangu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18"/>Yusufu kamulongela, “Fambulo da nzozi yako ijo dino, ija imigelo midatu ni siku ndatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19"/>Zahabita siku ndatu Falao kokulava mkifungo kokanha pala jako na kokutumbika mdibiki, na ndege oluja lukuli lwako.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20"/>Avo siku da kadatu kumwande, ikala siku ya kukumbuka kuvumbuka kwa Falao, avo kawagoneka wakulu zake wose mna inyimwilinyimwili, kawalava mkifungo mkulu wa ung'waji na mkulu wa koka magate, kaweka mgameso ga wakulu wose yawagoneke. <verse eid="GEN 40:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21"/>Abaho kambwezela ukulu wake mkulu wa ung'waji ili yamgwee kikasi cha ung'waji. <verse eid="GEN 40:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22"/>Lakini ija imkulu wa koka magate kamtumbika mdibiki, kamba Yusufu viyawafambulile nzozi zao. <verse eid="GEN 40:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23"/>Lakini ija imkulu wa ung'waji kamsemwa Yusufu na hamkumbuke bule.<verse eid="GEN 40:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kofambula nzozi za Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1"/>Viibitile miyaka mibili, Falao kalota nzozi kema mumgwazo wa lwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2"/>kawona ng'ombe saba wanogile na wanenehe wakala olawa muulwanda na wasonga kuja misanze. <verse eid="GEN 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3"/>Abaho walawilila ng'ombe saba wayagwe wakala wasokile na weha ng'hani walawa muulwanda lwa Naili, weza wema behi na waja iwang'ombe wayagwe mumgwazo wa ulwanda. <verse eid="GEN 41:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4"/>Ng'ombe awo wasokile na wehile wawaja waja wayagwe saba wakalile wanogile na wanenehe. Baho Falao kalamuka muutulo. <verse eid="GEN 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5"/>Viyawasile kabili kalota lwa kabili. Kona makungwi saba makulu na ganoga gazuka kulawa mna dibelege dimoja. <verse eid="GEN 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6"/>Abaho galawilila makungwi saba gayagwe masisili na ganyalile kwa vuke da zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7"/>Gago gamakungwi saba masisili gagameza gaja gamakungwi saba makulu gamemile uhule. Baho Falao viyalamuke kajuwa kamba kakala kolota. <verse eid="GEN 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8"/>Imitondo yake, Falao kanyawanyawa ng'hani, kawakema iwahawi wose wa isi ya Misili na wanhu wabala, kawalongela nzozi zake, lakini kuduhu hata imoja yadahile kumfambulila nzozi azo.<verse eid="GEN 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9"/>Abaho ija imkulu wa ung'waji kamulongela Falao, “Lelo nokumbuka ubozi wangu! <verse eid="GEN 41:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10"/>Kipindi kija viutugevuzikile siye wasang'hanaji zako niye na ija imkulu wa koka magate, kutugodeka mna ing'hambi ya mkulu wa wakalizi. <verse eid="GEN 41:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11"/>Kilo kimoja tulota nzozi, kila munhu kalota nzozi ili na fambulo jake. <verse eid="GEN 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12"/>Avo mbwanga imoja Muebulania, mtumwa wa mkulu wa wakalizi kakala hamoja na siye mkifungo. Vitumulongele nzozi zetu, heyo katufambulila nzozi zetu kila munhu kamba viili. <verse eid="GEN 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13"/>Viyatufambulile vivo viilawilile, niye nibwezigwa mwiisang'hano yangu na ija imkulu wa koka magate katumbikiga mdibiki.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14"/>Avo, Falao kalagiza Yusufu yagaligwe, nao wamulava mkifungo wambea mvili na kasaula viwalo vake, kagaligwa kuulongozi wa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15"/>Falao kamulongela Yusufu, “Niye nilota nzozi, lakini kuduhu munhu yodaha kufambula. Nihulika wanhu okutogola kamba munhu yahakusimulila nzozi yake kodaha kuifambula.”<verse eid="GEN 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16"/>Yusufu kamwidika Falao, “Niye nabule udahi awo, lakini Imulungu kokwidika kamba viulonda.”<verse eid="GEN 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17"/>Falao kamulongela Yusufu, “Nilota nima mumgwazo wa lwanda lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18"/>niwona ng'ombe saba wanogile na wanenehe walawa muulwanda na wasonga kuja misanze. <verse eid="GEN 41:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19"/>Abaho weza ng'ombe saba wayagwe wanyolile na wasisili na wasoka ng'hani. Niye sinawona ng'ombe kamba awo mwiisi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20"/>Avo, waja iwang'ombe saba wasokile ng'hani wawaja waja iwang'ombe saba wanenehe. <verse eid="GEN 41:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21"/>Lakini viweshilize kuwaja kuduhu munhu yodaha kujuwa kamba wawaja wayao. Kwavija wakala wasokile vivija va ichanduso. Baho nilamuka muutulo. <verse eid="GEN 41:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22"/>Abaho nilota kabili, nigona makungwi saba ganogile gamema uhule gazuka kulawa mdibelege dimoja. <verse eid="GEN 41:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23"/>Abaho galawilila makungwi saba gayagwe gabule kinhu masisili na ganyala kwa vuke da zuwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24"/>Na makungwi gago saba masisili gagameza gaja makungwi saba ganogile. Avo niye niwalongela wahawi nzozi zino, na kuduhu munhu yadahile kunifambulila.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25"/>Abaho Yusufu kamulongela Falao, “Nzozi zako mbili fambulo jake dimoja. Imulungu kakugubulila gaja goyolonda kutenda kipindi kiguhi kikwiza. <verse eid="GEN 41:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26"/>Ng'ombe saba wanogile ofambula miyaka saba, na gaja makungwi saba ganogile vivija gofambula miyaka saba, nzozi azo fambulo jake dimoja. <verse eid="GEN 41:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27"/>Waja ng'ombe saba wasokile ng'hani wezile aho kumwande na gaja makungwi saba gelibule kinhu ganyalile kwa vuke da zuwa, fambulo jake ni miyaka saba ya lufilili lwa nzala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28"/>Kamba vinikulongele mndewa Falao, Imulungu kakugubulila gaja goyolonda kutenda kipindi kiguhi kikwiza. <verse eid="GEN 41:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29"/>Hokuwa na miyaka saba ya mulao mwiisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30"/>Lakini kumwande yokwiza miyaka saba ya lufilili lwa nzala, hata awo umulao osemwigwa mwiisi ya Misili. Lufilili alo lwa nzala loinanga isi ino. <verse eid="GEN 41:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31"/>Mulao osemwigwa kwavija nzala ikwiza yokuwa ng'hulu ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 41:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32"/>Nzozi ayo ibweleligwa miyanza mibili kila imoja viyagwe kukulagusila kamba Imulungu kagesa kutenda vivo, na kotenda mbuli ayo kipindi kiguhi kikwiza.<verse eid="GEN 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33"/>“Avo go mkulu Falao, usagule munhu yeli na nzewele na ubala, umgwee ng'honde ya kuilolesa isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34"/>Abaho go mkulu Falao, usagule wemilizi mwiisi yose, uwalagize weke mgelo umoja mna imigelo mitano ya ndiya yose ya Misili mna ikipindi cha miyaka saba ya mulao. <verse eid="GEN 41:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35"/>Uwalagize wanhu awo iwemilizi weke hamoja ndiya kwa miyaka saba ya mulao. Ndiya ayo ikigwe kukanho jako gweye go mkulu Falao, iwe ngama kwa mabuga gose, na wailolese goya ngama ayo. <verse eid="GEN 41:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36"/>Ndiya ayo yokuwa ngama kwa wanhu wa isi ya Misili ili isi sikuibanangike kwa lufilili lwa nzala lukwiza miyaka saba iyagwe.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kotendigwa mkulu wa isi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37"/>Mbuli iyalongile Yusufu itogoligwa mgameso ga Falao na wakulu zake. <verse eid="GEN 41:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38"/>Avo Falao kawauza wakulu zake, “Munhu ino kana loho ya Imulungu, vino todaha kumpata munhu iyagwe kamba ino?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39"/>Abaho Falao kamulongela Yusufu, “Kwavija Imulungu kakugubulila mbuli zose azo, kuduhu munhu iyagwe yeli na nzewele na ubala kamba gweye. <verse eid="GEN 41:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40"/>Gweye ayo yonda uwe mulolesaji wa isi yangu, na wanhu zangu wose okuwa hasi mmakono gako. Niye niiyeka iyo mkulu kubanza gweye kwavija nokala mkigoda cha undewa. <verse eid="GEN 41:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41"/>Avo sambi nikusagula kamba mkulu wa isi yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42"/>Abaho Falao kaivula mkidole chake pete yake ili na kilaguso kamvaza Yusufu, na kamvaza na viwalo va kitani inogile na mkufu wa zahabu msingo. <verse eid="GEN 41:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43"/>Falao kamkweza Yusufu mumtuka wake wa kabili wa falasi na wakalizi walongola kuulongozi wa Yusufu, wakemelela walonga, “Mwime kumgwazo wa nzila,” Falao kamgwaa Yusufu ukulu kwa wanhu wose wa isi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44"/>Abaho Falao kamulongela Yusufu, “Niye iyo mndewa Falao! Nolonga munhu yoyose mwiisi yose ya Misili sikuyatende kinhu chochose bila ya gweye kumulongela.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45"/>Falao kamgwaa Yusufu twaga da Misili Safenati Panea. Kamgwaa Asenati mndele wa Potifela, mulava nhosa wa buga da Oni yawe mwehe wake. Avo Yusufu kasonga kutembelela isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46"/>Yusufu kakala na miyaka malongo madatu viyasongile kumsang'hanila Falao, mndewa wa Misili. Kalawa mng'anda ya Falao na kuitembelela isi yose ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 41:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47"/>Avo mna imiyaka ija saba ya mulao, migunda ya Misili ilela ndiya nyingi ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 41:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48"/>Yusufu keka hamoja ndiya yose kipindi acho cha miyaka saba ya mulao na kaika ngama mmabuga ga Misili. Kila buga keka ngama ya ndiya kulawa mmigunda ili mmabehi na buga dijo. <verse eid="GEN 41:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49"/>Yusufu keka ngama ya ndiya nyingi ng'hani, ikala nyingi kamba msanga wa mwhani, ikala haipimigwa bule.<verse eid="GEN 41:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50"/>Miyaka ya lufilili lwa nzala hainavika Yusufu kakala na wana wabili kulawa kwa mwehe wake Asenati, mndele wa Potifela mulava nhosa wa buga da Oni. <verse eid="GEN 41:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51"/>Yusufu kamgwaa mwanage twaga da Manase kalonga, “Imulungu kanhenda niisemwe magazo gangu kulawa kwa ndugu wa ng'anda ya tatangu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52"/>Mwana wa kabili kamgwaa twaga da Efulaimu kalonga, “Imulungu kangwaa wana mwiisi ya kugaya kwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53"/>Miyaka ija saba ya mulao mwiisi ya Misili ibita, <verse eid="GEN 41:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54"/>na miyaka saba ya lufilili lwa nzala isonga, kamba viyalongile Yusufu baho haichanduso. Isi zose ziyagwe zikala na nzala, lakini isi yose ya Misili ikala na ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 41:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55"/>Wanhu wa isi ya Misili viwasongile kupata nzala, wamulilila Falao yawagwee ndiya. Na heyo Falao kawalongela wanhu wose wa Misili, “Gendeni kwa Yusufu, donda yawalongele tendeni.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56"/>Nzala yenela ng'hani mwiisi yose ya Misili. Avo Yusufu kafungula makanho gose kawauzila wanhu wa Misili indiya. <verse eid="GEN 41:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57"/>Abaho wanhu kulawa kila hanhu mwiisi yose weza Misili kwa Yusufu kugula ndiya kwavija nzala ikala ng'hulu ng'hani mwiisi yose.<verse eid="GEN 41:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42"/>
  <para style="s">Ndugu zake Yusufu ochola Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1"/>Yakobo viyahulike kamba ako Misili kukala na ndiya nyingi, kawalongela wanage, “Habali mokala kwa kuibunhulila meso?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2"/>Niye mhulika kamba Misili kuna ndiya. Gendeni kuko mkagule ndiya sikutufe kwa nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3"/>Avo ndugu zake Yusufu, longo wachola Misili, kugula ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 42:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4"/>Lakini Yakobo hamulekile Benjamini, mdodo wake Yusufu yachole nao kwavija kadumba kodaha kupata gehile gogose.<verse eid="GEN 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5"/>Avo wana wa Izilaeli wavika Misili kamba wanhu wayagwe wacholile kugula ndiya, kwavija hata mwiisi ya Kanaani kukala na lufilili lwa nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6"/>Kipindi acho Yusufu iyo yakalile mkulu ako Misili. Heyo iyo yakalile mkulu wa kuwauzila ndiya wanhu wa isi zose. Avo ndugu zake weza wamfugamila Yusufu na wamgwaa ukulu. <verse eid="GEN 42:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7"/>Bahaja Yusufu viyawonile ndugu zake kawajuwa, lakini kaitenda kamba munhu baki na kawakomhokela. “Mweye mulawa kwahi?” Wamwidika, “Tulawa mwiisi ya Kanaani, twiza hano kugula ndiya.”<verse eid="GEN 42:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8"/>Hamoja Yusufu kawajuwa ndugu zake, wao wakala hawamjuwile bule. <verse eid="GEN 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9"/>Baho kakumbuka nzozi zake za umwaka mbuli ya awo ndugu zake, kawalongela, “Mweye mwiza kutusepa, mwiza kusepa ili mujuwe kwahi isi yetu haikalizigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10"/>Wao wamwidika, “Bule, go mkulu, siye wasang'hanaji zako, twiza kugula ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11"/>Siye twa ndugu, twa wana wa tata imoja, siye twa wanhu tutamaniligwa, hatwizile kuwasepa bule.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12"/>Lakini Yusufu kasusumiza kulonga, “Mweye mwiza kusepa isi yetu mujuwe hanhu hahakalizigwa.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13"/>Wamulongela, “Siye wasang'hanaji zako tukala wana longo na wabili, wose wana wa munhu imoja, yokala mwiisi ya Kanaani. Mdodo wetu kasigala na tataetu na ndugu yetu imoja kafa.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14"/>Lakini Yusufu kawalongela, “Kamba vinongile mweye mwiza kutusepa mwiisi yetu. <verse eid="GEN 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15"/>Na vino avo vonda nijuwe, noiduwila kwa twaga da Falao, honda musegele hano mbaka vonda yeze mdodo wenu. <verse eid="GEN 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16"/>Mtumeni imoja wenu yakamsole ayo indugu yenu imdodo, kuno mweye wayagwe mombeta mkifungo baho nojuwa kamba molonga ukweli, buleavo noiduwila kwa twaga da Falao kamba mweye mwa wasepaji!” <verse eid="GEN 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17"/>Abaho kaweka wose mkifungo kwa siku ndatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18"/>Siku da kadatu Yusufu kawalongela, “Kwavija niye nomdumba Imulungu, tendeni vino ili muwe wagima. <verse eid="GEN 42:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19"/>Kamba kweli mweye mwa wanhu mutamaniligwa imoja wenu yasigale hano mkifungo, na mweye wayagwe muwagalile ndiya wanhu zenu weli na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20"/>Abaho mumgale kumwangu ndugu yenu imdodo baho nojuwa kamba mulonga kweli, na mweye honda mukomigwe bule.” Avo waitogolela kutenda vivo. <verse eid="GEN 42:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21"/>Wailongela wenyego, “Siye totagusigwa mbuli ya mdodo wetu. Siye tumona viyagaiye lakini viyatupulile tumtaze tumulemela, lekaavo gano gose gotupata.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22"/>Lubeni kawalongela, “Vino niye siwalongele bule sikutumulumize imbwanga? Lakini mweye hamunhegeleze bule! Avo sambi totagusigwa mbuli ya damu yake.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23"/>Wao hawajuwile kamba Yusufu kajuwa gose gawakalile olonga, kwavija viyalongile nao kalonga kubitila munhu yakalile yotafasili. <verse eid="GEN 42:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24"/>Yusufu kachola kumgwazo, kalila kwa usungu. Viyanyamale kabwela kalonga nao. Abaho kamgoga Simeoni na kamfunga nzabi mgameso gao.<verse eid="GEN 42:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndugu wa Yusufu obwela Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25"/>Yusufu kalagiza mikoba yao imemezwe ndiya na kila munhu yabwezelwe sente yake mumkoba wake, na wagweleligwe mhamba ya mnzila. Watendeligwa vinhu vose avo. <verse eid="GEN 42:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26"/>Wawadikwa imizigo vihongwe wao wasegela. <verse eid="GEN 42:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27"/>Mnzila, viwavikile hanhu ha kuwasa wanhu baki, imoja wao kafungula mkoba wake ili yamgwee ndiya kihongwe wake, kakanganya kona sente yake ya mmulomo wa mkoba wake. <verse eid="GEN 42:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28"/>Kawalongela ndugu zake, “Sente yangu ibwezigwa, aino hano mmulomo wa mkoba wangu!” Viwahulike vivo, wahomba. Wailola kuno ogwaya na kuiuza, “Mbuli gani ino iyatutendele Imulungu?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29"/>Viwavikile mwiisi ya Kanaani kwa tatao Yakobo wamulongela mbuli zose ziwalawilile, wamulongela, <verse eid="GEN 42:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30"/>“Mkulu wa isi ya Misili kalonga na siye kwa kutukomhokela, na katugesa kamba siye twa wasepaji wa isi yake. <verse eid="GEN 42:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31"/>Lakini siye tumulongela, ‘Siye twa wanhu otamaniligwa, hatuli wasepaji bule. <verse eid="GEN 42:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32"/>Tumulongela kamba siye twa ndugu longo na wabili wa tata imoja, na imoja wetu kafa, na ija imdodo ka ako ukae Kanaani hamoja na tata yetu.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33"/>Avo mkulu wa isi ayo katulongela, ‘Baho nojuwa kamba kweli mweye motamaniligwa, mulekeni kumwangu ndugu yenu imoja na mweye wayagwe mugale ndiya ukae kwa wanhu zenu weli na nzala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34"/>Abaho mgaleni kumwangu ndugu yenu imdodo na baho nojuwa kamba mweye hamuli wasepaji lakini mwa wanhu mutamaniligwa. Mwahatenda vivo nomulekesa ndugu yenu, na mweye motogolelwa kuchuuza na kugula vinhu mwiisi ino.’”<verse eid="GEN 42:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35"/>Viwakalile okung'husa mikoba yao, wakanganya kona kila imoja wao kabwezelwa kikoba chake cha sente mna umkoba wake. Viwonile vivo, wose na tatao wakanganya, wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 42:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36"/>Tatao Yakobo kawalongela, “Moniboka wanangu, Yusufu kahaduhu, Simeoni kahaduhu, na sambi molonda kumsola na Benjamini. Gose gago gamhata niye.”<verse eid="GEN 42:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37"/>Baho Lubeni kamulongela tatake, “Kamba simbweza Benjamini wakome wanangu wabili. Muleke Benjamini mmakono gangu, niye nomkaliza na kumbweza kumwako.”<verse eid="GEN 42:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38"/>Lakini tatake kamwidika, “Mwanangu hachola na mweye, ndugu yake kafa mwaka, na heyo yaiyeka iyo yasigale. Niye namvele na uhenga kamba mbwanga yuno yahapata gehile mmwanza wenu, mong'homa kwa lusikisiki.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43"/>
  <para style="s">Ndugu obwela Misili hamoja na Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1"/>Lufilili lwa nzala lubanza ng'hani mwiisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2"/>Viishile ndiya ija iwagulile kulawa Misili, Yakobo kawalongela wanage, “Gendeni kabili Misili, mkatugulile ndiya kidogo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3"/>Lakini Yuda kamulongela tatake, “Munhu ija katuzuma ng'hani, kalonga, ‘Siwabokela bule kamba hamwizile na ndugu yenu imdodo.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4"/>Kamba kotogola tuchole na ndugu yetu imdodo, tochola kukugulila ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5"/>Lakini kamba wahalema, hatuchola bule, kwavija munhu ija katulongela, ‘Sikumuchone kihanga changu kamba hamwiza na ndugu yenu.’”<verse eid="GEN 43:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6"/>Izilaeli kalonga, “Habali mungela mdizumozumo kwa kumulongela munhu ayo kamba muna ndugu iyagwe?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7"/>Wamwidika, “Munhu ija katuuza goya mbuli ya lukolo lwetu, ‘Tataenu yang'hali mgima, muna ndugu iyagwe?’ Avo siye tumwidika, twahajuwile vilihi kamba yahalongile, ‘Mgaleni ndugu yenu?’”<verse eid="GEN 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8"/>Yuda kamulongela Izilaeli tatake, “Nitogolele niye nichole nayo ili tusegele sambi baha, tuchole tukagule ndiya, sikutufe kwa nzala gweye na wanetu. <verse eid="GEN 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9"/>Niye iyo yonda nidaigwe. Gweye nidai niye, kamba simbweza kumwako, nidaigwe niye siku zose. <verse eid="GEN 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10"/>Maza hatukawile bule, twahacholile na kubwela miyanza mibili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11"/>Baho Izilaeli, tatao, kawalongela, “Ona, kwavija vivo ilondigwa, tendeni avo, soleni mmikoba yenu vinhu vinogile ng'hani va isi ino, mumgalile nhunza mkulu ayo. Soleni mavuta ga nyemba kidogo na uki kidogo, ubani, manemane, kungu na lozi. <verse eid="GEN 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12"/>Soleni sente miyanza mibili ya zija zilondigwa kwavija molondigwa mubweze sente zija zikalile mmilomo ya mikoba yenu, sengine zibwezigwa kwa kuisemwa. <verse eid="GEN 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13"/>Msoleni ayo ndugu yenu muchole nayo kwa munhu ayo. <verse eid="GEN 43:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14"/>Imulungu yeli na Udahi wose yawatende moneligwe bazi na munhu ayo, yamulekese ija ndugu yenu iyagwe na Benjamini wabwele hamoja na mweye. Kumwangu niye kamba yahakuwa kwagiligwa na wanangu iwe vivo.”<verse eid="GEN 43:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15"/>Baho wasola zija zinhunza na sente miyanza mibili ya zija za ichanduso, wachola Misili hamoja na Benjamini. Viwavikile wachola kwima kuulongozi wa Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16"/>Yusufu viyamonile Benjamini hamoja nao, kamulongela ija yololesa ng'anda yake, “Wagale wanhu wano ukae kumwangu ukachinje mnyama na umtande vinogile, kwavija wanhu wano woja na niye ndiya ya imisi.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17"/>Mulolesaji ayo katenda kamba viyalagizwe, kawagala wanhu awo ukae kwa Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18"/>Viwonile ogaligwa mng'anda ya Yusufu wadumba, wailongela, “Tugaligwa kuno mbuli ya zija zisente zibwezigwe mna imikoba yetu vitwizile mwanza wa ichanduso, katenda vino ili yapate kilamuso cha kutuboka vihongwe wetu na kututenda watumwa zake.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19"/>Avo wamgendela ija imulolesaji wa ng'anda ya Yusufu walonga na heyo kipindi wahaulwivi, <verse eid="GEN 43:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20"/>wamulongela, “Chonde go mkulu! Siye tukala twizile mwanza wa ichanduso kugula ndiya, <verse eid="GEN 43:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21"/>lakini ikilo vituvikile hanhu ha kuwasa wanhu baki, tufungula mikoba yetu na kila munhu kayona sente yake vivija kamba viyalavile, ikala mmulomo wa mkoba. Avo tuzibweza. <verse eid="GEN 43:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22"/>Vivija tugala sente ziyagwe kugula ndiya. Hatumjuwile munhu yekile zisente mna imikoba yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23"/>Mulolesaji ayo kawedika, “Sikumudumbe, Imulungu wenu, Imulungu wa tata zenu, kawagwaa ngama mna imikoba yenu. Niye nizibokela sente zenu.” Abaho kamgala Simeoni kumwao.<verse eid="GEN 43:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24"/>Mulolesaji ayo viyawagoneke mng'anda ya Yusufu tanhu kawagwaa mazi wasunhe magulu gao na vivija kawagwaa ndiya vihongwe wao. <verse eid="GEN 43:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25"/>Na wao wazitanda nhunza zao za kumgwaa Yusufu, kwavija wahulika kamba woja hamoja nayo. <verse eid="GEN 43:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26"/>Yusufu viyabwelile ukae wamgwaa zija zinhunza ziwakalile nazo, wamfugamila mbaka hasi. <verse eid="GEN 43:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27"/>Yusufu kawalamusa na kawauza, “Vilihi tataenu imvele mgima? Vino yang'hali mgima?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28"/>Wamwidika, “Msang'hanaji wako, tataetu, kogendelela goya, na yang'hali mgima.” Abaho wamfugamila mbaka hasi.<verse eid="GEN 43:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29"/>Yusufu viyenule kihanga chake kamona Benjamini mdodo wake, mwana wa mamake, kalonga, “Ino iyo mdodo wenu yumulongile?” Kalonga, “Imulungu yakonele bazi mwanangu!” <verse eid="GEN 43:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30"/>Bahaja, Yusufu kasegela hanhu aho, kwavija mahozi gakala golonda kumulawa mbuli ya kumnogela mdodo wake, kengila mdigati jake kasonga kulila. <verse eid="GEN 43:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31"/>Viyamambukize kusunha kihanga chake, kalawa kunze kuno kaifunga umoyo, kalagiza wagale indiya. <verse eid="GEN 43:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32"/>Yusufu kekiligwa ndiya yaiyeka na ndugu zake wekiligwa waiyeka na vivija Wamisili wakalile aho wekiligwa waiyeka, kwavija ikala mwiko kwa Wamisili kuja ndiya hamoja na Waebulania. <verse eid="GEN 43:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33"/>Ndugu zake Yusufu wakala kuulongozi wake kwa kuipanga kusongela imkulu mbaka imdodo na wakala oilola kuno okanganya. <verse eid="GEN 43:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34"/>Ndiya ikala ilawa kwa Yusufu na igoligwa kumwao, lakini Benjamini kagweleligwa miyanza mitano ng'hani ya kija kiwagweleligwe ndugu zake. Avo waja na kung'wa kuno odeng'helela hamoja na heyo.<verse eid="GEN 43:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44"/>
  <para style="s">Kikasi hachoneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1"/>Abaho Yusufu kamulagiza mulolesaji wa ng'anda yake, kalonga, “Memeza mikoba ya wanhu wano kamba viwodaha kupapa. Abaho ika sente zao kila munhu mmulomo wa mkoba wake. <verse eid="GEN 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2"/>Mna umkoba wa ija imdodo ng'hani, ika kija ikikasi changu cha shaba, hamoja na sente yake.” Ayo imulolesaji katenda kamba viyalagizwe na Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3"/>Imitondo yake walongeligwa wachole hamoja na vihongwe wao. <verse eid="GEN 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4"/>Hawanavika kutali ng'hani Yusufu kamulongela mulolesaji wa ng'anda yake, “Lopola, wawinze wanhu waja, wauze, ‘Habali mmuliha gehile munhu ija yawatendele ganogile? <verse eid="GEN 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5"/>Habali mwiba kikasi cha shaba cha mkulu wangu, kiyasang'hanilaga kwa kung'wela na kulagula? Mubananga ng'hani!’”<verse eid="GEN 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6"/>Ija imulolesaji viyawavikile kazibwelela mbuli azo. <verse eid="GEN 44:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7"/>Lakini wamuuza, “Go mkulu kofambula choni? Siye wasang'hanaji zako hatudaha kutenda mbuli kamba ayo. <verse eid="GEN 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8"/>Kumbuka go mkulu, sente ituvikile mmikoba yetu tuibweza kulawa mwiisi ya Kanaani. Yokuwaze twibe sente hebu zahabu mng'anda ya mkulu wako? <verse eid="GEN 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9"/>Avo, kamba wahamvika imoja wetu kana kikasi acho yakomigwe, na siye wose wayagwe tuwe watumwa zako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10"/>Ayo imulolesaji kedika, “Ona, na iwe vivo kamba vimulongile. Lakini ija yaiyeka yonda yoneke na kikasi acho, iyo yonda yawe mtumwa wangu, na wayagwe wose mokuwa mwabule kitala.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11"/>Avo, kila munhu kahumulusa mkoba wake hasi himahima na kufungula. <verse eid="GEN 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12"/>Ija imulolesaji kalola imikoba yose, kasongela mkoba wa imkulu wao na kamambukizila mkoba wa imdodo wao, kikasi kakipata mumkoba wa Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13"/>Baho wose wadega viwalo vao kwa usungu. Kila imoja kamkweza kihongwe wake mkoba, wabwela kudibuga.<verse eid="GEN 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14"/>Yuda na ndugu zake wavika mng'anda ya Yusufu na Yusufu kakala yang'hali ukae kumwake. Avo, wamfugamila mbaka hasi. <verse eid="GEN 44:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15"/>Yusufu kawauza, “Habali mutendile kamba avo? Vino hamujuwile bule munhu kamba niye nodaha kulagula?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16"/>Yuda kedika, “Tulonge choni, go mkulu, tulonge choni kulagusa hatubanange? Imulungu kagagubula gehile getu, siye sambi twa watumwa zako, siye hamoja na ija yoneke na kikasi chako.”<verse eid="GEN 44:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17"/>Lakini Yusufu kalonga, “Bule, niye sidaha kutenda kamba avo. Munhu ija yagogeke na kikasi iyo yonda yawe mtumwa wangu. Mweye wayagwe mose bweleni moyo kwatu kwa tataenu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kompulila Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18"/>Baho Yuda kamkwesela behi Yusufu na kulonga, “Go mkulu chonde togola niye msang'hanaji wako, niigombele kidogo, chonde sikuugevuzike kwavija gweye kamba Falao mwenyego. <verse eid="GEN 44:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19"/>Go mkulu, gweye kutuuza, ‘Mweye muna ndugu hebu tata?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20"/>Tukwidika, ‘Tunayo tata, yeli mvele na tunayo ndugu iyagwe mdodo yaleleke kipindi cha uvele wa tataetu, mkulu wake mbwanga ayo kafa, na ino imdodo iyo yasigale kwa mamake, na tataetu komnogela ng'hani mbwanga ino.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21"/>Go mkulu kutulagiza siye wasang'hanaji zako tumgale ayo imdodo wetu ili umone. <verse eid="GEN 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22"/>Tukulongela kamba mbwanga ayo hadaha kumuleka tatake, kwavija yahamuleka tatake kofa. <verse eid="GEN 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23"/>Lakini gweye go mkulu, kutulongela, ‘Kamba hamwizile na ndugu yenu imdodo, sikumuchone kihanga changu kabili.’”<verse eid="GEN 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24"/>Vitubwelile ukae kwa msang'hanaji wako, tataetu tumulongela viutulagize gweye go mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25"/>Na viyatulongele twize kabili kuno kugula ndiya, <verse eid="GEN 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26"/>tumwidika, “Hatudaha kuchola mbaka ndugu yetu imdodo yachole hamoja na siye, kamba hatuchola nayo munhu ija hatubokela bule.” <verse eid="GEN 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27"/>Msang'hanaji wako tataetu katulongela, “Mojuwa kamba mwehe wangu Laheli kanilelela wana wabili, <verse eid="GEN 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28"/>imoja kalawanya mgameso gangu, vinyona kadegigwa vihande vihande na mng'onyo, kwavija sinamona kabili. <verse eid="GEN 44:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29"/>Kamba mwahamsola na ino vivija na gahampata gehile, mongala kuna dipanga kuno nina lusikisiki.”<verse eid="GEN 44:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30"/>“Avo, go mkulu nahabwela ukae kwa tatangu niye msang'hanaji wako bila mbwanga ino na kuno ugima wa tata otamanila ugima wa mbwanga ino, <verse eid="GEN 44:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31"/>yahaona mbwanga heli hamoja na siye kofa. Avo siye wasang'hanaji zako, tomkoma tataetu kwa lusikisiki. <verse eid="GEN 44:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32"/>Hata avo niye niiduwila mbuli ya mbwanga ino, nilonga, kamba simbweza Benjamini kumwako, nidaigwe niye siku zose. <verse eid="GEN 44:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33"/>Avo go mkulu, chonde niye msang'hanaji wako nikale hano hanhu ha mbwanga ino. Muleke yabwele ukae hamoja na ndugu zake. <verse eid="GEN 44:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34"/>Nodahaze kubwela kwa tatangu bila mbwanga ino? Bule, sidaha kufunga umoyo kugona gehile gonda gampate tatangu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45"/>
  <para style="s">Yusufu koitambula kwa ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1"/>Baho Yusufu kalemelwa kufunga umoyo mgameso ga wasang'hanaji zake wose wakalile hamoja nayo, kalagiza walawe kunze. Avo Yusufu kakala yaiyeka viyailaguse kwa ndugu zake. <verse eid="GEN 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2"/>Lakini kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu mbaka Wamisili wamuhulika, vivija wanhu wa mng'anda ya Falao wamuhulika. <verse eid="GEN 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3"/>Yusufu kawalongela ndugu zake, “Niye na Yusufu, vino tatangu yang'hali mgima?” Lakini ndugu zake walemelwa kumwidika wagwa kifudete mgameso gake hawadahile kumwidika. <verse eid="GEN 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4"/>Yusufu kawalongela ndugu zake, “Chonde kweseni behi.” Viwamkwesele, kawalongela, “Niye iyo ndugu yenu Yusufu yumuniuzile Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5"/>Lakini sambi sikumuigevuzikile hebu kulonga habali mutendile vivo. Imulungu iyo yangalile kuno, niwalongolele, ili niuhonye ugima wa wanhu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6"/>Uno mwaka wa kabili wa lufilili lwa nzala mwiisi na ing'hali miyaka mitano kumwande, baho wanhu hawadaha kulima hebu kusenga ndiya. <verse eid="GEN 45:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7"/>Imulungu kangala kuno niwalongolele, ili kuhonya ugima wenu, mweye musigale wagima mwiisi na kugala ukombola mkulu. <verse eid="GEN 45:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8"/>Avo, siyo mweye mungalile kuno, lakini Imulungu iyo yangalile na kanitenda nimgwelelege Falao magesa kamba na tatake. Niye na mkulu wa ng'anda yake yose na nowatawala wanhu wose wa Misili.”<verse eid="GEN 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9"/>Avo, lopoleni mubwele kwa tatangu na mmulongele, “Yusufu mwanago kolonga, ‘Imulungu kanitenda munhu mkulu mwiisi yose ya Misili. Avo, sikuukawe kwiza kumwangu. <verse eid="GEN 45:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10"/>Kokala behi na niye ako Gosheni, gweye na wanago na wazukulu zako, fugo zako na vinhu vako vose. <verse eid="GEN 45:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11"/>Niye nokulolesa baho kwavija ing'hali miyaka mitano ya lufilili lwa nzala. Buleavo gweye na wanhu zako na fugo zako mogaya kwa nzala.’”<verse eid="GEN 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12"/>Abaho Yusufu kagendelela kulonga, “Mweye wenyego molola kwa meso genu, na hata mdodo wangu Benjamini kona kwa meso gake kamba niye iyo Yusufu mwenyego nilonga na mweye. <verse eid="GEN 45:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13"/>Mmulongele tatangu mbuli ya ukulu unilinao kuno Misili na mbuli ya kila kinhu kimone. Avo mulopole mumgale hano tatangu.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14"/>Abaho Yusufu kamfagatila ndugu yake Benjamini, kuno kolila na vivija Benjamini kamfagatila kuno kolila. <verse eid="GEN 45:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15"/>Kuno yang'hali kolila Yusufu kawafagatila ndugu zake na kawanonela. Baho ndugu zake walonga nayo.<verse eid="GEN 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16"/>Mbuli azo zivika mng'anda ya Falao kamba ndugu zake Yusufu weza, Falao na wasang'hanaji zake wadeng'helela. <verse eid="GEN 45:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17"/>Avo, Falao kamulongela Yusufu, “Walongele ndugu zako, wawapapize mizigo vihongwe wao wabwele mwiisi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18"/>wamgale hano tatao na ndugu zao wose. Niye nowagwaa hanhu hanogile ng'hani mwiisi ino ya Misili, na wao okala kwa kudeng'helela ganogile ga isi ino. <verse eid="GEN 45:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19"/>Vivija walongele wasole mituka ino ya kubulula ili wawapapile wanao ving'hele na wehe zao na sikuwaleke kumgala tatao. <verse eid="GEN 45:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20"/>Walongele sikuwagese mbuli ya vinhu vao kwavija hanhu hanogile kubanza kose mwiisi ya Misili hokuwa hao.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21"/>Avo, wana wa Izilaeli watenda kamba viwalagizwe. Yusufu kawagwaa mituka ya kubulula kamba Falao viyalongile na vivija kawagwaa mhamba ya mnzila. <verse eid="GEN 45:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22"/>Kila imoja wao kamgwaa viwalo va kusaula, lakini Benjamini kamgwaa vihande magana madatu va shaba na kamgwaa viwalo vitano va kusaula. <verse eid="GEN 45:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23"/>Vivija kamgalila tatake nhunza zino mbuli ya mwanza wake, vihongwe longo wapapile vinhu vinogile ng'hani mwiisi ya Misili, vihongwe wa kitwanzi longo wapapile ndiya, na magate na vinhu viyagwe va kuja. <verse eid="GEN 45:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24"/>Avo, Yusufu kailaga na ndugu zake. Viwakalile osegela kawazuma kawalongela, “Sikumugombe mnzila!”<verse eid="GEN 45:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25"/>Baho wasegela mwiisi ya Misili na wabwela kwa tatao Yakobo mwiisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26"/>Wamulongela, “Yusufu yang'hali mgima! Heyo iyo mkulu wa isi yose ya Misili.” Baho tatao kakanganya, kwavija hazitogole mbuli azo.<verse eid="GEN 45:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27"/>Lakini viwamulongele mbuli zose ziyalongile Yusufu na viyone mituka ya kubulula iyagalile Yusufu ili kumsola, moyo wake umema deng'ho. <verse eid="GEN 45:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28"/>Izilaeli kalonga, “Sambi notogola, mwanangu Yusufu yang'hali mgima! Nochola nikamulole ning'hali sinakufa.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kochola Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1"/>Avo, Izilaeli kasonga mwanza wake, hamoja na vinhu vake vose. Viyavikile Beelisheba kamulavila nhosa Imulungu wa Isaka tatake. <verse eid="GEN 46:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2"/>Imulungu kalonga na Izilaeli ikilo mwiinzozi kamkema, “Yakobo, Yakobo.” Yakobo kedika, “Nabaha.”<verse eid="GEN 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3"/>Imulungu kamulongela, “Niye ayo Imulungu, Imulungu wa tatako. Sikuudumbe kuchola Misili, wahawa kuko nokutenda uwe na ulelo onda uwe kabila kulu. <verse eid="GEN 46:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4"/>Niye mwenyego nochola hamoja na gweye ako Misili na nokubweza kuno. Wahafa mkono wa Yusufu uwo onda ukufumbe meso gako.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5"/>Avo, Yakobo kasegela Beelisheba. Wanage wamsola tatao, na wanao ving'hele hamoja na wehe zao, wawakweza mna imituka iyagalile Falao impape. <verse eid="GEN 46:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6"/>Vivija wasola fugo zao na vinhu vao vose viwapatile mwiisi ya Kanaani, wachola Misili. Yakobo kasola lukolo lwake lose, <verse eid="GEN 46:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7"/>wanage, wazukulu zake wa kitwanzi na wa kimbigalo, wose kawagala mwiisi ya Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8"/>Gano gago matwaga ga wana wa Izilaeli wacholile ako Misili.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 46:8"/>
  <para style="li" vid="GEN 46:8">Lubeni mwanage wa chaudele,<verse eid="GEN 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9"/>hamoja na wana wa Lubeni,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="GEN 46:9">wakalile Hanoki na Palu na Hesiloni na Kalimi.<verse eid="GEN 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10"/>Simeoni na wanage, Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Shauli mwana wa mtwanzi Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11"/>Lawi na wanage, Gelishoni na Kohati na Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12"/>Yuda na wanage, Eli na Onani na Shela na Pelesi na Zela. Lakini Eli na Onani wafa mwiisi ya Kanaani. Pelesi na wanage, Hesiloni na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13"/>Isakali na wanage, Tola na Puva na Yashubu na Shimuloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14"/>Zabuloni na wanage, Seledi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15"/>Wano wao wana wa kimbigalo wa Lea iyamulele Yakobo ako Padani Alamu, wahaleka mndele wake Dina. Wanage na iwazukulu wose kwa wose wakala malongo madatu na ndatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16"/>Gadi na wanage, Sifioni na Hagi na Shuni na Esiboni na Eli na Alodi na Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17"/>Asheli na wanage, Imina na Ishiva na Ishivi na Belia na Sela na lumbu jao. Belia na wanage, Hebeli na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18"/>Wanhu longo na sita ni wana na wazukulu wa Yakobo na Zilipa, mtumwa yagweleligwe Lea na tatake Labani.<verse eid="GEN 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19"/>Laheli kamulelela Yakobo wana wabili Yusufu na Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20"/>Ako Misili Asenati mndele wa Potifela yakalile mulava nhosa wa buga da Oni, kamulelela Yusufu wana wabili wakalile Manase na Efulaimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21"/>Benjamini na wanage, Bela na Bekeli na Ashibeli na Gela na Naamani na Ehi na Loshi na Mupimu na Hupimu na Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22"/>Wanhu wao longo na nane ni wana na wazukulu wa Yakobo waleligwe na Laheli mwehe wake.<verse eid="GEN 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23"/>Dani na mwanage Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24"/>Nafutali na wanage, Yaseeli na Guni na Yeseli na Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25"/>Wanhu wao saba ni wana na wazukulu wa Yakobo yalelile na Biliha, mtumwa wa Laheli iyagweleligwe na Labani tatake.<verse eid="GEN 46:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26"/>Wanhu wose waleligwe mulukolo lwake Yakobo, wakala malongo sita na sita, wahaleka kuwapeta wehe wa wanage. Wanhu awo wose wao wacholile mwiisi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 46:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27"/>Ako Misili Yusufu kakala na wana wabili. Avo, wanhu wose wa ulelo wa Yakobo ako Misili wakala malongo saba.<verse eid="GEN 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na lukolo lwake ako Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28"/>Yakobo kamulongela Yuda yalongole kwa Yusufu yampule waiting'hane ako Gosheni. Viwavikile Gosheni, <verse eid="GEN 46:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29"/>Yusufu kakwela mtuka wa kubululigwa na falasi, kachola kumbokela Izilaeli, tatake, ako Gosheni. Viyamvikile tatake kamfagatila na kalila kwa kipindi kitali. <verse eid="GEN 46:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30"/>Izilaeli kamulongela Yusufu, “Hata sambi nahafa siyo mbuli kwavija nichona kihanga chako na njuwa kamba gweye kwa mgima.”<verse eid="GEN 46:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31"/>Abaho Yusufu kawalongela ndugu zake na wanhu wa mng'anda ya tatake, “Niye nochola kumulongela Falao kamba ndugu zangu na wanhu wa mng'anda ya tatangu wakalile okala mwiisi ya Kanaani wavika. <verse eid="GEN 46:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32"/>Nomulongela kamba mweye mwa wasusilaji na mwiza na ng'ombe na mbuzi na ng'hondolo na vinhu venu vose. <verse eid="GEN 46:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33"/>Avo, Falao yahawakema na kuwauza, ‘Sang'hano yenu choni?’ <verse eid="GEN 46:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34"/>Mmwidike, ‘Siye wasang'hanaji zako tosusila fugo toka muubwanga wetu, kamba viyakalile tataetu.’ Baho kowatogolela mukale ako Gosheni, kwavija kwa wanhu wa Misili wanhu osusila hawawalonda.”<verse eid="GEN 46:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1"/>Avo, Yusufu kachola kumulongela Falao, “Tatangu na ndugu zangu wavika hamoja na ng'hondolo zao na mbuzi zao na ng'ombe zao na vinhu vao vose, walawa mwiisi ya Kanaani, sambi wa ako Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2"/>Yusufu kawasagula ndugu zake watano kawalagusa kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3"/>Falao kawauza, “Sang'hano yenu choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Wao wamwidika, “Siye wasang'hanaji zako twa wasusilaji kamba viyakalile tataetu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4"/>Vivija wamulongela Falao, “Siye wasang'hanaji zako, twiza kukala mwiisi ino kamba wanhu baki kwavija kuna lufilili lwa nzala ng'hani ako Kanaani na kuduhu ndiya kwa fugo zetu. Avo, chonde go mkulu, siye wasang'hanaji zako tokupula tukale hanhu hokemigwa Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5"/>Falao kamulongela Yusufu, “Tatako na ndugu zako weza kumwako gweye, <verse eid="GEN 47:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6"/>na isi yose ya Misili ya mmakono gako. Weke tatako na ndugu zako hanhu hanogile ng'hani mwiisi ino, waleke wakakale ako Gosheni, na kamba kuna wanhu wowose viweli kuwajuwa goya kamba odaha kulolesa goya zifugo, wasagule wakanilolesele fugo zangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7"/>Abaho Yusufu kamgala kwa Falao tatake Yakobo, Yakobo kamtambikila Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8"/>Falao kamuuza Yakobo, “Kuna miyaka mingapi toka uvumbuke?”<verse eid="GEN 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9"/>Yakobo kamwidika Falao, “Miyaka yangu inigweleligwe kamba munhu mbita nzila ni miyaka gana na malongo madatu. Miyaka ayo midodo na imema magazo, na haivikile wingi wa miyaka iwakalile nayo iwahenga zangu kamba wanhu obita nzila.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10"/>Abaho Yakobo kamtambikila Falao, kasegela. <verse eid="GEN 47:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11"/>Avo, Yusufu kawagwaa tatake na ndugu zake hanhu hokemigwa Lamesesi hanhu hanogile ng'hani mwiisi ya Misili, hanhu aho wagweleligwa hawe hao, kamba viyalagize Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12"/>Yusufu kawagwelela ndiya tatake na ndugu zake na lukolo lose lwa tatake kamba viwakalile.<verse eid="GEN 47:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lufilili lwa nzala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13"/>Kukala kuduhu ndiya kila hanhu. Lufilili lwa nzala lukala lwenele kila hanhu mbaka iwatenda wanhu wose mwiisi ya Misili na isi ya Kanaani wanyolile mbuli ya nzala. <verse eid="GEN 47:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14"/>Yusufu keka hamoja sente zose za isi ya Misili na isi ya Kanaani mbuli ya ndiya iwagulile, kazigala zisente azo kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15"/>Sente za wanhu wa Misili na Kanaani vizimalile, wanhu wose wamcholela Yusufu na kumulongela, “Chonde, tugwelele ndiya, sikutufe mgameso gako, kwavija sente zetu zisha.”<verse eid="GEN 47:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16"/>Yusufu kawalongela, “Kamba sente zenu zisha, avo munigwelele fugo zenu na niye nowagwaa ndiya.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17"/>Avo wamgalila Yusufu fugo zao, nayo kawagwaa ndiya na hewo wamgwaa falasi na ng'ombe na ng'hondolo na mbuzi na vihongwe. Avo mwaka awo wose Yusufu kawagwaa ndiya na hewo wamgwaa zifugo.<verse eid="GEN 47:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18"/>Mwaka uyagwe wamcholela kabili Yusufu wamulongela, “Hatukufisa bule, sente zetu zose zisha na fugo zetu zose zako gweye. Avo, go mkulu siye wasang'hanaji zako twabule chochose cha kukugwaa ila siye wenyego na migunda yetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19"/>Habali siye tufe mgameso gako, na migunda yetu sikuilimigwe? Avo, tugule siye na migunda yetu mbuli ya ndiya, na siye na migunda yetu yokuwa mmakono ga Falao. Chonde, tugwelele ndiya ili sikutufe na vivija utugwelele mbeyu mbuli ya migunda yetu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20"/>Avo Yusufu kaigula isi yose ya Misili iwe ya Falao. Kila munhu wa Misili kalondigwa kuuza mgunda wake mbuli ya lufilili lwa nzala, avo isi yose ikala ya Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21"/>Avo, Yusufu kawatenda wanhu wawe watumwa, kulawa mwambu uno wa isi na mwambu uyagwe wa isi ya Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22"/>Lakini Yusufu haigulile bule isi ya walava nhosa, kwavija siku zose wao wagweleligwa ndiya kulawa kwa Falao, wagweleligwa fungu dilondigwa. Lekaavo hawauzile bule migunda yao. <verse eid="GEN 47:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23"/>Yusufu kawalongela wanhu, “Sambi niwagula mweye na migunda yenu mbuli ya Falao, mbeyu azino hano muhande migunda yenu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24"/>Lakini mwahasenga ndiya mna gamafungu matano dimoja mumgwelele Falao, na mafungu mane gasigale gokuwa genu mbuli ya mbeyu kwa migunda yenu na ndiya yenu na wanhu wa mzing'anda zenu na wanenu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25"/>Wanhu wa Misili wamwidika, “Kuhonya ugima wetu, kwavija kututendela ganogile, siye tokuwa watumwa wa Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26"/>Vivo Yusufu viyekile lagizo mwiisi ya Misili na dabaho mbaka sambi, kuwa fungu dimoja mna gamafungu matano ga ndiya yose yagweleligwe Falao. Migunda ya walava nhosa waiyeka ayo haisoligwe na Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siku za kimambukizo za Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27"/>Avo wanhu wa Izilaeli wakala mwiisi ya Misili hanhu hokemigwa Gosheni. Ako wakala na vinhu vingi na wasonga kongezeka ng'hani. <verse eid="GEN 47:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28"/>Yakobo kakala Misili kwa miyaka longo na saba, miyaka yose ya ugima wa Yakobo ikala miyaka gana na malongo mane na saba. <verse eid="GEN 47:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29"/>Kipindi cha Izilaeli kufa vikikalile behi, kamkema mwanage Yusufu na kamulongela, “Kamba koninogela ingiza mkono wako mna gamaungo gangu madeke na uiduwile kamba konitendela ganogile na kotamaniligwa. Sikuunizike mwiisi ya Misili, <verse eid="GEN 47:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30"/>lakini unitambalize hamoja na wahenga zangu, umhape kulawa Misili ukanizike ako kuwazikiligwe hewo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Yusufu kamwidika, “Notenda kamba viulongile.”<verse eid="GEN 47:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31"/>Yakobo kamulongela Yusufu, “Iduwile,” Yusufu kaiduwila. Abaho Izilaeli kaidulika mwambu wa pala wa ulusazi lwake kamtambikila Imulungu.<verse eid="GEN 47:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kowatambikila wanage Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1"/>Kipindi kiyagwe, Yusufu kalongeligwa kamba tatake mtamu. Avo kawasola wanage wabili Manase na Efulaimu kachola nao kwa tatake. <verse eid="GEN 48:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2"/>Yakobo viyalongeligwe, “Mwanago Yusufu keza kukulola,” Izilaeli kawamba kwinuka kakala mulusazi. <verse eid="GEN 48:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3"/>Yakobo kamulongela Yusufu, “Imulungu yeli na Udahi wose kanilawilila ving'halile ako Luzu mwiisi ya Kanaani, kanitenda nimwede. <verse eid="GEN 48:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4"/>Kanongela, ‘Nokutenda ongezeke na kuwatenda muwe wengi. Nokutenda uwe na ulelo onda uwe isi zili na wanhu wengi, na nokugwaa isi ino kamba uhazi kwa ulelo wako milele.’”<verse eid="GEN 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5"/>“Avo, wanago wabili waulelile kuno Misili ning'hali sinavika kumwako okuwa wanangu. Efulaimu na Manase okuwa wangu niye, kamba vija Lubeni na Simeoni viweli wangu. <verse eid="GEN 48:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6"/>Lakini wana onda ulele kumwande okuwa wako. Opata uhazi kubitila Efulaimu na Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7"/>Notenda vivo mbuli ya mamako Laheli. Vinikalile nobwela kulawa Padani heyo kafa behi ya kuvika Efulata mwiisi ya Kanaani. Kandekela lusikisiki, niye nimzika baho behi ya nzila ya kuchola Efulata nayo iyo Beselehemu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8"/>Izilaeli viyawone wanage Yusufu, kauza, “Wano wanage nani?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9"/>Yusufu kamulongela tatake, “Wano wao wana wanigweleligwe na Imulungu hano.” Izilaeli kalonga, “Chonde wagale behi niwatambikile.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10"/>Avo meso ga Izilaeli gakala hagadaha kulola goya mbuli ya uvele. Yusufu kawakwesa behi wanage nayo tatake kawanonela na kuwafagatila. <verse eid="GEN 48:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11"/>Izilaeli kamulongela Yusufu, “Niye nigesa sichona kabili kihanga chako, lakini Imulungu kanhenda niwone wanago vivija. <verse eid="GEN 48:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12"/>Abaho Yusufu kawasegesa wanage mmavindi ga tatake, na kafugama mbaka hasi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13"/>Abaho Yusufu kawasola wanage, Efulaimu kamgoga kwa mkono wa kudila na kamwika mkono wa kumoso wa Izilaeli na Manase kamgoga kwa mkono wa kumoso na kamwika mkono wa kudila wa Izilaeli, na kawagala kumwake. <verse eid="GEN 48:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14"/>Lakini Izilaeli kenula mkono wake wa kudila na kawika mdipala da Efulaimu na kabitiza mkono wake wa kumoso mdipala da Manase hamoja Manase iyo yakalile imkulu. <verse eid="GEN 48:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15"/>Abaho Izilaeli kamtambikila Yusufu, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Imulungu iwamtegeleze wahenga zangu Abulahamu na Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Imulungu yanilongoze muugima wangu wose mbaka lelo,<verse eid="GEN 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16"/>na msenga wa kuulanga yanihonyile na gehile gose yawatambikile wabwanga wano!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Wakemigwe kwa twaga jangu na matwaga ga wahenga zangu Abulahamu na Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">wawe na wana wengi na ulelo mkulu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17"/>Yusufu viyone tatake keka mkono wake wa kudila kudipala da Efulaimu hanogelwe bule, avo kaugoga mkono wa tatake kalonda kuusegesa kudipala da Efulaimu yawike kudipala da Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18"/>Yusufu kamulongela tatake, “Si vivo bule tata! Ino iyo mwana imkulu, chonde wike mkono wako wa kudila kudipala jake.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19"/>Lakini tatake kalema, “Nojuwa mwanangu nojuwa. Manase vivija kokuwa munhu mkulu na kokuwa na wanhu wengi. Lakini imdodo kokuwa munhu mkulu kubanza heyo na wanhu wa ulelo wake okuwa makabila mengi.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20"/>Avo, Izilaeli kawatambikila siku dijo kalonga, “Wanhu wa Izilaeli owatambikila wanhu kubitila matwaga genu, olonga, ‘Imulungu yakutendele ganogile kamba Efulaimu na Manase.’ ” Avo Izilaeli kamtenda Efulaimu munhu mkulu kubanza Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21"/>Abaho Izilaeli kamulongela Yusufu, “Niye sambi nofa. Lakini Imulungu kokuwa hamoja na mweye, na kowabweza mwiisi ya wahenga zenu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22"/>Na niye nokugwaa gweye na siyo ndugu zako mgunda uli na mboji uniwabokile Waamoli kwa sime na upinde wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49"/>
  <para style="s">Yakobo kolonga na wanage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1"/>Yakobo kawakema wanage kawalongela, “Kweseni behi niwalongele gaja gonda gawalawilile baho kumwande.”<verse eid="GEN 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2"/>“Kaleni hamoja mutegeleze, mweye wana wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">nhegelezeni niye Izilaeli tataenu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3"/>“Gweye Lubeni kwa mwanangu wa chaudele, gweye kwa nguvu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">na tunda da ubwanga wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">gweye kuwabanza wayagwe kwa ukulu na nguvu,<verse eid="GEN 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4"/>gweye kuigala na mazi ga sika kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">lakini honda uwe mkulu kabili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">kwavija kumuwasa msang'hanaji wangu yeli kamba mwehe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">gweye kulufitiza lusazi lwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5"/>“Simeoni na Lawi ni ndugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">osang'hanila misime yao kwa kubananga.<verse eid="GEN 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6"/>Lakini niye siilumba nao mna ikija kiwolonda kutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">niye siilumba nao mumting'hano wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">kwavija kwa ng'hasiliki yao wawakoma wanhu na kwa utundu wao wakanha migiha ya ng'ombe.<verse eid="GEN 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7"/>Noiduwila ng'hasiliki yao kwavija ibanza ukwiha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">na kugevuzika kwao kwabule bazi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Nowapwililisa mwiisi ya Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">nowatimulila mwiisi ya Izilaeli.”<verse eid="GEN 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8"/>“Gweye Yuda ndugu zako okugwaa nhogolwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Wanhu wakwihile kowabota singo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">na ndugu zako okufugamila.<verse eid="GEN 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9"/>Gweye Yuda mwanangu kuigala na simba yapatile kija kiyasakile na kubwela hoyokala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Kamba simba koigolola na kutambalala hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">simba yeli na nguvu nani yonda yamulamuse?<verse eid="GEN 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10"/>Mkongoja wa ukulu honda usegele mmakono ga Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">na mkongoja wa utawala honda usegele muulelo wake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">mbaka vonda yeze ija mwenyego</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">heyo makabila gose gomtegeleza.<verse eid="GEN 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11"/>Kwavija kokuwa na mizabibu mingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">komfunga kihongwe wake mumzabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">ili yaje majani ga mzabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Kwavija kokuwa na divai nyingi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">kofuwila viwalo vake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">na makanzu gake kogafuwila mna idivai inogile ng'hani.<verse eid="GEN 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12"/>Meso gake madung'hu mbuli ya kung'wa divai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">na meno gake mazelu mbuli ya kung'wa maziwa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13"/>“Zabuloni kokala mwiimwhani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">mwhani yake yokuwa hanhu ha kwika ngalawa ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Isi yake yoibakana na isi ya Sidoni.”<verse eid="GEN 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14"/>“Isakali kaigala na kihongwe yeli na nguvu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">yotambalala mna zimbahasha zake.<verse eid="GEN 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15"/>Kaona kamba hanhu ha kubwihila hanoga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">na kaona isi inoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">kainama mgongo wake yapape mzigo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">kawa mtumwa kusang'hana sang'hano ndala.”<verse eid="GEN 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16"/>“Dani kokuwa msemi wa wanhu zake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">kokuwa kamba makabila gayagwe ga Izilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17"/>Dani kokuwa mgendela hasi mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">mgendela hasi yeli na sumu mumgwazo wa nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">yoluma visiginho va falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">nayo munhu yamkwelile kogwa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18"/>“Go, Mndewa Imulungu nobeta unihonye.”<verse eid="GEN 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19"/>“Gadi kokumbigwa na wabavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">lakini heyo kowasondelela kukisogo na kowabunda.”<verse eid="GEN 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20"/>“Isi yookala Asheli yolela ndiya ng'hani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">nayo kolava ndiya iyolonda mndewa.”<verse eid="GEN 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21"/>“Nafutali kaigala na mhala yalekesigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">yolela wana wanogile.”<verse eid="GEN 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22"/>“Yusufu kaigala na biki dilela matunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">biki dilela mumgwazo wa nzasa, matambi gake gokwenela mbaka mna uluwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23"/>Wanhu oitowa kwa migoha wammemela ng'hani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">wampigisila migoha na wamgaza.<verse eid="GEN 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24"/>Lakini upinde wake ukala goya mmakono gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">na makono gake gang'hali na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa udahi wa ija Yodaha wa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">na Msusilaji na Dibwe da Izilaeli,<verse eid="GEN 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25"/>mbuli ya Imulungu wa tatako, yakutazile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">mbuli ya Imulungu yeli na Udahi wose yakutendile umwede</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">kwa mbuli zinogile za kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">na kumweda kulawa hasi mwiibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">kumweda kwa kuwa na fugo nyingi na wana heleketwaa.<verse eid="GEN 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26"/>Kumweda kwa tatako kukula ng'hani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">kubanza kumweda kwa vigongo va umwaka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Kumweda ako kuwe kudipala da Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">kuwe mkihanga cha ayo yatendigwe mkulu kwa ndugu zake.”<verse eid="GEN 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27"/>“Benjamini kaigala na mbwizi mkali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">imitondo koja kiyasakile na ichungulo kogola kija kiyasakile.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28"/>Gano gago makabila longo na mabili ga Izilaeli na zino azo mbuli ziyalongile tatao kuwatambikila kamba viilondigwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29"/>Abaho Izilaeli kawalagiza vino wanage, “Niye sambi nofa na kuilumba na wahenga zangu wafile umwaka, nizikeni hamoja na wavele zangu mna imhango ili mumgunda wa Efuloni Muhiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30"/>ako Makipela, mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Mamule, mwiisi ya Kanaani. Abulahamu kagula mhango na mgunda awo kwa Efuloni Muhiti, uwe mhango ya kuzikila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31"/>Kuko kuwazikigwe Abulahamu na mwehe wake Sala, vivija kuko kuwazikigwe Isaka na mwehe wake Lebeka na vivija kuko nimzikile mwehe wangu Lea. <verse eid="GEN 49:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32"/>Mgunda awo na mhango ayo viguligwa kwa Wahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33"/>Yakobo viyamambukize kuwalagiza wanage keka magulu gake mulusazi, kakanha loho, kailumba na wahenga zake wafile umwaka.<verse eid="GEN 49:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1"/>Baho Yusufu kaibwanha mwenyego kamfagatila tatake kalila na kumnonela. <verse eid="GEN 50:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2"/>Yusufu kawalagiza waganga wambake tatake Izilaeli dawa ili sikuyakole, na wao watenda vivo. <verse eid="GEN 50:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3"/>Kamba viwatendaga, watenda sang'hano ayo kwa siku malongo mane. Na wanhu wa Misili wamuyalalila kwa siku malongo saba.<verse eid="GEN 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4"/>Siku za kumuyalalila vizishile, Yusufu kawalongela wanhu wa Falao, “Kamba moninogela nipulileni kwa Falao mulongeleni, <verse eid="GEN 50:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5"/>‘Tatangu viyakalile kolonda kufa kanongela niiduwile kamba nomzika kudipanga diyatandile ako Kanaani. Avo chonde ndeke nichole hamzike tatangu, abaho nobwela.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6"/>Falao kamwidika, “Genda kamzike tatako, kamba viulongile kotenda.”<verse eid="GEN 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7"/>Avo, Yusufu kachola kumzika tatake. Wasang'hanaji na vilongozi wa ng'anda ya Falao na vilongozi wa wanhu wa Misili wachola na Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 50:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8"/>Wanhu wa mng'anda yake na ndugu zake na wanhu wa lukolo lwa tatake wachola nayo. Wana wadodo na ng'ombe na ng'hondolo na mbuzi, wao wasigale ako Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 50:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9"/>Vivija wanhu okwela falasi na wanhu okwela mituka ibululigwa na falasi wailumba nayo. Kukala na wanhu wengi.<verse eid="GEN 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10"/>Viwavikile kulubuga lwa kubigila uhemba lwa Atadi, mwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani waiyalala kwa bwembwe, Yusufu nayo kamtendela mwenekwaga matanga ga siku saba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11"/>Wanhu wa Kanaani wakalile baho viwone kuiyalala kwao aho hana ulubuga lwa kubigila uhemba lwa Atadi walonga, “Kuiyalala kuno kwa Wamisili kukula ng'hani.” Lekaavo hanhu aho behi na lwanda lwa Yolidani hakemigwa Abeli Misili.<verse eid="GEN 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12"/>Wana wa Yakobo wamtendela tatao kamba viyawalagize. <verse eid="GEN 50:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13"/>Wamgala mbaka isi ya Kanaani, wamzika mwiimhango ikalile mumgunda ako Makipela, mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wa Mamule. Mhango na mgunda awo Abulahamu kaugula kwa Efuloni Muhiti, ili hawe hanhu ha kuzikila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14"/>Viwamambukize kumzika tatao, Yusufu kabwela Misili hamoja na ndugu zake na wanhu wose wacholile hamoja nayo muumwanza wa kumzika tatake.<verse eid="GEN 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yusufu kowalongela ukweli ndugu zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15"/>Viimalile ndilo ya tatao, ndugu zake Yusufu wailongela, “Sengine ndugu yetu Yusufu kagevuzika na kogabweza gehile gose gatumtendele.” <verse eid="GEN 50:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16"/>Avo wamgalila Yusufu usenga, walonga, “Tatako kaleka usi uno yang'hali hanakufa, <verse eid="GEN 50:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17"/>‘Mulongeleni vino Yusufu mbuli yangu, chonde ugele kumgongo nzambi ziwakutendele ndugu zako, kwavija wakutendela gehile ng'hani.’ Avo sambi chonde ugele kumgongo nzambi zitukutendele siye wasang'hanaji wa Imulungu wa tatako.” Yusufu viyapatile usenga uno kalila.<verse eid="GEN 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18"/>Abaho ndugu zake wamcholela, wamfugamila mbaka hasi walonga, “Lola siye twa watumwa zako.”<verse eid="GEN 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19"/>Lakini Yusufu kawalongela, “Sikumudumbe, vino niye na Imulungu? <verse eid="GEN 50:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20"/>Mweye mukala mulondile kunhendela gehile, lakini Imulungu kagesa kutenda ganogile ili wanhu wengi wawe wagima kamba vimona sambi. <verse eid="GEN 50:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21"/>Avo, sikumudumbe, niye nowagwaa ndiya hamoja na wanenu.” Avo kawahoza mizoyo na kalonga nao vinogile.<verse eid="GEN 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22"/>Yusufu kagendelela kukala Misili hamoja na wanhu wa lukolo lwa tatake. Yusufu kakala na miyaka gana na longo. <verse eid="GEN 50:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23"/>Yusufu kamweda kuwona wana na wazukulu wa mwanage Efulaimu. Vivija wana wa Makili mwana wa Manase kawabokela mmahaza gake. <verse eid="GEN 50:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24"/>Abaho Yusufu kawalongela ndugu zake, “Niye sambi nofa, lakini Imulungu kowezila tu kuwataza. Kowalava mwiisi ino na kowagala mwiisi iyawalongele kowagwaa Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25"/>Abaho Yusufu kawatenda wana wa Izilaeli waiduwile, kalonga, “Imulungu yahawezila kuwataza, soleni mizege yangu kulawa hano.” <verse eid="GEN 50:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26"/>Avo, Yusufu kafa ako Misili, akuno mvele wa miyaka gana na longo. Na hewo walubaka dawa lukuli lwake ili sikulukole, walwika kudisanduku ako Misili.<verse eid="GEN 50:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50"/>
</usx>
